  "Abyss Guards, Prism Basilisk, or the Emperor may have an active guard. Hero skills remove guard faster than automatic attacks.": "深淵守衛、棱鏡蛇怪或帝皇可能有活躍的守衛。英雄技能消除守衛的速度比自動攻擊更快。",
