  "Aim {angle}° from center. Left/Right adjust; Space or Enter fires.": "瞄準距中心 {angle}°。左/右調節；空間或進入火災。",
  "Aim {value}%": "目標 {value}%",
  "Aim against wind drift and re-read moving rows after every shot.": "瞄準風漂移並在每次射擊後重新讀取移動的行。",
  "Aim ahead of a quick basket": "瞄準前方快速投籃",
  "Aim and ricochet: drag from the launcher to see the initial path, then release. The main orb and one weaker echo orb travel at related angles. Wall banks can cross multiple lanes or reach a target hidden behind another formation. Split Orb can add a third projectile, while Piercing Shine shortens the delay before one orb can hit the same target again.": "瞄準和跳彈：從發射器拖曳以查看初始路徑，然後釋放。主球和一個較弱的迴聲球以相關角度行進。牆岸可以跨越多條車道或到達隱藏在另一個編隊後面的目標。分裂球可以添加第三個彈，而穿透光芒可以縮短一個球再次擊中同一目標之前的延遲。",
  "Aim animal orbs through crystal fortress rooms, plan bounce routes, grow your base, and prepare for boss waves.": "透過水晶堡壘房間瞄準動物球，規劃彈跳路線，擴大你的基地，並為 Boss 浪潮做好準備。",
  "Aim at a side wall to bank the shot": "瞄準側壁進行射擊",
  "Aim at matching bubbles to form a group": "瞄準匹配氣泡以形成一組",
  "Aim Fia's prism stream through multiplier gates, grow a spirit battalion, and break 30 evolving shadow fortresses.": "瞄準 Fia 的棱鏡流穿過倍增門，培養一支精神軍團，並打破 30 個不斷演變的暗影堡壘。",
  "Aim near another {name} to merge.": "瞄準另一個 {name} 附近進行合併。",
  "Aim spirit orbs through 30 ricochet-defense routes with special enemies, moving mirror pylons, six unique Bosses, and local fortress growth.": "瞄準精神球穿越 30 條跳彈防禦路線，其中包括特殊的敵人、移動鏡塔、六個獨特的 Boss 和當地的要塞增長。",
  "Aim the spirit orb through the crystal fortress.": "將靈魂球瞄準水晶堡壘。",
  "Aim through 30 rescue levels with reactive blockers, wind, moving rows, and four power bubbles.": "利用反應性阻擋物、風、移動行和四個能量泡泡，瞄準 30 個救援關卡。",
  "Aim through a moving moon gate that changes the bank corridor.": "瞄準改變銀行走廊的移動月門。",
  "Aim through moving pylons while chargers mark lanes.": "瞄準移動中的塔架，同時充電器標記車道。",
  "Aim with touch, pointer movement, or Left and Right, then drop with touch, Space, or Enter.": "透過觸碰、指針移動或左右瞄準，然後透過觸控、空白鍵或 Enter 落下。",
