  "An Abyss Guard, Prism Basilisk, or Emperor guard may be active. Skills remove guard faster than automatic attacks.": "深淵守衛、棱鏡蛇怪或帝皇守衛可能處於活動狀態。技能消除防禦的速度比自動攻擊更快。",
  "An exact Sonar scan reveals the real outcome on both sides, but Sonar, the one-hit Shock Shield, and fish-combat pulse tools draw from the same four-point battery. Some routes alter those costs, jam Sonar in specified zones, or restore power through air pockets, relics, currents, or defeated guardians. Information and protection therefore compete with later combat readiness.": "精確的聲納掃描揭示了雙方的真實結果，但聲納、一擊衝擊盾和魚戰脈衝工具均使用相同的四點電池。有些路線會改變這些成本，在指定區域幹擾聲納，或透過氣穴、遺跡、水流或擊敗的守護者恢復電力。因此，資訊和保護與後期戰備相競爭。",
  "An expedition starts with 90 seconds. Boat Range adds five seconds per level above Level 1. Hold the water or Space to charge, then release. A stronger cast shortens the wait before the bite, so a quick full cast leaves more expedition time for line control.": "探險從 90 秒開始。船靶場在 1 級以上每等級增加 5 秒。按住水或空間充電，然後釋放。更強的拋投可以縮短咬合前的等待時間，因此快速的完整拋投可以為線路控制留下更多的探險時間。",
  "An opening preview is followed by shuffles after mistakes.": "開場預覽之後是錯誤後的洗牌。",
