  "Animal 2048 is a 30-mission grid strategy game hosted by Moon Cap Orla. Every swipe moves the complete board. Matching animals evolve into the next tier, so each direction must protect open spaces while building the mission target.": "Animal 2048 是一款由 Moon Cap Orla 主辦的 30 個任務的網格策略遊戲。每次滑動都會移動整個板。配對的動物會進化到下一層，因此每個方向都必須在建立任務目標的同時保護開放空間。",
  "Animal 2048 is a turn-based forest strategy puzzle hosted by Moon Cap Orla. Every direction moves the complete 4 by 4 board, so a single swipe can open space, build several evolution chains, or trap the animals needed for the mission goal.": "Animal 2048 是由 Moon Cap Orla 主辦的回合製森林策略解謎遊戲。每個方向都會移動整個 4 x 4 板，因此一次滑動即可打開空間，建立多個進化鏈，或捕獲任務目標所需的動物。",
