  "Animal Skyport Dispatch | WeightPlay": "動物天空港快訊| WeightPlay",
  "Animal Skyport Dispatch is a five-shift route-management strategy game set at Cloudline Skyport. Read each arriving animal airship, draw a safe approach to a compatible dock, assign limited service resources, and finish the shift before congestion or missed flights reach the failure limit.": "Animal Skyport Dispatch 是一款以 Cloudline Skyport 為背景的五班路線管理策略遊戲。閱讀每艘到達的動物飛艇，制定到達兼容碼頭的安全方法，分配有限的服務資源，並在擁堵或錯過航班達到故障極限之前完成輪班。",
  "Animal Skyspire Drop": "動物天空尖塔掉落",
  "Animal Skyspire Drop | WeightPlay": "動物天空尖塔掉落 | WeightPlay",
  "Animal Snack Blocks": "動物零食塊",
  "Animal Spectrum Pulse": "動物頻譜脈衝",
  "Animal Spectrum Pulse | WeightPlay": "動物頻譜脈衝| WeightPlay",
  "Animal Spectrum Pulse is a 30-tower one-touch precision arcade adventure. Guide Panko's spectrum spirit upward, read the emblem segment nearest the spirit at the bottom scan marker, and pulse only when the current wave, sun, diamond, or paw identity is aligned.": "Animal Spectrum Pulse 是一款 30 座塔的一鍵式精準街機冒險遊戲。將 Panko 的光譜精神向上引導，讀取底部掃描標記處最接近精神的徽章部分，並且僅在當前波浪、太陽、鑽石或爪子身份對齊時發出脈衝。",
  "Animal Star Memory": "動物星星記憶",
  "Animal Star Memory - How to Play": "動物星星記憶 - 怎麼玩",
  "Animal Star Memory - Memory Matching Game": "動物明星記憶 - 記憶配對遊戲",
  "Animal Star Memory - WeightPlay": "動物星星記憶 - WeightPlay",
  "Animal Star Memory game guide": "動物星星記憶遊戲指南",
  "Animal Star Memory is a 30-stage picture-matching journey through the night sky. Players help six friendly Star Keepers reconnect animal constellations by finding matching cards. The campaign begins with classic pairs, then changes how memory works through opening previews, moon shuffles after mistakes, required animal order, and constellation shifts after successful matches. Every fifth stage is a Keeper Check, and Stage 30 combines all four advanced rules on a full twelve-pair board.": "《動物之星回憶》是一場穿越夜空的 30 個階段的圖片匹配之旅。玩家透過找到匹配的卡片來幫助六名友好的星星守護者重新連接動物星座。戰役從經典配對開始，然後透過開場預覽、錯誤後的月亮洗牌、所需的動物順序以及成功比賽後的星座變化來改變記憶的運作方式。每第五個階段都是一次守護者檢查，第 30 階段將所有四個高級規則結合在一個完整的 12 對棋盤上。",
  "Animal Star Memory may support visual recall, attention, flexible updating, and following a short sequence. Adults can ask which locations are still reliable after a shuffle or why an ordered pair should be found first. The game has no combat, account requirement, public ranking, or advertising request on this Kids page. Stars and the Skill Report are encouraging local game feedback, not an intelligence, school, health, or developmental assessment.": "動物明星記憶可以支持視覺回憶、注意力、靈活更新和遵循短序列。成年人可以詢問哪些位置在洗牌後仍然可靠，或者為什麼應該先找到有序的對。該遊戲在此兒童頁面上沒有戰鬥、帳戶要求、公開排名或廣告請求。明星和技能報告鼓勵本地遊戲回饋，而不是智力、學校、健康或發展評估。",
  "Animal Starlight Trails": "動物星光軌跡",
  "Animal Training": "動物訓練",
  "Animal Triple Match": "動物三連賽",
  "Animal upgrades": "動物升級",
  "Animal Upgrades": "動物升級",
  "Animal Variety": "動物品種",
  "Animal Vine Rescue": "動物藤救援",
  "Animal Vine Rescue - Complete Game Guide": "Animal Vine Rescue - 完整遊戲指南",
  "Animal Vine Rescue - WeightPlay": "動物藤救援 - WeightPlay",
  "Animal Vine Rescue game guide": "動物藤救援遊戲指南",
  "Animal Vine Rescue is a 30-stage animal physics puzzle about cutting a hanging fruit free, steering a leaf trampoline, and landing the fruit in a waiting animal's basket. The campaign is divided into six five-stage rescue lessons. Later routes add moving baskets, upper and lower wind layers, wind that reverses after a bounce, two-bounce deliveries, narrower catch zones, and two- or three-fruit picnic orders. Every fifth stage is a friendly Panko Check that combines the current lesson without adding combat or time pressure.": "《Animal Vine Rescue》是一款包含 30 個階段的動物物理謎題，內容包括砍掉懸掛的水果、操縱樹葉蹦床以及將水果放入等待的動物籃子中。此次活動共分為六節、五階段的救援課。後來的路線增加了移動籃子、上下風層、彈跳後反轉的風、兩次彈跳交付、更窄的捕獲區域以及兩到三個水果野餐訂單。每第五個階段都是一次友好的 Panko Check，它結合了當前的課程，而不增加戰鬥或時間壓力。",
  "Animal Vine Rescue is a 30-stage physics puzzle about cutting a hanging fruit free, steering a leaf trampoline, and landing the fruit in an animal's basket. Six five-stage lessons add moving baskets, wind layers, reversing wind, two-bounce deliveries, narrow catches, soft leaves, and multi-fruit picnic orders. Every fifth stage is a friendly Panko Check without combat or time pressure. The leaf remains movable after Cut, so success depends on continuous guidance.": "《Animal Vine Rescue》是一個 30 個階段的物理謎題，涉及砍掉懸掛的水果、操縱樹葉蹦床以及將水果落入動物的籃子中。六個五階段課程增加了移動籃子、風層、反向風、兩次彈跳交付、狹窄捕獲、柔軟葉子和多水果野餐訂單。每第五階段都是一次友好的 Panko Check，沒有戰鬥或時間壓力。葉子在切割後仍保持活動狀態，因此成功取決於持續的引導。",
  "Animal Vine Rescue may support timing, visual prediction, hand-eye coordination, focus, and simple problem solving. Adults can ask where the basket will move or why the second bounce needs a different leaf position. There is no timer, advertising, account requirement, ranking pressure, or hostile combat. Stars and saved progress are playful local feedback, not a formal ability test, diagnosis, or school assessment.": "Animal Vine Rescue 可以支援計時、視覺預測、手眼協調、專注和簡單的問題解決。成人可以詢問籃子將移動到哪裡，或者為什麼第二次彈跳需要不同的葉子位置。沒有計時器、廣告、帳戶要求、排名壓力或敵對戰鬥。星星和保存的進度是有趣的本地回饋，而不是正式的能力測試、診斷或學校評估。",
  "Animal Vine Rescue may support timing, visual prediction, hand-eye coordination, focus, and simple problem solving. An adult can ask where a moving basket will be when the fruit returns or why a second bounce needs a different leaf position. There is no timer, advertising, account requirement, ranking pressure, or hostile combat. Stars and saved progress are playful local feedback, not a formal ability test, diagnosis, or school assessment.": "Animal Vine Rescue 可以支援計時、視覺預測、手眼協調、專注和簡單的問題解決。成年人可以詢問當水果返回時移動的籃子將在哪裡，或者為什麼第二次彈跳需要不同的葉子位置。沒有計時器、廣告、帳戶要求、排名壓力或敵對戰鬥。星星和保存的進度是有趣的本地回饋，而不是正式的能力測試、診斷或學校評估。",
