  "Animal Word Trails": "動物文字蹤跡",
  "Animal Word Trails - WeightPlay": "動物文字蹤跡 - WeightPlay",
  "Animal Word Trails is a calm 30-stage reading puzzle about following animal clues and connecting adjacent letters or characters into a complete word path.": "Animal Word Trails 是一款平靜的 30 階段閱讀謎題，旨在追蹤動物線索並將相鄰字母或字元連接成完整的單字路徑。",
  "Animal Word Trails is a ten-trail reading puzzle. Connect adjacent letter or character tiles to find four animal or habitat words, reveal clue cards, and complete the local-language album.": "Animal Word Trails 是一款包含十條線索的閱讀謎題。連接相鄰的字母或字元圖塊，找到四個動物或棲息地單詞，揭示線索卡，並完成當地語言相簿。",
  "Animal Zoo Idle": "動物動物園放置",
  "Animal Zoo Idle - How to Play": "動物動物園放置 - 如何玩",
  "Animal Zoo Idle - WeightPlay": "動物動物園空閒 - WeightPlay",
  "Animal Zoo Idle game guide": "動物動物園放置遊戲指南",
  "Animal Zoo Idle is a gentle continuous park-management game with 30 persistent milestones. Visitors enter the meadow, buy tickets, and gradually fill a ticket box while the player cares for animals, improves three facilities, expands the gate, and arranges habitats. Lions, giraffes, elephants, pandas, penguins, rabbits, foxes, koalas, tigers, rhinos, crocodiles, and bears can eventually join the same saved park. Milestones track all progress at once, so children can choose what to improve without entering or unlocking numbered levels.": "Animal Zoo Idle 是一款溫和的連續公園管理遊戲，具有 30 個持久的里程碑。遊客進入草地，購買門票，逐漸填滿一個票箱，同時玩家照顧動物，完善三個設施，擴建大門，佈置棲息地。獅子、長頸鹿、大象、熊貓、企鵝、兔子、狐狸、無尾熊、老虎、犀牛、鱷魚和熊最終都可以加入同一個受保護的公園。里程碑會立即追蹤所有進度，因此孩子可以選擇要改進的內容，而無需進入或解鎖編號等級。",
  "Animal Zoo Idle is a gentle park-management game built around 30 saved challenges. Visitors enter the meadow, buy tickets, and fill a ticket box while the player cares for animals, improves the Snack Stand, View Deck, and Keeper Post, expands the gate, and arranges habitats. Twelve animals can eventually live in the park. Every fifth challenge is a friendly review, giving the continuing economy a clear six-part journey from the first ticket collection to the Grand Safari Festival.": "Animal Zoo Idle 是一款溫和的公園管理遊戲，圍繞著 30 個已保存的挑戰構建。遊客進入草地，購買門票並填滿票箱，而玩家則照顧動物，改善小吃攤、觀景台和飼養員柱，擴大大門並佈置棲息地。十二隻動物最終可以在公園裡生活。每五個挑戰都是友善的評論，為持續的經濟提供了從第一次取票到大狩獵節的清晰的六部分旅程。",
