  "Barriers belong to the route rather than an enemy army. Every fifth level is a Safari Check that recombines the region’s skills. Grand Safari Reunion frees the final three animals and ends the authored campaign.": "障礙屬於路線而不是敵軍。每第五級就是 Safari 檢查，重新組合該地區的技能。 Grand Safari Reunion 釋放了最後三隻動物並結束了策劃的活動。",
