  "Battle start: all allies gain Lv max HP and HP. On its turn, all allies gain a Lv shield.": "戰鬥開始：我軍全體獲得最大生命值Lv和生命值。輪到時，所有盟友都會獲得 Lv 護盾。",
  "Battle start: gains a Lv shield. On its turn, all allies gain a Lv shield. Faint: shields the next ally.": "戰鬥開始：獲得Lv護盾。輪到時，所有盟友都會獲得 Lv 護盾。微弱：保護下一個盟友。",
