  "Bestias veloces": "猛獸",
  "Bestias veloces que recorren los carriles. Coloca guardianes antes de que aparezcan.": "野獸會快速追擊卡里萊斯。 Coloca Guardianes antes de que aparezcan。",
  "Bestwert {score} / {total}": "貝斯特沃特 {score} / {total}",
  "Bestwert: {score}": "貝斯特沃特：{score}",
  "Betreten": "貝特雷滕",
  "Better gates bring more visitors and raise ticket income.": "更好的登機口可以帶來更多的遊客並提高門票收入。",
  "Better snacks raise ticket income.": "更好的小吃可以提高門票收入。",
  "Between rooms, three free blessings are always available. Spending three Diamonds replaces all three with stronger versions once during that run. The action shows the exact balance change and requires a second confirmation.": "房間之間，常備三件免費祝福。在此輪運行中，花費三顆鑽石即可將所有三顆鑽石替換為更強的版本。該操作顯示了確切的餘額變化，並且需要第二次確認。",
  "Bevorzuge einen Schatz, dessen Entfernung mehrere verdeckte Objekte freilegt.": "Bevorzuge einen Schatz, dessen Entfernung mehrere verdeckte Objekte freilegt.",
  "Bewegliche Galerie": "貝韋利切畫廊",
  "Beyond the vegetable beds of Clover Yard lies a chain of six garden regions that once shared sunlight, seeds, and water. A confused parade of wild beasts has begun crossing those paths at the busiest time of the season. The animals are not villains: healers are trying to keep their herd moving, burrowers follow underground roots, and sun thieves collect any bright energy they find. If too many reach the cottage gate, the young plants will be trampled. The player becomes the yard keeper and organizes four trained animal guards to hold five lanes without hurting the garden itself.": "在 Clover Yard 的菜床之外，是一連串的六個花園區域，它們曾經共享陽光、種子和水。在這個季節最繁忙的時候，一群混亂的野獸開始穿過這些小路。這些動物不是惡棍：治療者試圖讓他們的獸群保持移動，穴居者追隨地下樹根，而太陽竊賊則收集他們發現的任何明亮能量。如果太多到達了小屋門口，幼苗就會被踐踏。玩家扮演庭院管理員，組織四名訓練有素的動物守衛守衛五個車道，同時不傷害花園本身。",
  "Biblioteca Estelar": "埃斯特拉圖書館",
  "Bien. Desliza suavemente y permanece en SEGURA hasta capturarlo.": "嗯。 Desliza suavemente y permanece en SEGURA hasta capturarlo。",
