  "Blocks never rotate, jump, or leave the board. The challenge is deciding which temporary moves create room for the decisive final slide.": "方塊永遠不會旋轉、跳躍或離開棋盤。挑戰在於決定哪些臨時措施為決定性的最後幻燈片創造空間。",
