  "Boar columns pressure one route.": "野豬縱隊壓一路。",
  "Boar guardian": "野豬守護者",
  "Boar Hollow": "野豬谷",
  "Boar Ring": "野豬戒指",
  "Boar Warning": "野豬警告",
  "Board every listed passenger to save stars and unlock exactly the next route.": "登上每位列出的乘客以保存星星並準確解鎖下一條路線。",
  "Board every listed passenger to save stars and unlock the next route.": "登上每位列出的乘客以保存星星並解鎖下一條路線。",
  "Board six shape friends across 30 routes with outline, moving, memory, and Boarding Pass rules.": "透過輪廓、移動、記憶和登機證規則，登上 30 條航線的 6 位形狀朋友。",
  "Board states are part of each authored mission. Rubble cannot be occupied. Root Snare prevents the affected hero's next movement choice. Tide moves a unit one legal cell after the enemy turn. Burn damages a hero standing on it, while a one-use Cooling Rune restores Energy and clears active burn tiles. Orbit Runes rotate units around the outer ring. In Six-Rune Locks, three heroes must occupy linked Seal cells to remove the enemy ward; attacking through the ward loses one damage.": "董事會狀態是每個授權任務的一部分。瓦礫不能被佔用。根網會阻止受影響英雄的下一個動作選擇。潮汐在敵人回合後將單位移動一個合法單元。燃燒會對站在其上的英雄造成傷害，而一次性冷卻符文可以恢復能量並清除活躍的燃燒瓷磚。軌道符文圍繞外環旋轉單位。在六符鎖中，三名英雄必須佔領相連的封印單元才能移除敵方守衛；穿過守衛進行攻擊會損失 1 點傷害。",
  "Board states belong to missions. Rubble blocks occupation; Root Snare prevents the next move; Tide shifts a unit after the enemy turn; Burn hurts heroes; Cooling Rune restores Energy and clears fire; Orbit rotates the outer ring. In Six-Rune Locks, three heroes must occupy linked Seals to remove a damage-reducing ward.": "董事會狀態屬於任務。瓦礫塊佔領；根部圈套阻止下一步行動；敵人回合後，部隊的潮汐會改變；燒傷傷害英雄；冷卻符文恢復能量並清除火焰；軌道使外環旋轉。在六符鎖中，三位英雄必須佔領相連的封印才能移除一個減傷結界。",
  "Boarded passengers, retries, and progress in this run will reset.": "本次運轉的登機乘客、重試和進度將重設。",
  "Boarding Pass": "登機證",
  "Boarding Pass routes require the passenger to be selected before choosing a car.": "登機證路線要求乘客在選擇車輛之前進行選擇。",
  "Boards 1-5 teach standard access through grid, diamond, terrace, bridge, and stacked layouts.": "板 1-5 教授透過網格、菱形、露臺、橋樑和堆疊佈局的標準來存取。",
  "Boards 1-5: Open Path.": "板 1-5：開放路徑。",
  "Boards 11-15 add two starred family rescues; Board 15 begins with a deliberate no-move Shuffle lesson.": "第 11-15 版新增了兩項明星家庭救援；第 15 盤以刻意的不動洗牌課程開始。",
  "Boards 11-15: Family Rescue.": "第 11-15 版：家庭救援。",
  "Boards 16-20 alternate available A/B patrol routes through Arctic pyramid and sanctuary layouts.": "16-20 號板交替使用 A/B 巡邏路線穿越北極金字塔和保護區佈局。",
  "Boards 16-20: Patrol Trail.": "第 16-20 板：巡邏路線。",
  "Boards 21-25 combine trail seals and family rescues.": "第 21 至 25 塊板結合了小徑海豹救援和家庭救援。",
  "Boards 21-25: Ranger Trial.": "第 21-25 局：遊騎兵審判。",
  "Boards 26-30 combine seals, rescues, and alternating patrol routes; Board 30 uses twelve pairs over three layers.": "26-30 號板結合了海豹突擊、救援和交替巡邏路線；板 30 在三層上使用十二對。",
  "Boards 26-30: Grand Reserve.": "第 26-30 板：Grand Reserve。",
  "Boards 6-10 introduce diamond keys and sealed inner pairs.": "第 6-10 板介紹了菱形鍵和密封內部對。",
  "Boards 6-10: Trail Seal.": "第 6-10 板：蹤跡密封。",
  "Boards contain eight to twelve true pairs over one, two, or three layers. Pictures remain visible, so the challenge is access planning rather than memory.": "電路板在一層、兩層或三層上包含八到十二對真值對。圖片仍然可見，因此挑戰在於存取規劃而不是記憶體。",
  "Boars accelerate after losing armor.": "野豬失去護甲後會加速。",
  "Boars pause under a yellow warning, then cross the arena quickly. Magma Tusk Colossus resists damage until its charge creates a short opening.": "野豬隊在黃色警告下暫停，然後快速穿過競技場。岩漿獠牙巨像可以抵抗傷害，直到它的衝鋒形成一個短暫的開口。",
  "Boars pause, flash, then charge instead of walking steadily.": "野豬會停下來、閃現，然後衝鋒，而不是平穩行走。",
  "Boars strain a single blocker.": "公豬拉傷了一個阻斷劑。",
