  "Bombs always deal their remaining value. A monster in your lane deals its remaining health; an avoided monster still deals 1.": "炸彈總是會發揮其剩餘價值。你車道上的怪物會處理其剩餘生命值；被躲避的怪物仍會造成 1 點傷害。",
