  "Bookstack Gates": "書庫門",
  "Boom Mane Leo": "博姆·馬內·利奧",
  "Boom Mane Leo guards the wall outside WeightPlay's enchanted school-supply vault. Wild boars, trickster hyenas, armored rhinos, charging buffalo, hawks, bears, tigers, and crocodiles are drawn toward the magic stored inside its pencils, rulers, and erasers. Leo cannot leave the wall unprotected, so the player patrols its width, keeps the automatic weapons aligned with incoming lanes, and repairs damage between expeditions.": "Boom Mane Leo 守護著WeightPlay 魔法學校用品庫外的牆。野豬、狡猾的鬣狗、裝甲犀牛、衝鋒的水牛、鷹、熊、老虎和鱷魚都被它的鉛筆、尺和橡皮擦中儲存的魔法所吸引。 Leo 不能讓城牆處於不受保護的狀態，因此玩家會在城牆的寬度上巡邏，保持自動武器與進入的車道對齊，並在探險之間修復損壞。",
  "Boom Mane Leo has opened a forest reading trail where animal clues have been scattered across tile boards. Each correct path restores a clue card to the habitat album. Completing all ten trails rebuilds the forest, safari, ocean, Arctic, and mountain sections of the guidebook.": "Boom Mane Leo 開闢了一條森林閱讀小徑，瓷磚板上散佈著動物線索。每條正確的路徑都會將一張線索卡恢復到棲息地相簿中。完成所有十條路線後，將重建指南中的森林、野生動物園、海洋、北極和山區部分。",
  "Boom Mane Leo, Spark Paw Fia, Moon Cap Orla, and Moss Shell Taro enter as a rotating hero team. Every fifth trial is a regional checkpoint. Defeating Void Crown Emperor in Trial 30 closes the final gate; the campaign creates no hidden Trial 31.": "Boom Mane Leo、Spark Paw Fia、Moon Cap Orla 和 Moss Shell Taro 作為輪換英雄隊伍加入。每五個試驗就是一個區域檢查站。在第30試煉中擊敗虛空皇帝關閉了最後的大門；該活動沒有創建隱藏的審判 31。",
  "Boom Mane Leo, Spark Paw Fia, Moon Cap Orla, and Moss Shell Taro enter the gates as a rotating hero team. A cleared trial stabilizes one step of the road and saves the next card. Every fifth trial is a regional checkpoint. Defeating the Void Crown Emperor in Trial 30 closes the last gate; there is no hidden Trial 31.": "Boom Mane Leo、Spark Paw Fia、Moon Cap Orla 和 Moss Shell Taro 作為輪換英雄團隊進入大門。完成試煉可以穩定道路的一步並保存下一張牌。每五個試驗就是一個區域檢查站。在第30試煉中擊敗虛空皇帝關閉最後一道門；沒有隱藏的審判31。",
  "Boom Mane Lion": "繁榮鬃獅",
