  "Boss Battle": "Boss戰",
  "Boss Battles": "Boss戰",
  "Boss beasts roar and slow nearby guards. Build a layered defense.": "Boss 野獸咆哮並減慢附近守衛的速度。建立分層防禦。",
  "BOSS CALMED +2": "BOSS 平靜 +2",
  "Boss checkpoint": "老闆檢查站",
  "Boss counterplay": "Boss反擊",
  "Boss damage +{percent}%": "Boss 傷害 +{percent}%",
  "Boss first-clear bonus": "首領首領獎勵",
  "Boss phase": "Boss階段",
  "Boss phases trigger cumulatively at 70 and 35 percent health, so one large hit cannot skip a phase. Stone Stag refreshes armor and charges its lane. Ironroot Rhino braces, strikes a row and leaves rubble. Mirecoil Serpent adds currents, pulls heroes and regenerates unless two heroes hit it during that player turn. Embermane Lion places fire and gains a wounded extra action. Eclipse Griffin alternates flying ranged immunity with a grounded sweep. Rune Crown Chimera combines tide, burn, rubble, flight and a Mirror Wolf summon.": "Boss 階段在生命值達到 70% 和 35% 時累積觸發，因此一次大攻擊無法跳過一個階段。石鹿刷新護甲並衝鋒。鐵根犀牛支撐著，打出一排，留下瓦礫。秘卷蛇會增加電流、拉動英雄並再生，除非在該玩家回合中有兩個英雄擊中它。燼鬃獅會放火並獲得受傷的額外動作。日蝕獅鷲交替使用飛行遠程免疫和地面掃掠。符文皇冠奇美拉結合了潮汐、燃燒、碎石、飛行和鏡狼召喚。",
  "Boss phases trigger cumulatively at 70 and 35 percent health. Stone Stag refreshes armor and charges; Ironroot Rhino leaves rubble; Mirecoil Serpent pulls and regenerates unless two heroes hit it; Embermane Lion adds fire and an extra action; Eclipse Griffin switches flight and sweep; Rune Crown Chimera combines terrain changes, flight and a clone summon.": "Boss 階段會在生命值達到 70% 和 35% 時累積觸發。石鹿刷新護甲和衝鋒；鐵根犀牛留下瓦礫；除非有兩個英雄擊中它，否則米爾卷蛇會拉動並再生；燼鬃獅增加了火焰和額外的行動； Eclipse Griffin 切換飛行和掃掠；符文皇冠奇美拉結合了地形變化、飛行和克隆召喚。",
  "Boss Pressure": "老闆壓力",
  "Boss pressure: survive two stags and raven fire.": "Boss 壓力：在兩隻雄鹿和烏鴉火力中生存。",
  "Boss roar!": "老大吼！",
  "Boss rules: Rootbound rebuilds a breakable guard; Brambleback summons anchors and armored support at health thresholds; Lunar Wisp alternates visible and phased periods; Prism Shell can only be damaged while its gold shield segment is open; Tempest Horn is vulnerable after a marked charge; Voidcore changes phase twice, adds escorts, rebuilds protection, and activates two mirror pylons.": "Boss 規則：Rootbound 重建易碎的守衛；黑莓背龍在生命值達到閾值時召喚錨和裝甲支援；月光交替可見週期和階段週期；棱鏡殼只能在其金盾段打開時受到損壞；暴風號角在明顯衝鋒後很容易受到攻擊；虛空核心兩次改變相位，增加護航，重建保護，並激活兩個塔鏡子。",
  "Boss skills are different. Thornwood Alpha attacks a row and shields itself, Abyss Shell Leviathan protects and heals its side, and Void Crown Emperor damages the whole squad while restoring its own health.": "boss技能不同。荊棘阿爾法攻擊一排並保護自己，深淵貝殼利維坦保護並治療其側面，虛空皇冠皇帝在恢復自身生命值的同時對整個小隊造成傷害。",
  "Boss Stage": "Boss階段",
  "Boss stage. Block the boss lane and slow it with Owls.": "老大階段。用貓頭鷹阻擋 Boss 通道並減慢速度。",
  "Boss striker.": "老闆前鋒。",
  "Boss tactic": "老大戰術",
  "BOSS WAVE": "老闆波",
  "Boss Waves": "老闆波",
  "BOSS: {boss}": "老闆：{boss}",
  "Boss: armor thickens at each phase.": "Boss：護甲在每個階段都會變厚。",
  "Boss: each phase regenerates faster.": "Boss：每個階段的恢復速度都更快。",
  "Boss: every phase changes the forbidden type.": "Boss：每個階段都會改變禁忌類型。",
  "Boss: phases accelerate the hunt.": "Boss：階段性加速狩獵。",
  "Boss: stronger counters after each phase.": "Boss：每個階段後都有更強的反擊。",
  "Bosses keep their beast identity and add a unique projectile rule. The Boar Captain fires quick pursuit shots; the Hyena creates paired crossfire; the Rhino begins behind six shield hits and throws a heavy orb; the Buffalo aims a large siege orb at wall center; the Hawk combines repeated dashes with twin fast shots; and the Bear casts three-orb starfall.": "Boss 保留了他們的野獸身份並添加了獨特的彈幕規則。野豬隊長快速射擊追擊；鬣狗產生配對交火；犀牛在六次護盾命中後開始並投擲一個沉重的球體；水牛將一個巨大的攻城球瞄準城牆中心；鷹將重複衝刺與兩次快速射擊結合在一起；熊施放了三球星落。",
  "Botas": "博塔斯",
  "BOTAS": "博塔斯",
  "Botas de engranajes": "植物園",
  "Botas de Explorador": "探險船",
  "Botas de Viento": "風之波塔斯",
  "Botas Veloces": "博塔斯·維洛塞斯",
  "BOTTOM": "底部",
  "Bottom matched · Pulse now!": "底部匹配·立即脈衝！",
  "Boucle du Sanctuaire Animal": "動物保護區毛圈",
  "Bouclier": "布克利耶",
  "Bouclier du Noyau": "布克利爾·杜·諾亞",
  "Bounce {current}/{total}": "反彈 {current}/{total}",
  "Bounce fruit into the animal basket to clear the stage.": "將水果彈入動物籃以清除舞台。",
  "Bounce fruit to animals.": "將水果彈給動物。",
  "Bounce shots off a wall to get around rocks.": "將子彈從牆上彈回以繞過岩石。",
  "Bounce twice before delivery": "出貨前彈跳兩次",
  "Boxes settle into new places after every match.": "每場比賽結束後，盒子都會安置在新的地方。",
  "Boya del trueno": "特魯諾博亞",
  "Braces, charges a row, and leaves blocked rubble.": "支撐，衝鋒，並留下堵塞的瓦礫。",
  "Bramble and root lanes limit where the wolf can wait. Charging and armored ground enemies appear beside ranged threats, so target order matters. Thorn Colossus normally protects its glowing core; a missed root smash opens a short damage window while new root lanes warn where not to stand.": "荊棘巷和樹根巷限制了狼可以等待的地方。衝鋒和裝甲地面敵人出現在遠程威脅旁邊，因此目標順序很重。荊棘巨像通常會保護其發光的核心；錯過的根部粉碎會打開一個短暫的傷害窗口，而新的根部通道會警告不要站立。",
  "Bramble Fork": "荊棘叉",
  "Bramble lanes slow careless movement": "布蘭布爾車道緩慢疏忽移動",
  "Bramble plates and thorn anchors protect the Colossus.": "荊棘板和荊棘錨保護著巨像。",
  "Bramble Pursuit": "荊棘追擊",
  "Bramble Surge": "荊棘湧動",
