  "Build a squad that survives five continuous waves. Clearing wave five saves the stage and unlocks the next one; every fifth stage ends with a regional Boss.": "建立一支能夠在連續五波攻擊中倖存的小隊。清除第五波可保存該階段並解鎖下一階段；每第五個階段都會以一個區域 Boss 結束。",
  "Build a summoned animal team, spin ten kinds of downward-moving runes, complete doubled lines, and unleash separate pet attacks while shared defense and healing protect the summoner.": "組成召喚獸隊伍，旋轉十種向下移動的符文，完成雙線，釋放單獨的寵物攻擊，同時共同防禦和治療保護召喚者。",
  "Build a team of summoned animal heroes, align runes, and defeat every guardian.": "組成一支召喚動物英雄團隊，排列符文，並擊敗每個守護者。",
  "Build a team of up to five summoned animal heroes, spin three downward rune reels, combine the stopped symbols, and survive every wave of thirty guardian missions.": "組成一支最多由五名召喚動物英雄組成的團隊，旋轉三個向下的符文捲軸，組合停止的符號，並在每一波三十個守護者任務中生存下來。",
  "Build a two-row animal formation, train ten heroes, and defeat six regional bosses across a 30-stage auto-battler campaign.": "在 30 個階段的自動戰鬥戰役中，組成兩排動物陣型，訓練十位英雄，並擊敗六位地區首領。",
  "Build animal-power decks across 30 missions, counter ten regional mechanics, and defeat six phase-changing forest Bosses.": "在 30 個任務中構建動物動力套牌，對抗 10 個區域機械師，並擊敗 6 個階段性森林 Boss。",
  "Build animal-power decks, read enemy intent, counter ten regional mechanics, and defeat six distinct Bosses across 30 missions.": "建構動物力量牌組、解讀敵人意圖、對抗 10 個區域機制，並在 30 個任務中擊敗 6 個不同的 Boss。",
