  "Check a cloud’s whole row before striking it.": "在擊中雲之前檢查它的整排。",
  "Check all three tray pieces before committing the first one.": "在提交第一個托盤之前檢查所有三個托盤。",
  "Check current and next bubbles before choosing an angle.": "在選擇角度之前檢查當前和下一個氣泡。",
  "Check each customer&#39;s food bubble, VIP mark, table mark, and patience bar.": "檢查每位顧客的食物氣泡、VIP標記、餐桌標記和耐心條。",
  "Check each food color.": "檢查每種食物的顏色。",
  "Check food bubbles, VIP marks, table marks, and patience before preparing a tray.": "在準備托盤之前檢查食物氣泡、VIP 標記、餐桌標記和耐心。",
  "Check for a VIP before preparing a normal guest's tray.": "在準備普通客人的托盤之前先檢查是否有 VIP。",
