  "Check Free Tiles": "檢查免費磁磚",
  "Check rare letters and board edges before choosing the first tile.": "在選擇第一塊瓷磚之前，請檢查罕見字母和板邊緣。",
  "Check the active bus and its remaining seats.": "檢查活動巴士及其剩餘座位。",
