  "Choose a lane, or SURFACE to keep your salvage.": "選擇一條車道或表面來保留你的殘骸。",
  "Choose a lane, resolve its oxygen and salvage result, and keep enough power for Shield or later fish encounters.": "選擇一條車道，解決其氧氣和打撈結果，並為盾牌或以後的魚遭遇保留足夠的能量。",
