  "CHOOSE A SHAPE": "選擇形狀",
  "Choose a shelf": "選擇一個架子",
  "Choose a shift": "選擇班次",
  "Choose a shift, read each flight request, then guide the airship to the highlighted matching dock before congestion builds.": "選擇班次，閱讀每個航班請求，然後在擁堵之前將飛艇引導至突出顯示的匹配碼頭。",
  "Choose a sky race": "選擇天空競賽",
  "Choose a Skyspire": "選擇天空塔",
  "Choose a snack stage.": "選擇一個小吃階段。",
  "Choose a source vessel and then a legal destination. The destination needs enough space and must be empty or show the same top color. A legal transfer visibly carries the orb group between vessels before the board state changes.": "選擇源船，然後選擇合法目的地。目的地需要足夠的空間，並且必須為空或顯示相同的頂部顏色。在棋盤狀態改變之前，合法的轉移顯然會在船隻之間攜帶球體組。",
  "Choose a source vessel, then a destination.": "選擇來源船，然後選擇目的地。",
  "Choose a Spring": "選擇一個春天",
  "Choose a stage from the swipe stage rail and read the threat, plan, and reward notes.": "從滑動式舞台導軌中選擇一個舞台並閱讀威脅、計劃和獎勵說明。",
  "Choose a star and continue through connected stars. A star may be visited more than once, but every connecting trail may be crossed only once. The constellation is complete only after all trails are lit in one continuous route.": "選擇一顆星星並繼續瀏覽連接的星星。一顆恆星可能會被多次訪問，但每條連接路徑只能被穿越一次。只有在一條連續路線上的所有路徑都被照亮後，星座才算完整。",
  "Choose a star connected to the glowing star.": "選擇一顆與發光星星相連的星星。",
  "Choose a star to begin.": "選擇一顆星星開始。",
  "Choose a Start": "選擇一個開始",
  "CHOOSE A STOP": "選擇停靠點",
  "Choose a target to swim into. Compare both signals; use SONAR when unsure.": "選擇一個要遊入的目標。比較兩個訊號；不確定時使用 SONAR。",
  "CHOOSE A TERMINAL": "選擇一個終端",
  "Choose a trail": "選擇一條路線",
  "CHOOSE A TRAIL": "選擇一條路線",
  "Choose a tuning. Costs and your balance stay visible.": "選擇調音。費用和您的餘額保持可見。",
  "Choose a vessel containing at least one orb.": "選擇一個至少包含一個球體的容器。",
  "Choose a vessel to lift its top group, then choose a compatible destination. The restoration is complete when every non-empty vessel holds only one color.": "選擇一艘船來提升其頂級組，然後選擇一個相容的目的地。當每個非空容器僅容納一種顏色時，修復就完成了。",
  "Choose a Warehouse": "選擇方舟倉庫",
  "CHOOSE A WATERWAY": "選擇水路",
  "Choose a workshop puzzle": "選擇一個創意工坊拼圖",
  "Choose a zoo shift from the stage list.": "從階段清單中選擇動物園班次。",
  "Choose an animal page, fill or brush bounded regions, and save finished art to a local gallery.": "選擇一個動物頁面，填充或畫筆邊界區域，並將完成的藝術作品儲存到本地畫廊。",
  "Choose an animal, pick a color, then color it": "選擇一種動物，選擇一種顏色，然後給它上色",
  "Choose an animal, pick a color, then tap the animal to color it": "選擇一種動物，選擇一種顏色，然後點擊該動物為其著色",
  "Choose an animal, pick colors, and make it yours.": "選擇一種動物，選擇顏色，然後將其變成你的。",
  "Choose an animal, then tap a grass tile to place it.": "選擇一種動物，然後點擊草塊來放置它。",
  "Choose an animal, then tap a grass tile.": "選擇一種動物，然後點選草塊。",
  "Choose an assault": "選擇攻擊",
  "Choose an empty vessel or one with the same color on top.": "選擇一個空容器或頂部具有相同顏色的容器。",
  "Choose an expedition": "選擇探險",
  "Choose an Expedition Relic": "選擇遠徵遺跡",
  "Choose an open hole that can safely hold it.": "選擇一個可以安全固定它的開放孔。",
  "Choose an unlocked brass screw.": "選擇未上鎖的黃銅螺絲。",
  "Choose an unlocked card from the 30-stage horizontal expedition rail and read its route rule.": "從30級水平探險鐵路中選擇一張解鎖卡並閱讀其路線規則。",
  "Choose an unlocked card from the 30-trial Stage rail and read its region rule, checkpoint Boss, and suggested hero.": "從 30 個試用階段軌道中選擇一張解鎖的卡牌，並閱讀其區域規則、檢查點 Boss 和建議的英雄。",
  "Choose an unlocked card from the horizontal 30-stage rail and read its rule.": "從水平 30 級軌道中選擇一張未鎖定的卡片並閱讀其規則。",
  "Choose an unlocked card from the horizontal 30-stage rail; every fifth card is a Boss checkpoint.": "從水平30軌道中選擇一張解鎖卡；每五張卡片就是一個 Boss 檢查點。",
  "Choose an unlocked card from the horizontal 30-trial rail and read its region rule, checkpoint Boss, and suggested hero.": "從水平的 30 個試煉軌道中選擇一張解鎖的卡牌，並閱讀其區域規則、檢查點 Boss 和建議的英雄。",
  "Choose an unlocked card from the horizontal Stage rail. Locked cards remain visible so the length of the 30-stage route and each fifth-stage Boss checkpoint are clear.": "從水平舞台導軌中選擇一張未鎖定的卡片。鎖定的卡牌仍然可見，因此 30 階段路線的長度和每個第五階段 Boss 檢查點都清晰可見。",
