  "Clockwork patrols are easiest to cross during the blue slow phase. The amber border and guardian glow warn that the faster sweep has begun.": "發條巡邏隊在藍色慢速階段最容易穿越。琥珀色邊框和守護者光芒警告更快的掃描已經開始。",
