  "Cloud Window": "雲窗",
  "Cloudbridge Check": "雲橋檢查",
  "Clouds can remove useful bubbles too, so check the whole row before striking one.": "雲也可以消除有用的氣泡，因此在擊打氣泡之前檢查整行氣泡。",
  "Clover Leaf": "三葉草葉",
  "Clover Leaf: First shop reroll each round is free.": "三葉草葉：每輪首次商店重新滾動都是免費的。",
  "Clover Yard connects six garden regions that share sunlight, seeds, and water. When wild beasts crowd the paths, the player becomes the yard keeper and places Cat, Dog, Owl, and the optional Fox across five lanes. The 30-stage campaign introduces a readable rule in each region: healers restore a beast ahead, burrowers warn before changing lanes, and sun thieves remove 12 unspent sun. Every fifth stage has a separate guardian and counterplay, from Moss Horn Rhino's roar and Prism Shell Tortoise's protected phase to Burrow Badger Chief's lane changes, Ember Mane Boar's announced rush, Gale Wing Eagle's attack delay, and Moon Crown Elk's restoring pulse. Clears, scores, Garden Medals, coins, and training stay in this browser.": "Clover Yard 連接六個共享陽光、種子和水的花園區域。當野獸擠滿道路時，玩家將成為院子管理員，將貓、狗、貓頭鷹和可選的狐狸放置在五個車道上。這場分為 30 個階段的戰役在每個區域引入了一條可讀的規則：治療師恢復前方的野獸，挖掘者在變換車道前發出警告，太陽竊賊移除 12 個未使用的太陽。每第五階段都有一個單獨的守護者和反擊者，從苔角犀牛的咆哮和棱殼龜的保護階段到地獾酋長的變道，灰鬃野豬的宣布衝刺，疾風翼鷹的攻擊延遲，以及月冠麋鹿的恢復脈衝。清除、分數、花園獎牌、硬幣和訓練都保留在這個瀏覽器中。",
