  "Collect a power core as soon as the lane is safe enough because later waves are balanced around its attack increase.": "一旦車道足夠安全，就立即收集能量核心，因為後面的波浪會圍繞其攻擊增加進行平衡。",
  "Collect a Shell Ward before exposing Taro to a Shadow Wisp.": "在讓太郎暴露在暗影小精靈面前之前收集一個貝殼防護罩。",
  "Collect a small ticket box and learn where park income waits.": "收集一個小票箱並了解公園收入在哪裡。",
  "Collect and Stack": "收集並堆疊",
  "Collect Aurora tiles in your color, carry them to one of three bridge docks, automatically submit the stack while nearby, and finish the required bridge distance before the rival crews.": "收集您顏色的極光瓷磚，將它們帶到三個橋碼頭之一，在附近自動提交堆棧，並在競爭對手之前完成所需的橋距離。",
  "Collect consecutive stars to raise the next-star multiplier. A collision removes 80 points and resets that multiplier.": "收集連續的星星以提高下一顆星星的乘數。碰撞會消除 80 分並重置該乘數。",
  "Collect cyan aurora tiles. Other colors belong to the rivals.": "收集青色極光瓷磚。其他顏色屬於競爭對手。",
  "Collect cyan tiles and carry them to any bridge dock.": "收集青色瓷磚並將它們帶到任何橋碼頭。",
  "Collect cyan tiles and finish a bridge before the rivals.": "收集青色瓷磚並在對手之前完成一座橋樑。",
  "Collect drops promptly and spend before a thief can take them.": "及時收集掉落物並在小偷拿走之前將其花費掉。",
  "Collect early XP so the first upgrade changes more of the patrol.": "收集早期的經驗值，以便第一次升級可以改變更多的巡邏。",
  "Collect every fruit before entering home.": "回家前收集所有水果。",
  "Collect EXP and spend both exact-value attribute points whenever growth pauses the same Battle screen.": "每當成長暫停同一戰鬥畫面時，收集經驗值並花費精確值的屬性點。",
  "Collect EXP orbs after a safe defeat. When growth pauses the battle, spend both points before play resumes; leaving one point unspent is not allowed.": "安全失敗後收集經驗球。當成長暫停戰鬥時，在比賽恢復之前花掉兩點；不允許留下一分未用。",
  "Collect falling sun before it fades. Sun pays for guards during that stage; coins earned from defeated beasts are saved for permanent training.": "在落日消逝之前收集它。 Sun 支付該階段的警衛費用；從擊敗的野獸中獲得的硬幣將被保存下來用於永久訓練。",
  "Collect fast. Choose a lane. Build first.": "快收藏吧。選擇一條車道。首先構建。",
  "Collect fruit and keys while avoiding rocks, water, closed gates, and crumbled fragile paths.": "收集水果和鑰匙，同時避開岩石、水、關閉的大門和破碎的脆弱路徑。",
  "Collect fruit and route keys while avoiding rocks, water, closed gates, and unusable fragile tiles.": "收集水果和路線鑰匙，同時避開岩石、水、關閉的大門和無法使用的易碎瓷磚。",
  "Collect goal": "收集目標",
  "Collect nearby crystals and keys from farther away.": "從遠處收集附近的水晶和鑰匙。",
  "Collect Relic Orbs. At level-up, choose one of three temporary upgrades or use the single optional reroll.": "收集遺物球。在升級時，選擇三個臨時升級之一或使用單一可選的重新滾動。",
  "Collect several tiles of your color without exceeding a safe return distance.": "在不超過安全返回距離的情況下收集幾塊與您顏色相同的圖塊。",
  "Collect stars for score and combo while avoiding cones, satchels, book stacks, and puddles.": "收集星星以獲得分數和組合，同時避開圓錐體、書包、書架和水坑。",
  "Collect Sun": "收集太陽",
  "Collect sun, react to special enemy cues, and stop every beast before cottage hearts reach zero.": "收集陽光，對特殊的敵人提示做出反應，並在小屋之心歸零之前阻止每隻野獸。",
  "Collect the displayed number of keys and XP crystals before the timer ends.": "在計時器結束之前收集顯示數量的鑰匙和 XP 水晶。",
  "Collect the first XP crystals before committing to a distant key. One early upgrade changes the rest of the patrol.": "在使用遠端鑰匙之前收集第一批 XP 水晶。一項早期升級改變了巡邏隊的其餘部分。",
  "Collect the golden key before entering its gate; a rejected gate tap costs no move.": "進入大門前收集金鑰匙；被拒絕的門水龍頭不需要移動。",
  "Collect the golden route key, then enter its matching gate. A closed gate never consumes a move.": "收集黃金路線鑰匙，然後進入其匹配的大門。關閉的門永遠不會消耗一步。",
  "Collect the mission object and then reach the active extraction marker. When a rule says treasure is the first seal, the object cannot be collected until that seal is open.": "收集任務物體，然後到達活動的撤離標記。當規則規定寶藏是第一個封印時，在該封印打開之前無法收集該物品。",
  "Collect the needed bubbles before moves run out.": "在步數用完之前收集所需的氣泡。",
  "Collect the smallest reachable salvage first to increase mass safely.": "首先收集最小的可到達的殘骸以安全地增加質量。",
  "Collect the ticket box": "領取票箱",
  "Collect the ticket box when it fills, or leave tickets ready when a milestone asks for a full box.": "當票箱裝滿時收集票證，或當里程碑需要裝滿票箱時將票證準備好。",
  "Collect three matching objects to clear them automatically.": "收集三個相符的物體即可自動清除它們。",
  "Collect three prism shards to open this wreckage.": "收集三塊棱鏡碎片來打開這個殘骸。",
  "Collect tickets, then leave a second amount waiting in the box.": "收集門票，然後將第二張門票留在盒子裡等待。",
