  "Combat": "戰鬥",
  "Combat roles: blockers buy time, Archers and Orla cover distance, Sappers apply splash damage and slowing, Medics heal damaged defenders, Fia focuses Boss pressure, and Gear Horn Rux strengthens nearby allies. Selecting a placed unit shows its upgrade cost and sell refund.": "戰鬥角色：阻擋者爭取時間，弓箭手和奧拉覆蓋距離，工兵施加濺射傷害和減速，醫療兵治療受損的防御者，菲亞集中Boss壓力，齒輪號角魯克斯加強附近的盟友。選擇放置的單位會顯示其升級成本和銷售退款。",
  "Combat roles: Guards buy time; Archers win long lanes; Sappers deliver splash and slows; Taro anchors a choke; Orla chains into nearby packs; Fia specializes in Boss damage; and Rux makes a close formation stronger. Selecting a placed unit shows its upgrade cost and sell refund.": "戰鬥角色：守衛爭取時間；弓箭手贏得長線；電子工兵會產生濺射並減速；太郎錨定了扼流圈；奧拉用鍊子鎖住了附近的狼群； Fia 專注於 Boss 傷害； Rux讓緊密的陣型變得更強。選擇放置的單位會顯示其升級成本和銷售退款。",
  "Combattimento tattico a rulli": "魯利戰鬥紋身",
