  "Compara alimentos blancos, grises, marrones y negros.": "比較白色、灰色、馬羅內斯和黑人的食物。",
  "Compare alimentos brancos, cinza, marrons e pretos.": "比較 alimentos brancos、cinza、marrons 和 pretos。",
  "Compare alimentos rosa, pretos, brancos e marrons.": "比較 rosa、pretos、brancos 和 marrons 食品。",
  "Compare crossing clues before committing a cell.": "在提交單元之前比較交叉線索。",
  "Compare each lane's salvage, danger, oxygen estimate, and environmental clues. Manage shared tool power, survive fish encounters, reach the route target, and surface safely.": "比較每條車道的救援、危險、氧氣估計和環境線索。管理共享工具動力，在遭遇魚類時倖存下來，到達路線目標並安全浮出水面。",
  "Compare every queue front before sending a future color into the holding lane.": "在將未來的顏色傳送到等待通道之前，先比較每個佇列前端。",
  "Compare every tempting jungle animal with the six picture chips; a visible animal can be a harmless visitor.": "將每種誘人的叢林動物與六張圖片晶片進行比較；可見的動物可能是無害的訪客。",
  "Compare food clues with animal families and body features.": "將食物線索與動物科系和身體特徵進行比較。",
  "Compare loot, danger, and oxygen estimates. Save enough power for timed fish attacks, reach the target, or SURFACE early.": "比較戰利品、危險和氧氣估計。為定時魚類攻擊、到達目標或儘早浮出水面節省足夠的電力。",
  "Compare loot, risk, and oxygen.": "比較戰利品、風險和氧氣。",
  "Compare pairs by what they uncover. Removing a top-layer pair usually creates more choices than clearing an already open edge.": "透過他們發現的內容來比較成對的人。刪除頂層對通常比清除已經開放的邊緣創造更多選擇。",
  "Compare pink, black, white, and brown.": "比較粉紅色、黑色、白色和棕色。",
  "Compare points and curved edges when outline cars remove color.": "當輪廓車去除顏色時，比較點和彎曲邊緣。",
  "Compare the evidence with the three or four animal names, then choose one.": "將證據與三四個動物名稱進行比較，然後選擇一個。",
  "Compare the evidence with the three or four animal-name choices and select one answer.": "將證據與三到四個動物名稱選項進行比較並選擇一個答案。",
  "Compare the left and right target estimates and environmental clues; use Sonar only when exact information is worth the battery cost.": "比較左右目標估計值和環境線索；僅當準確資訊值得電池成本時才使用聲納。",
  "Compare the pictures, then tap one tool or drag it onto the animal.": "比較圖片，然後點擊一個工具或將其拖曳到動物上。",
  "Compare the six picture chips below the scene with the partly covered animals in the habitat.": "將場景下方的六個圖片片段與棲息地中部分覆蓋的動物進行比較。",
  "Compare the tool pictures, then tap one or drag it onto the animal.": "比較工具圖片，然後點擊其中一張或將其拖曳到動物上。",
  "Compare white, gray, brown, and black pantry foods.": "比較白色、灰色、棕色和黑色食品。",
