  "Continue this exact Stage {stage} battle, or return to Stages and lose the current wave, defenders, coins, and core health.": "繼續這場精確的階段{stage}戰鬥，或返回階段並失去當前的波浪、防禦者、金幣和核心生命值。",
  "Continue until each non-empty vessel contains only one color.": "繼續，直到每個非空容器僅包含一種顏色。",
