  "Diamond Summon": "鑽石召喚",
  "Diamond-marked animals carry keys for blue trail seals, while starred pictures represent separated families. Patrol Trail boards alternate the available route between groups A and B after each match, asking the ranger to inspect a different part of the layered board. Clearing Board 30 restores the final Coral Shelf page and completes all six Habitat Finales.": "帶有鑽石標記的動物攜帶著藍色小徑印章的鑰匙，而帶有星號的圖片則代表離散的家庭。每場比賽結束後，巡邏板會在 A 組和 B 組之間交替使用可用路線，要求護林員檢查分層板的不同部分。 Clearing Board 30 恢復了最終的珊瑚架頁面並完成了所有六個棲息地結局。",
  "Diamonds": "鑽石",
  "Diamonds are optional. They can reroll relic choices, revive a failed expedition, unlock two premium heroes, or unlock the golden cosmetic skin; normal stage progression does not require them.": "鑽石是可選的。他們可以重新選擇遺物，復活失敗的探險隊，解鎖兩名高級英雄，或解鎖金色裝飾皮膚；正常的階段進展不需要它們。",
  "Diamonds open seals, stars mark rescue families, and blue sealed tiles wait for their key.": "鑽石打開封印，星星標記救援家庭，藍色密封瓷磚等待他們的鑰匙。",
  "Diamonds optionally confirm a core revive, reroll a result reward, or unlock the golden frame. They are not required for normal campaign progress.": "鑽石可以選擇確認核心復活、重新滾動結果獎勵或解鎖黃金框。正常的戰役進展不需要它們。",
  "Dica": "迪卡",
