  "Different bears live in forests, mountains, tundra, and icy coasts.": "不同的熊生活在森林、山脈、苔原和冰冷的海岸。",
  "Different capacities change where each color belongs.": "不同的容量會改變每種顏色所屬的位置。",
  "Different kinds of me live in forests, deserts, grasslands, and water.": "不同種類的我生活在森林、沙漠、草原和水中。",
  "Different owls live in forests, grasslands, deserts, and farms.": "不同的貓頭鷹生活在森林、草原、沙漠和農場。",
  "Different whales filter tiny prey or hunt fish and squid.": "不同的鯨魚會過濾微小的獵物或捕食魚類和魷魚。",
  "Difficile": "艱難梭菌",
  "Difficulty": "難度",
  "Difficulty changes navigation and objective structure rather than only raising the numerical quota.": "困難改變了導航和目標結構，而不僅僅是提高了數量配額。",
  "Difficulty comes from spatial consequences while the arithmetic remains limited to sums of ten.": "困難來自於空間後果，而算術仍限於十之和。",
  "Difficulty grows by changing access decisions rather than simply adding tiles, shrinking pictures, or imposing a fast clock. Seals add dependency, rescues add visible subgoals, and Patrol Trail changes which set is currently available after each match. One fixed logical layout scales uniformly on phones, tablets, desktop, and short landscape. Touch, mouse, and keyboard share one validator; Result stays inside Battle; the Kids route creates no advertising request or reserve. Unlike a memory game, every picture remains visible, and unlike a flat matching board, removal order changes which tiles can be reached.": "透過改變存取決策而不是簡單地添加圖塊、縮小圖片或施加快速時鐘來增加難度。海豹突擊隊增加了依賴性，救援隊增加了可見的子目標，而巡邏追蹤則改變了每場比賽後目前可用的設定。一種固定的邏輯佈局在手機、平板電腦、桌面和短橫向上統一縮放。觸控、滑鼠、鍵盤共用一個驗證器；結果保留在戰鬥中；兒童路線不會產生廣告請求或保留。與記憶遊戲不同，每張圖片都保持可見，並且與平面匹配板不同，移除順序會改變可以到達的圖塊。",
  "Difficulty grows by changing route logic rather than adding speed. Mud changes cost, gates change order, fragile paths change reversibility, and required fruit changes when home is valid. The 390 by 788 Kids canvas keeps Stage, Battle, and Result stable across devices. There is no timer, combat, leaderboard, account, purchase, or advertising request; the challenge comes from reading a small map and committing to a route.": "透過改變路線邏輯而不是增加速度來增加難度。泥漿改變成本，大門改變順序，脆弱的路徑改變可逆性，以及當家園有效時所需的水果改變。 390 x 788 Kids 畫佈在不同裝置上保持舞台、戰鬥和結果穩定。沒有計時器、戰鬥、排行榜、帳戶、購買或廣告請求；挑戰來自於閱讀小地圖並確定路線。",
  "Difficulty grows by changing useful evidence instead of shrinking targets or adding a clock. Direct needs establish meanings; picture recognition, priority, recall and changing positions each add one understandable demand. The fixed logical Canvas scales uniformly across phone, tablet, desktop and short landscape. Situation effects never display the answer item, and visible-time feedback cannot finish while the page is backgrounded. Unlike Zoo Helper Day’s care categories and ordered routines, this game connects environmental situations to immediate item decisions. Kids play has no advertising, account, purchase, ranking or diagnosis.": "透過改變有用的證據而不是縮小目標或增加時鐘來增加難度。直接需求確立意義；圖片辨識、優先順序、回想和改變位置每一項都增加了一項可以理解的需求。固定邏輯畫佈在手機、平板電腦、桌面和短景觀上統一縮放。情境效果永遠不會顯示答案項目，且當頁面處於背景時，可見時間回饋無法完成。與動物園助手日的護理類別和有序例程不同，該遊戲將環境情況與即時專案決策聯繫起來。兒童遊戲沒有廣告、帳戶、購買、排名或診斷。",
  "Difficulty grows by changing what the player observes instead of shrinking controls, adding a timer or hiding the correct hit area. Direct matching establishes the vocabulary; outline, movement, memory and ordered selection each add one understandable decision. The fixed logical layout scales uniformly on phone, tablet, desktop and short landscape. Image-backed cars and tokens keep play visual, while localized text explains only the current rule. Match and memory delays count visible play time, so an app switch cannot silently advance the route. Unlike Animal Quiz, no factual reading is required; unlike Zoo Helper Day, the decision is visual equivalence rather than care purpose. Kids play has no advertising, purchase, account, ranking or diagnostic claim.": "透過改變玩家觀察的內容而不是縮小控制、添加計時器或隱藏正確的擊中區域來增加難度。直接配對建立詞彙表；輪廓、動作、記憶和有序選擇每一項都增加了一個可以理解的決定。固定的邏輯佈局在手機、平板電腦、桌面和短景觀上統一縮放。圖像支援的汽車和代幣保持遊戲的視覺效果，而本地化文字僅解釋當前規則。比賽和記憶延遲會計算可見的比賽時間，因此應用程式切換無法默默地推進路線。與《Animal Quiz》不同，不需要閱讀事實資料；與動物園助手日不同的是，這個決定是視覺對等而不是護理目的。兒童遊戲沒有廣告、購買、帳戶、排名或診斷聲明。",
  "Difficulty grows through layer dependencies and tray pressure, not a hidden timer.": "難度是透過層依賴性和托盤壓力而不是隱藏的計時器來增加的。",
  "Difficulty grows through readable pattern density rather than invisible physics changes.": "難度是透過可讀的圖案密度而不是看不見的物理變化來增加的。",
  "Dining Rhythm": "用餐節奏",
  "Direct matching, one required bank shot, the first zebra rescue, mixed colors, stones, and the first Safari Check establish precise collision.": "直接匹配、一次所需的銀行射擊、第一次斑馬救援、混合顏色、石頭和第一次狩獵檢查建立精確的碰撞。",
  "Direct paths, crossing patrols, optional treasure, and extraction teach the complete base loop. Lantern Auditor ends the wing with a searchlight whose visible sight circle repeatedly expands and contracts.": "直接路徑、交叉巡邏、可選寶藏和撤離教導完整的基地循環。燈籠審計員在機翼末端裝有探照燈，其可見視線圈不斷擴大和收縮。",
  "Direct picture-and-text situations introduce all animals, scenes, and helper items. Mission 5 is the first Helper Check.": "直接的圖文情境介紹了所有動物、場景和輔助物品。任務 5 是第一個助手檢查。",
  "Direct Scout packs teach movement, automatic range, skills, and two blessing choices. Shadow Prowler ends the region with a warned close shockwave.": "直接偵察包教授移動、自動射程、技能和兩種祝福選擇。暗影徘徊者用警告性的近距離衝擊波結束了該區域。",
