  "Explore a connected town, forest, and laboratory. Expose hidden threats and defeat the first Lizard Commander.": "探索互聯的城鎮、森林和實驗室。揭露隱藏的威脅並擊敗第一位蜥蜴指揮官。",
  "Explore freely. The stable device now reveals every secret.": "自由探索。現在，穩定的設備揭示了所有秘密。",
  "Explore six ruin regions across 30 missions, build relic gear, counter special threats, and defeat six distinct Guardians.": "在 30 個任務中探索 6 個廢墟區域，建造聖物裝備，對抗特殊威脅，並擊敗 6 個不同的守護者。",
  "Explore the Ancient Ruins.": "探索遠古遺跡。",
  "Explorer Boots": "探險家靴子",
  "Explorer Defeated": "探險家被擊敗",
  "Expose the active color first whenever the holding lane is nearly full.": "當等待通道接近滿時，首先曝光活動顏色。",
  "Expose the core after a root smash": "根部粉碎後暴露核心",
