  "Extraction insurance active for the next mission.": "為下一次任務啟用提取保險。",
  "Extraction insurance is already active.": "提取保險已經生效。",
  "Extraction provides one medal. Avoiding capture provides a second, and returning with optional treasure provides the third. The best medal count for each mission, highest unlocked mission, Moon Coins, and Safehouse level are saved locally. Safehouse level rises as groups of five different missions are cleared. Earlier cards stay replayable, and the Result substate offers Retry, Missions, and Next Mission only when another campaign mission actually exists.": "提取可提供一枚獎牌。避免捕獲提供了第二個，帶著可選寶藏返回提供了第三個。每個任務的最佳獎牌數、最高解鎖任務、月球幣和安全屋等級均保存在本地。隨著五個不同任務組的完成，安全屋的等級會上升。早期的卡牌仍然可重玩，並且僅當另一個戰役任務實際存在時，結果子狀態才提供重試、任務和下一個任務。",
  "Extraction ready": "提取準備就緒",
