  "Fading Meadow": "褪色的草地",
  "Fai spazio con i trii": "與三人的空間",
  "Failed to load asset:": "無法載入資源：",
  "Failed to load. Please refresh.": "加載失敗。請刷新。",
  "Faites glisser les blocs et guidez Panko vers la sortie.": "Faites glisser les blocs etguidez Panko vers la sortie。",
  "Fall through consecutive rings to charge Comet Break and smash one danger.": "穿過連續的圓環，衝向 Comet Break，粉碎一個危險。",
  "Fallen": "墮落者",
  "Falling-crystal warnings and three-shot Crystal Bats make standing still risky. Glass Causeway places that pressure under moving platforms, and Shard Ambush introduces the Armored Boar counter. Stone Guardian blocks frontal claws, then drops its guard after a ground slam that sends jumpable shockwaves in both directions.": "掉落水晶警告和三發水晶蝙蝠讓原地不動變得危險。玻璃堤道將壓力置於移動平台下，碎片伏擊引入了裝甲野豬櫃檯。石守衛會擋住前爪，然後在地面猛擊後放棄防禦，並向兩個方向發送可跳躍的衝擊波。",
