  "Fantastic! You cleared all {count} levels!": "太棒了！您已通關所有 {count} 關卡！",
  "Fantasy Lion Defense": "奇幻獅子防禦",
  "Fantasy Lion Defense - How to Play": "幻想獅子防禦 - 玩法",
  "Fantasy Lion Defense - WeightPlay": "幻想獅防禦 - WeightPlay",
  "Fantasy Lion Defense game board": "幻想獅子防禦遊戲板",
  "Fantasy Lion Defense game guide": "幻想獅子防禦遊戲指南",
  "Fantasy Lion Defense is a 30-stage animal defense game starring Boom Mane Leo. The lion moves along a fantasy wall while equipped erasers, pencils, and rulers fire on separate cooldowns. Eight beast roles attack in authored lane, alternating, edge, and center formations, and every fifth stage ends with a different Boss pattern. Between waves, the player chooses temporary Battle upgrades; after settlement, saved coins improve Leo, equipment, or the wall. Kids can retry without a timer, and the game remains permanently ad-free.": "Fantasy Lion Defense 是一款 30 階段的動物防禦遊戲，由 Boom Mane Leo 主演。獅子沿著奇幻的牆壁移動，同時配備的橡皮擦、鉛筆和尺子會在不同的冷卻時間下開火。八個野獸角色以精心設計的車道、交替、邊緣和中心陣型進行攻擊，每第五個階段以不同的 Boss 模式結束。在每一波之間，玩家選擇臨時的戰鬥升級；結算後，節省的金幣可以改善獅子座、裝備或城牆。孩子們可以在沒有計時器的情況下重試，遊戲將永久無廣告。",
  "Fantasy Lion Defense uses cartoon animal combat, automatic school-supply weapons, wall HP, and upgrade decisions. It may support reaction, focus, planning, and hand-eye coordination during short sessions, but the Skill Report and stars are playful summaries rather than a developmental, medical, or school assessment. The Kids page is ad-free, sign-in is not required, and progress stays in the current browser unless its storage is cleared.": "Fantasy Lion Defense 使用卡通動物戰鬥、自動學校供應武器、牆 HP 和升級決策。它可能支持短期訓練中的反應、注意力、計劃和手眼協調能力，但技能報告和星星只是有趣的總結，而不是發展、醫學或學校評估。 「兒童」頁面沒有廣告，不需要登錄，除非清除儲存空間，否則進度會保留在目前瀏覽器中。",
