  "Fast consecutive recoveries raise the Moon Chain. Later zones add currents, shields, rivals, rescue cores, and a closing storm.": "快速連續恢復會提升月亮鏈。後來的區域增加了水流、護盾、對手、救援核心和封閉風暴。",
