  "Festival combinations: Days 26-29 pair earlier rules in different ways. Day 30 activates recipe order, VIP priority, table alternation, and animal variety together.": "節慶組合：第 26-29 天對較早的規則以不同的方式進行。第 30 天同時啟動食譜訂購、VIP 優先、餐桌輪換和動物品種。",
  "Festival Combo": "節慶組合",
  "Festival de la corona": "科羅娜節",
  "Festival del regreso": "回歸節",
  "Festival Friends": "節日之友",
  "Festival Layout": "節日佈置",
  "Festival Practice": "節日實踐",
  "Festival Recipe": "節慶食譜",
  "Festival Story and World": "節日故事與世界",
  "Festival Tables": "節慶餐桌",
  "Festival traffic has jammed the woodland crossing. Orla watches from above while foxes, otters, pandas, lions, owls, turtles, rabbits, and rhinos wait in directional carts. Clearing every route restores a safe path through the plaza.": "節慶期間的交通堵塞了林地十字路口。奧拉從上方觀看，而狐狸、水獺、熊貓、獅子、貓頭鷹、海龜、兔子和犀牛則在定向推車中等待。清理每條路線可以恢復穿過廣場的安全路徑。",
  "Festival VIP": "節日貴賓",
  "Festival: combina las reglas visibles": "節日：combina las reglasvisibles",
  "Festival: combine the visible rules": "節慶：結合可見的規則",
  "Festungswerkstatt": "要塞工廠",
  "Fia": "國際汽聯",
  "Fia closes a glowing sanctuary loop": "國際汽聯關閉了一個發光的避難所環路",
  "Fia combines pictures, decoys, and safe box shuffles.": "Fia 結合了圖片、誘餌和保險箱洗牌。",
  "Fia descending through a crystal skyspire": "Fia 穿過水晶塔頂下降",
  "Fia Garra Chispeante": "菲亞·加拉·奇斯皮安特",
  "Fia is safe on restored land. Outside it, her open trail can be cut by a hunter; reconnecting claims the enclosed region. Hearts, target area, mission modifiers, and enemy routes remain visible during Battle.": "國際汽聯在恢復的土地上是安全的。在它之外，獵人可以切斷她的開放路徑；重新連接聲稱封閉區域。戰鬥期間，紅心、目標區域、任務修改器和敵人路線仍然可見。",
  "Fia is safe on restored land. The moment she crosses into corruption, her lightning trail becomes vulnerable. Reconnect it to claim the enclosed area before a hunter reaches the open line.": "國際汽聯在恢復的土地上是安全的。一旦她陷入腐敗，她的閃電軌跡就會變得脆弱。在獵人到達開放線之前重新連接它以佔領封閉區域。",
  "Fia is sealed inside a protective comet sphere while descending thirty unstable skyspires. Drag left or right to rotate every ring. Pass through openings, bounce on safe turquoise stone, and avoid violet cursed sectors.": "菲亞在從三十座不穩定的天空尖塔下降時被密封在彗星保護球內。向左或向右拖曳以旋轉每個環。穿過開口，在安全的綠松石上彈跳，並避開紫羅蘭詛咒區域。",
  "Fia Pata Chispa": "菲亞·帕塔·奇斯帕",
  "Fia Pata Chispeante": "菲亞·帕塔·奇斯皮安特",
  "Fia Pata Cintilante": "菲亞·帕塔·辛蒂蘭特",
  "Fia reached the finish first. Adapt earlier and try again.": "國際汽聯率先到達終點。儘早適應並重試。",
  "Fia recovered at the last safe checkpoint.": "國際汽聯在最後一個安全檢查站恢復了健康。",
  "Fia restored Tower {n} in {time} seconds.": "Fia 在 {time} 秒內恢復了塔{n}。",
  "Fia Strike": "國際汽聯罷工",
  "Fia travels inside a comet sphere through a chain of unstable skyspires. Each cleared tower restores one section of the high-altitude route and brings the rescue gate closer.": "菲亞在彗星球內穿行，穿過一連串不穩定的天空尖塔。每一座被清除的塔樓都會恢復一段高空路線，並使救援門更近。",
  "Fia's Rainbow Festival": "國際汽聯彩虹節",
