  "Fight for gold and EXP, then return here to train or upgrade gear.": "爭取金幣和經驗值，然後回到這裡訓練或升級裝備。",
  "Fight, choose loot, buy or sell gear, and defeat the fifth-room Boss.": "戰鬥、選擇戰利品、購買或出售裝備，並擊敗第五個房間的 Boss。",
