  "Fill": "填充",
  "Fill & Brush": "填充和刷子",
  "Fill and Brush Coloring": "填充和畫筆著色",
  "Fill bakery orders.": "填寫麵包店訂單。",
  "Fill colors one bounded region; Brush draws a free stroke.": "給一個有界區域填滿顏色；畫筆繪製自由筆畫。",
  "Fill colors one enclosed region at a time. Brush draws inside the artwork with adjustable size, and the eraser removes brush strokes. Undo and redo step through recent changes; Clear starts the current page again after confirmation.": "一次為一個封閉區域填滿顏色。畫筆以可調整的大小在圖稿內繪製，橡皮擦可消除畫筆描邊。撤銷和重做最近更改的步驟；確認後清除重新啟動目前頁面。",
  "Fill every bus without deadlocking the holding lane to unlock the next terminal.": "填滿每輛巴士，而不使等待車道陷入僵局，以解鎖下一個航站樓。",
  "Fill every cell with one line.": "用一行填滿每個單元格。",
  "Fill every open cell before releasing to clear the stage.": "在釋放以清除舞台之前填充每個打開的單元格。",
  "Fill every order with groups of four or more.": "以四人或四人以上為一組填寫每張訂單。",
  "Fill large regions first and add brush details afterward.": "首先填充大區域，然後添加畫筆細節。",
  "Fill the active bus. Future colors must wait in order.": "填滿活動總線。未來的顏色必須依序等待。",
