  "Final Boss: wards, curses and rotating seals.": "最終 Boss：守衛、詛咒和旋轉封印。",
  "Final Guest Rehearsal": "最後嘉賓排練",
  "Find": "尋找",
  "Find {target} first!": "首先找到{target}！",
  "Find a cart with a clear path to its edge.": "找到一輛通往其邊緣的暢通無阻的手推車。",
  "Find a matching free tile.": "找到匹配的免費瓷磚。",
  "Find a Pair": "找到一對",
  "Find all four words to complete the trail and unlock the next one.": "找到所有四個單字來完成線索並解鎖下一個。",
  "Find all six animals to save stars and best visible search time, unlock the next habitat, or replay the current one.": "找到所有六種動物以節省星星和最佳可見搜尋時間，解鎖下一個棲息地，或重播當前棲息地。",
  "Find animal and habitat words. Your progress stays on this device.": "找到動物和棲息地的單字。您的進度保留在此裝置上。",
  "Find animals blended into each natural habitat.": "尋找融入每個自然棲息地的動物。",
  "Find Groups": "尋找群組",
  "Find hidden animals.": "尋找隱藏的動物。",
  "Find matching cards.": "找到匹配的卡片。",
  "Find the {animal} pair next.": "接下來找到 {animal} 對。",
  "Find the animal words": "找出動物的單字",
  "Find the golden key star before crossing this gate.": "在穿過這扇門之前找到金鑰匙星。",
  "Find the signal cart before tapping a gated cart.": "在點擊門控車之前找到信號車。",
  "Find the trail key before crossing this gate.": "在穿過這扇門之前找到線索鑰匙。",
  "Find These": "找到這些",
  "Find two cards with the same picture.": "找出兩張具有相同圖片的卡片。",
  "Find two identical tiles with no tile directly above and at least one horizontal side open.": "找到兩塊相同的瓷磚，上面沒有瓷磚，並且至少一側水平面敞開。",
  "Finde die passenden Tierkarten.": "找到蒂爾卡滕 (Tierkarten) 路過的地方。",
  "Finde sechs Tierpaare in der angezeigten Reihenfolge.": "在 der angezeigten Reihenfolge 中尋找 Tierpaare。",
  "Finish": "完成",
  "FINISH": "結束",
  "Finish 10 questions to clear a stage.": "完成 10 個問題即可通關。",
  "Finish a nearly defeated formation before switching unless a bomb or breach is imminent.": "除非炸彈或突破迫在眉睫，否則在轉換之前完成一個幾乎被擊敗的陣型。",
  "Finish all shape friends to clear.": "完成所有形狀的朋友即可清除。",
  "Finish every color group within the target moves.": "完成目標動作中的每個顏色組。",
  "Finish every decision to save stars and unlock the next shift.": "完成每一個拯救星星的決定並解鎖下一個班次。",
  "Finish every request to save one to three stars and unlock exactly the next shift.": "完成每個請求以保存一到三顆星並準確解鎖下一個班次。",
  "Finish line reached!": "到達終點線了！",
  "Finish the displayed mission goal before the placement limit.": "在放置限制之前完成顯示的任務目標。",
  "Finish the order and make one group of three.": "完成訂單並製作一組三個。",
  "Finish the order to earn a stamp.": "完成訂單即可獲得印章。",
  "Finish the previous trail to unlock this one.": "完成上一條線索即可解鎖這條線索。",
  "Finish the shift to earn tickets, stars, and the next zoo moment.": "完成輪班即可賺取門票、星星和下一個動物園時刻。",
  "Finish when every non-empty vessel contains one color.": "當每個非空容器包含一種顏色時完成。",
  "Finish with at most {target} bumps": "最多完成 {target} 次顛簸",
  "Finishing a habitat confirms all six requested sightings. Every fifth challenge is a Habitat Checkpoint that reviews the search habit learned in that region. Completing Checkpoint 30 returns a verified picture census to the lodge: paired animals have been counted separately, harmless visitors have not been confused with the list, and the moving lookout patrol has been observed in the required order.": "完成棲息地確認了所有六次請求的目擊事件。每五個挑戰就是一個棲息地檢查點，用於審查在該地區學到的搜尋習慣。完成 30 號檢查站後，將向小屋返回經過驗證的圖片普查：配對的動物已單獨計數，無害的訪客未與列表混淆，並且已按要求的順序觀察移動的瞭望巡邏隊。",
  "Finsternisprisma": "芬斯特尼斯棱鏡",
  "Finsternisregent": "芬斯特尼斯攝政王",
  "Finsternistor": "芬斯特尼斯托",
  "Fire lanes cycle on and off": "消防通道循環開啟和關閉",
  "Fire lanes cycle, Ember Wolves redraw safe ground with trails, and Dive Bats force attention above the player. Cinder Wyvern is protected while airborne and releases a fire fan. Its landing creates a shockwave but also exposes the body, turning survival during flight into a planned counterattack.": "消防通道循環，灰燼狼用痕跡重新繪製安全地面，潛水蝙蝠將注意力集中在玩家上方。灰燼雙足飛龍在空中時受到保護並釋放火扇。它的著陸產生了衝擊波，但也暴露了身體，將飛行中的生存變成了有計劃的反擊。",
  "Firefly Confusion": "螢火蟲混亂",
  "Firefly Star Chain": "螢火星鏈",
  "Fires a strong leaf shot, then supports a nearby lane with a lighter volley.": "發射強力樹葉射擊，然後用較輕的齊射支援附近的車道。",
