  "Fish": "魚",
  "FISH": "螢光原位雜交",
  "Fish encounter": "魚的邂逅",
  "Fish hooked. Drag the red knob below, or slide left and right on the sea. Keep the marker in the green SAFE area.": "魚上鉤了。拖曳下面的紅色旋鈕，或在海上左右滑動。將標記保持在綠色安全區域。",
  "Fish identities: normal species pull in steady, darting, or heavy patterns. The current identity appears in the hook instruction and Sonar result. New species award an album bonus in addition to points and Reef Notes.": "魚類特徵：正常種類的魚類有穩定的、快速的或沉重的模式。當前身分出現在鉤子指令和聲納結果。除了積分和礁石筆記之外，新物種還會獎勵專輯獎勵。",
  "Fish victories grant extra salvage.": "魚類的勝利可以帶來額外的打撈。",
  "Fishing": "釣魚",
  "Fishing Collection Sim": "釣魚收集模擬",
  "Fishing Tension Campaign": "釣魚緊張運動",
  "Five Animal Map": "五動物圖",
  "Five encounters give one pack enough time to evolve without making each attempt excessively long. Combat resolves automatically so touch, pointer, and keyboard players can focus on the distinctive decision: fitting shapes and links around the next enemy rule. Difficulty grows through six mechanical families rather than one numeric curve. Each Guardian tests a learned spatial habit—Nature links, shield breaking, phase timing, ventilation, compact linking, or seal adaptation—so later stages ask for new plans instead of only larger statistics.": "五次遭遇讓狼群有足夠的時間進化，而不會讓每次嘗試過長。戰鬥會自動解決，因此觸控、指針和鍵盤玩家可以專注於獨特的決策：圍繞下一個敵人規則調整形狀和連結。難度是透過六個機械系列而不是一條數字曲線來增加的。每個守護者都會測試一種習得的空間習慣——自然連結、護盾破壞、相位計時、通風、緊湊連結或密封適應——因此後期階段需要新的計劃，而不僅僅是更大的統計數據。",
  "Five Executable Rule Families": "五個可執行規則系列",
  "Five foods from different themes are mixed together.": "五種不同主題的食物混合在一起。",
  "Five foods with five boxes, including tricky similar colors.": "五個盒子裡有五種食物，其中包括棘手的相似顏色。",
  "Five fruit shapes cross warm and green colors.": "五種水果形狀交叉溫暖和綠色。",
  "Five Missions": "五項使命",
  "Five pairs are visible for a shorter opening moment.": "有五對可見，開局時間較短。",
  "Five Physics Rules": "五個物理規則",
  "Five Rule Families": "五類規則",
  "Five Shifts": "五班倒",
  "Fix edge pieces first because their impossible outward openings remove choices.": "首先修復邊緣部件，因為它們不可能的向外開口消除了選擇。",
  "Fixed Queue": "固定隊列",
  "Fixed Queue:": "固定隊列：",
  "Flat road rewards a round balanced wheel. Stairs favor height, mud and ice need grip, tunnels require a low wide profile, gaps need width and speed, and wind rewards a narrow stable shape.": "平坦的道路獎勵圓形平衡輪。樓梯需要高度，泥土和冰需要抓地力，隧道需要低而寬的輪廓，間隙需要寬度和速度，而風則需要狹窄穩定的形狀。",
  "Flechas cometa": "彗星箭",
  "Fleet Paws": "艦隊爪子",
  "Fleet Paws:": "艦隊爪子：",
  "Flight selected. Choose a dock.": "已選擇航班。選擇一個碼頭。",
  "Flip": "翻轉",
  "Flip two cards and remember both positions.": "翻轉兩張牌並記住兩個位置。",
  "Flooded Nave": "被水淹沒的中殿",
  "Flooded Script": "淹沒腳本",
  "Floods and pulls a column; regenerates unless hit twice in one turn.": "淹沒並拉動柱子；除非一回合被擊中兩次，否則會重生。",
  "Flugrouten-Zeichenpuzzle": "Flugrouten-Zeichenpuzzle",
  "Flying and guarded foes": "飛行和守衛的敵人",
  "Flying bats ignore the ground maze.": "飛行的蝙蝠無視地面迷宮。",
  "Flying Griffin blocks Owl's ranged damage. Use Lion while it flies, then spread heroes before the grounded row sweep.": "飛行獅鷲可以阻擋貓頭鷹的遠程傷害。在獅子飛行時使用它，然後在接地排掃之前散佈英雄。",
  "Focalisez une cible.": "重點關注。",
  "Focus": "焦點",
  "Focus · Hand-Eye Coordination": "專注·手眼協調",
  "Focus {enemy}: the next squad hit gains +{bonus} damage.": "集中{enemy}：下一個小隊命中時獲得+{bonus}傷害。",
  "Focus a healer before repeatedly attacking the shield it restores.": "在重複攻擊治療者恢復的護盾之前先集中治療者。",
  "Focus Crystal": "聚焦水晶",
  "Focus one target instead of spreading shots.": "集中一個目標而不是分散射擊。",
  "Focus regenerators after the armor line breaks.": "裝甲線斷裂後集中再生器。",
  "Focus rune": "焦點符文",
  "Focus Rune": "焦點符文",
  "Focus the boss stag after clearing guards.": "清除守衛後集中boss雄鹿。",
  "Focus the healer before it restores the beast ahead.": "在治療師恢復前方的野獸之前集中註意力。",
  "FOG": "光纖陀螺儀",
  "Fog conceals the next safe rhythm.": "霧氣掩蓋了下一個安全節奏。",
  "Fogo Cruzado do Eclipse": "日食的福戈·克魯扎多",
  "Follow 30 starlight trails where previews, shuffles, ordered pairs, and rotating constellations change how each board is remembered.": "跟隨 30 條星光軌跡，預覽、洗牌、有序配對和旋轉星座會改變每個棋盤的記憶方式。",
  "Follow a gently moving basket": "跟著輕輕移動的籃子",
  "Follow animal clues and connect a word path.": "跟隨動物線索並連接一條單字路徑。",
  "Follow animal clues, connect adjacent letters or characters, and complete bilingual word trails.": "追蹤動物線索，連接相鄰的字母或字符，並完成雙語單字線索。",
  "Follow any preview, shuffle, order, or constellation-shift instruction shown by the stage.": "遵循舞台上顯示的任何預覽、隨機播放、順序或星座轉換指令。",
  "Follow comet arrows, numbered seals, and key-before-gate restrictions when present.": "遵循彗星箭頭、編號印章和門前鑰匙限制（如果存在）。",
  "Follow every violet comet trail in its arrow direction.": "沿著箭頭方向追蹤每顆紫色彗星的蹤跡。",
  "Follow patrol trail {trail}": "沿著巡邏路線{trail}",
  "Follow the cyan trail and defeat the forest patrols ({n}/8).": "沿著青色蹤跡擊敗森林巡邏隊({n}/8)。",
  "Follow the Eclipse safe ring before chasing a key outside it.": "跟隨 Eclipse 安全環，然後在其外部尋找鑰匙。",
  "Follow the green band instead of forcing every marker back to 50. Kelp, Moon, and Abyss missions deliberately make the safe center move.": "遵循綠色帶，而不是將每個標記強制回到 50。海藻、月球和深淵任務故意使安全中心移動。",
  "Follow the leaf direction into the one-way tile.": "沿著葉子方向進入單向瓷磚。",
  "Follow the leaf direction.": "順著葉子的方向走。",
