  "Garden Mist: A first-picked card closes after a gentle window if no second card is chosen; the level itself has no countdown.": "花園迷霧：如果沒有選擇第二張牌，則第一張牌會在溫和的窗口後關閉；關卡本身沒有倒數計時。",
