  "Garden Parade": "花園巡遊",
  "Garden Parade:": "花園巡遊：",
  "Garden Parade: A successful match rotates the remaining cards through their open spaces, so the mental map must follow movement.": "花園遊行：一場成功的比賽會將剩餘的牌輪流穿過它們的空位，因此心理地圖必須跟隨移動。",
  "Garden Picnic": "花園野餐",
  "Garden tile board": "花園瓷磚板",
  "Garden Two-Course": "花園兩道菜",
  "Gardens 1-10 use ten different route topologies and rise from two to six required rotations. Garden 6 introduces the dual-source completion rule.": "花園 1-10 使用 10 種不同的路線拓撲，所需旋轉次數從 2 次增加到 6 次。花園6引入了雙源完成規則。",
  "Gardens 11-20 vary multi-source networks and decoys. Gardens 21-30 use dense dual-source routes whose verified shortest solutions require ten or eleven rotations.": "花園 11-20 有不同的多源網路和誘餌。花園 21-30 使用密集的雙源路線，其經過驗證的最短解決方案需要十次或十一次旋轉。",
