  "Gate upgrade is ready": "門升級已準備就緒",
  "Gather matching spring orbs into the same vessel and restore the forest's lost colors.": "將匹配的彈簧球收集到同一個容器中並恢復森林失去的顏色。",
  "Gato": "加托",
  "Gatto": "加托",
  "GDR d'azione dall'alto": "東德阿齊奧內·達拉爾托",
  "Gear": "齒輪",
  "Gear and optional tools: Rod, Reel, Line, Bait, Boat, and Scanner have five local levels. Scanner expands earlier species pools. A three-Diamond Rare Lure guarantees one rare eligible cast, while a two-Diamond Sonar reveals and locks one next fish. Both require confirmation and neither is needed for progression.": "配備和可選工具：桿、捲軸、線、魚餌、船和掃描器有五個本地等級。掃描器擴大了早期的物種庫。三顆鑽石的稀有誘餌可確保出現一條稀有的合格魚餌，而兩顆鑽石的聲納則可揭示並鎖定下一條魚。兩者都需要確認，但進展都不需要。",
  "Gear and upgrades": "裝備和升級",
  "Gear Boots": "齒輪靴",
  "Gear Horn Rhino": "齒輪角犀牛",
  "Gear Horn Rux": "齒輪喇叭魯克斯",
  "Gear Horn Rux draws rune wheels for a forest rally cart": "Gear Horn Rux 為森林拉力車繪製符文輪",
  "Gear Horn Rux is the caravan packmaster, while Moon Cap Orla follows with a travelling shop. Clearing a stage reopens one section of road. Defeating the Root Guardian, Crystal Warden, Hollow Colossus, Furnace Leviathan, Tempest Archon, and Eclipse Hoardmaster restores all six regions and releases the stored cargo.": "Gear Horn Rux 是商隊包裝管理員，而 Moon Cap Orla 則擁有一家旅行商店。清理一個舞台會重新開放一段道路。擊敗根之守護者、水晶守望者、空心巨像、熔爐利維坦、暴風雨執政官和日蝕囤積大師可恢復所有六個區域並釋放儲存的貨物。",
  "Gear Horn Rux is the caravan&#39;s packmaster. He cannot carry every useful object in a loose pile, so his task is to make a working build from the space available. Forge tools, Nature supplies, Crystal devices, and Moon charms become stronger when matching tags touch. Moon Cap Orla follows the route with a travelling shop, offering new gear when Rux reaches a safe stop. Clearing a stage means reopening one short section of road; defeating the Guardian at Stages 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, and 30 restores an entire region. The final victory over the Eclipse Hoardmaster releases the stored cargo and reconnects all six workshops.": "齒輪·霍恩·魯克斯是商隊的背包管理員。他無法將所有有用的物品鬆散地堆放在一起，因此他的任務是利用可用空間進行工作建構。當匹配標籤接觸時，鍛造工具、自然用品、水晶裝置和月亮護身符會變得更強。 Moon Cap Orla 沿著路線設有旅行商店，當 Rux 到達安全站時提供新裝備。清理一個階段意味著重新開放一小段道路；在第 5、10、15、20、25 和 30 階段擊敗守護者可以恢復整個區域。最終戰勝日食儲藏大師釋放了儲存的貨物並重新連接了所有六個車間。",
  "Gear Horn Rux presenting an animal screw puzzle in his forest workshop": "Gear Horn Rux 在他的森林工作室中展示動物螺絲拼圖",
  "Gear Horn Rux restores wooden animal signs inside the forest workshop. Select a screw, choose an empty hole, and watch unsupported plates drop away.": "Gear Horn Rux 在森林工坊內修復木製動物標誌。選擇一個螺絲，選擇一個空孔，然後觀察不受支撐的板子掉落。",
  "Gear Horn Rux sketches rune wheels for a forest race cart": "Gear Horn Rux 為森林賽車繪製符文輪草圖",
  "Gear Horn Rux's puzzle bench": "Gear Horn Rux 的拼圖長凳",
  "Gear Jackal": "齒輪豺狼",
  "Gear Jackals gain damage as a fight continues, Magnet Beetles add damage for isolated items, and Rustwing Crows corrode Defense after each enemy turn. The Hollow Colossus alternates a braced phase that reduces Rux&#39;s strike with a rage phase that strengthens its own counterattack.": "裝備豺狼會隨著戰鬥的持續而受到傷害，磁力甲蟲會為孤立的物品增加傷害，而銹翼烏鴉會在每個敵人回合後腐蝕防禦。空心巨像會交替使用減少魯克斯攻擊的支撐階段和加強自身反擊的狂暴階段。",
  "Gear Jackals gain power every counterattack.": "裝備豺狼每次反擊都會獲得力量。",
  "Gear upgrades": "裝備升級",
  "Gear Upgrades": "裝備升級",
  "Gear, Album, and Optional Tools": "裝備、相簿和可選工具",
  "Gearpack 11 x 7": "齒輪組 11 x 7",
  "Gearwood Adventure": "吉爾伍德冒險",
  "Gearwood Trail": "吉爾伍德步道",
  "Gearwood's caravan road once linked six workshops. The route failed when its vaults reacted to the cargo: roots blocked the forest, crystals split the quarry, machines restarted in Clockwork Hollow, the foundry overheated, storm coils charged the observatory, and the Eclipse Vault sealed every recovered shipment behind a final mechanical army.": "吉爾伍德的商隊路曾經連接六個工坊。當它的金庫對貨物做出反應時，這條路線就失敗了：樹根堵塞了森林，水晶分裂了採石場，發條谷的機器重新啟動，鑄造廠過熱，風暴線圈沖向天文台，日食金庫將所有回收的貨物密封在最後的機械軍隊後面。",
  "Gearwood&#39;s caravan road once carried tools, medicine, crystal lenses, and clockwork parts between six workshops. The route failed when its storage vaults began reacting to the materials inside them. Roots grew across the first trail, moon crystals split the quarry, abandoned machines restarted in Clockwork Hollow, and heat escaped from the Ember Foundry. Storm coils then charged the observatory above the clouds, while the Eclipse Vault sealed the collected cargo behind a final mechanical army.": "吉爾伍德的商隊道路曾經在六個工坊之間運送工具、藥品、水晶鏡片和發條零件。當其儲存庫開始對其內部的材料產生反應時，這條路線就失敗了。樹根在第一條小徑上生長，月晶分裂了採石場，發條谷廢棄的機器重新啟動，餘燼鑄造廠散發出熱量。隨後，風暴線圈沖向雲層上方的天文台，而日食穹頂則將收集到的貨物密封在最後一支機械軍隊後面。",
