  "Goal": "目標",
  "Goal {n} moves": "目標{n}移動",
  "Goal {target}": "目標 {target}",
  "Goal reached! Use remaining moves for a higher score.": "目標達到了！使用剩餘的動作以獲得更高的分數。",
  "Goal: {n} moves": "目標：{n}步",
  "Goal: {name}": "目標：{name}",
  "Goal: collect golden keys before 3:00. Crystals give XP, and upgrades help the ranger survive longer.": "目標：3:00之前收集金鑰匙。水晶提供經驗值，升級可以幫助遊俠生存更久。",
  "Goal: collect golden keys before 3:00. Grab crystals to level up, then choose upgrades when the cards appear.": "目標：3:00之前收集金鑰匙。抓住水晶來升級，然後在卡片出現時選擇升級。",
  "Goal: defeat {enemies}": "目標：擊敗{enemies}",
  "Goal: Lion King Ball": "目標：獅子王球",
  "Goals use score, animal tier, merge count, combo, or a dual tier-plus-score checkpoint.": "目標使用分數、動物等級、合併計數、組合或雙層加分數檢查點。",
  "Goals, arena layouts, pickups, hazards, and rival behavior change together across the thirty authored races.": "在 30 場編寫的比賽中，目標、競技場佈局、接球、危險和對手行為都會改變。",
  "Goals, Scoring, and Board Rules": "目標、計分和董事會規則",
  "Gold": "黃金",
  "Gold belongs only to the current expedition and is earned from encounters or selling equipment. Diamonds are a shared optional currency. At one shop stop, three Diamonds can replace Orla&#39;s three offered items after a separate confirmation; the refresh is never required to continue or defeat a Guardian. Workshop XP, discovered item entries, completed stages, and the next unlocked stage are saved locally.": "金幣只屬於當前的探險，可以透過遭遇或出售裝備來獲得。鑽石是一種共享的可選貨幣。在一個商店，經過單獨確認後，三顆鑽石可以代替 Orla 提供的三件商品；繼續或擊敗守護者不需要刷新。創意工坊 XP、發現的物品條目、完成的階段和下一個解鎖的階段都保存在本地。",
  "Gold Coins Earned +35%": "賺取金幣+35%",
  "Gold Earned": "獲得金幣",
  "Golden Defender Frame": "金色後衛框",
  "Golden key nearby: move through it to raise your score.": "附近的金鑰匙：透過它來提高你的分數。",
  "Golden Keys Collected": "收集金鑰匙",
  "Golden keys satisfy the current stage objective and add to lifetime Patrol Rank. Calmed enemies drop temporary XP crystals; each level pauses play and offers three choices from damage, range, speed, max HP, attack interval, and pickup radius.": "金鑰匙滿足目前階段的目標並增加終身巡邏等級。平靜的敵人會掉落臨時經驗水晶；每個關卡都會暫停遊戲，並提供三種選擇：傷害、範圍、速度、最大生命值、攻擊間隔和拾取半徑。",
  "Golden keys serve two purposes. The current-stage count is the clear objective, while lifetime keys fill the Patrol Rank record on Main. XP crystals are temporary and belong only to the current attempt. They raise the current level and open upgrade choices; they are not a currency and cannot be saved for another stage. Health also resets at the beginning of each patrol.": "金鑰匙有兩個用途。當前階段的計數是明確的目標，而終身鑰匙則填補了主線上的巡邏排名記錄。 XP水晶是暫時的，只屬於目前的嘗試。他們提高當前等級並開放升級選擇；它們不是貨幣，不能保存到另一個階段。每次巡邏開始時，生命值也會重置。",
  "Golden Relic Mail": "黃金遺物郵件",
  "Golden Star Trail": "金色星軌",
  "Golem Approach": "傀儡方法",
  "Golem delle Radici": "拉蒂奇傀儡",
  "Golem des Racines": "拉辛傀儡",
  "Golem guards combine every previous threat.": "傀儡守衛結合了之前的所有威脅。",
  "Golpe pesado": "戈爾佩佩薩多",
  "Goma": "戈馬",
  "Goma afilada": "戈馬阿菲拉達",
  "Good": "好",
  "Good effort! Every pair you found was useful memory and focus practice.": "好努力！你發現的每一對都是有用的記憶和注意力練習。",
  "Good effort! Try again to become more familiar with animal features.": "好努力！再次嘗試更熟悉動物的特徵。",
  "Good effort! Try again to improve focus and choose the best care item.": "好努力！再次嘗試提高專注力並選擇最佳護理項目。",
  "Good effort! Try again to improve focus and color matching.": "好努力！再次嘗試改善焦點和色彩匹配。",
  "Good effort! Try again to improve focus and combo planning.": "好努力！再次嘗試改善焦點和組合計劃。",
  "Good effort! Try again to improve focus and finish more orders.": "好努力！再次嘗試提高注意力並完成更多訂單。",
  "Good effort! Try again to improve planning and placement.": "好努力！再次嘗試改進規劃和佈局。",
  "Good effort! Try again to protect the wall a little longer.": "好努力！再次嘗試將牆壁保護得更久一點。",
  "Good effort. Recruit animals and upgrade the gate to grow faster.": "很好的努力。招募動物並升級大門以更快成長。",
  "Good effort. Short practice helps reaction and focus.": "很好的努力。簡短的練習有助於反應和集中註意力。",
  "Good effort. Try a different route shape or upgrade key blockers earlier.": "很好的努力。嘗試不同的路線形狀或儘早升級關鍵攔截器。",
  "Good effort. Try placing guards earlier to improve your next run.": "很好的努力。嘗試更早放置後衛以改善您的下一次跑步。",
  "Good focus practice: your next goal is to collect more crystals early so upgrades arrive sooner.": "良好的專注練習：您的下一個目標是儘早收集更多水晶，以便升級更快到達。",
  "Good helper!": "好幫手！",
  "Good practice: try guarding before enemy turns and focus one beast at a time.": "好的做法：嘗試在敵人轉向之前進行防守，並一次集中一隻野獸。",
  "Good. Keep sliding gently and stay in SAFE until the fish is landed.": "很好。繼續輕輕滑動並保持安全狀態，直到魚上岸。",
