  "Gravity Forge": "重力鍛造",
  "Gravity pulls the fruit down while the active wind changes its horizontal speed. When the fruit touches the leaf, the contact point determines the new route. A centered hit produces a straighter upward arc. A hit near the left or right edge adds more sideways force. The leaf can be moved again before the fruit returns, allowing a second correction instead of locking the player into the first aim.": "重力將水果向下拉，而活躍的風改變其水平速度。當果實接觸葉子時，接觸點決定新的路線。居中擊打會產生較直的向上弧線。靠近左邊緣或右邊緣的擊打會增加更多的側向力。在水果返回之前，葉子可以再次移動，從而允許進行第二次修正，而不是將玩家鎖定在第一個目標。",
  "Gravity Well": "重力井",
  "Gray": "灰色",
