  "Guardian Medal": "守護者勳章",
  "Guardian Nursery": "守護者托兒所",
  "Guardian pattern": "守護圖案",
  "Guardian phases: each regional Boss changes at 70 and 35 percent HP. Moss calls more rushers. Echo releases larger radial barrages. Crystal restores a hit-count ward. Mire heals and summons slowing beasts. Moon combines orbit movement with silence volleys. Crown adds wards, barrages, summons and recovery. The final mission therefore tests reading several effects, not only surviving a longer health bar.": "守護者階段：每個地區Boss的生命值分別為70%和35%。莫斯召喚更多衝鋒者。迴聲會釋放更大的徑向彈幕。水晶恢復命中計數守衛。泥沼可以治癒並召喚減速的野獸。月球將軌道運動與靜默齊射結合。皇冠增加了守衛、彈幕、召喚和恢復。因此，最終任務測試讀取多種效果，而不僅僅是在更長的生命條中生存。",
  "Guardian regrew": "守護者重生",
  "Guardian Rift": "守護者裂谷",
  "Guardian Route": "守護者路線",
  "Guardian route cleared": "守護者路線已清除",
  "Guardian Scale": "守護者秤",
  "Guardian sequences repeat a deliberate safe-lane rhythm. Use the first two gates to identify the pattern.": "守護者序列重複著刻意的安全車道節奏。使用前兩個門來識別模式。",
