  "Health and failure:": "健康與失敗：",
  "Health persists through the five encounters in one expedition, but every item can be picked up and rearranged between fights. The tray and placed gear share a twelve-item limit. After a victory, take one of three loot items or continue without loot. Gold earned in that expedition buys Orla's stock or comes from selling unwanted gear.": "在一次探險中的五次遭遇中，生命值會持續存在，但每件物品都可以在戰鬥之間拾取和重新排列。托盤和放置的裝備共享十二件物品的限制。勝利後，取得三件戰利品之一，或不帶戰利品繼續遊戲。在那次探險中賺取的黃金可以購買奧拉的股票或來自出售不需要的裝備。",
  "Health persists through the five encounters in one expedition, but the pack can be rebuilt between fights. This makes a short-term defensive item valuable even when it is not part of the final Boss plan. The tray and placed equipment share a twelve-item carrying limit, so taking every reward is not always correct. A full pack can continue without loot, and selling an item returns part of its Gold value.": "在一次探險的五次遭遇戰中，生命值會持續存在，但隊伍可以在戰鬥之間重建。這使得短期防禦物品很有價值，即使它不是最終 Boss 計劃的一部分。托盤和放置的裝備共享十二件物品的攜帶限制，因此獲取每件獎勵並不總是正確的。完整的包可以在沒有戰利品的情況下繼續使用，並且出售物品會返回其金幣價值的一部分。",
