  "Hint": "提示",
  "Hint corrects one route mirror that differs from the authored solution and ignores untouched decoys. Reset restores every starting rotation.": "提示會修正與所寫的解決方案不同的一個路由鏡像，並忽略未觸及的誘餌。重置可恢復每次開始旋轉。",
  "Hint highlights and focuses one currently legal pair. Undo restores exactly the last removed pair, including any seal, rescue, or patrol-route state changed by that match.": "提示突出顯示並聚焦當前合法的一對。撤銷可準確恢復最後刪除的對，包括由該配對更改的任何密封、救援或巡邏路線狀態。",
  "Hint highlights one legal pair. Undo restores both tiles plus the exact prior key and rescue state. Shuffle is disabled while a move exists; during a dead end it preserves special tokens and guarantees a playable pair.": "提示突出顯示一對合法的。撤銷會恢復兩個圖塊以及確切的先前金鑰和救援狀態。當存在移動時，隨機播放被禁用；在死胡同中，它會保留特殊的令牌並保證可玩的對。",
  "Hint starts the next unfound word, Clear removes the current path, and Undo removes its last tile. Correct words remain marked, stars reflect hint use, and the best result for each language and trail stays in local browser storage.": "提示開始下一個找不到的單字，清除刪除目前路徑，撤銷刪除其最後一個圖塊。正確的單字仍然被標記，星星反映提示的使用，每種語言和線索的最佳結果保留在本地瀏覽器儲存中。",
  "Hint: {line} {number} clue {clue} forces cell {cell} {state}.": "提示：{line}{number}線索{clue}強制單元格{cell}{state}。",
  "Hint: no single row or column is forced yet. Cross-check the intersecting clues.": "提示：尚未強制任何單行或列。交叉檢查交叉線索。",
  "Hint: one certain cell was painted.": "提示：某個單元格已被塗漆。",
  "Hints": "提示",
  "Hints, empty taps, found targets, unaided finds, stars, unlocks, and best times feed the supportive Result and Skill Report. They stay in this browser and are not uploaded as a test score or public leaderboard.": "提示、空點擊、找到的目標、獨立發現、星星、解鎖和最佳時間為支援結果和技能報告提供支援。它們保留在此瀏覽器中，不會上傳為測驗分數或公共排行榜。",
  "Hinweis": "欣維斯",
  "Hinweis des Entwicklungsteams": "蒸汽機注意事項",
  "Hinweis: In {line} {number} erzwingt die Vorgabe {clue}, dass Feld {cell} {state} ist.": "註： 在 {line} {number} erzwingt die Vorgabe {clue} 中，dass Feld {cell} {state} ist。",
  "Hinweis: Noch ist keine einzelne Zeile oder Spalte eindeutig. Gleiche die Kreuzhinweise ab.": "註：Noch ist keine einzelne Zeile oder Spalte eindeutig。 Gleiche die Kreuzhinweise ab。",
