  "Hit Mirecoil Serpent with two heroes in one turn; one large Skill does not stop regeneration.": "一回合用兩名英雄擊中米爾卷蛇；一大技能不會停止再生。",
  "Hit near the middle of the leaf for height. Use the left or right edge only when the basket is far across the clearing.": "擊中葉子中部附近以獲得高度。僅當籃子遠離空地時才使用左邊緣或右邊緣。",
