  "Hold": "抓住",
  "Hold and drag across the archive, then release to move Fia.": "按住並拖曳存檔，然後放開以移動 Fia。",
  "Hold and drag in the archive to preview a route. Release to move Fia, or use WASD and arrow keys for shorter desktop steps.": "按住並拖曳存檔以預覽路線。放開即可移動 Fia，或使用 WASD 和箭頭鍵縮短桌面步驟。",
  "Hold and drag through the scene to preview Fia's route, then release to move.": "按住並拖曳場景以預覽 Fia 的路線，然後放開即可移動。",
  "Hold happiness at 85 while tickets wait in the box.": "當門票在盒子裡等待時，將幸福保持在 85。",
  "Hold in the reef play area to charge the cast, then release to cast.": "按住礁石遊樂區即可為施法者蓄力，然後放開即可施法。",
  "Hold in the reef play area to charge, then release to cast.": "按住礁石遊樂區進行衝鋒，然後放開施放。",
  "Hold in the reef to charge, release to cast.": "按住礁石即可衝鋒，鬆開即可施放。",
  "Hold one continuous line through 30 original trails, avoid walls and moving shadows, and guide Mimi to the paw portal.": "在 30 條原始路徑中保持一條連續的路線，避開牆壁和移動的陰影，並引導咪咪到達爪子入口。",
  "Hold one lane with Turtle while Lion splits the pack.": "與海龜一起守住一條車道，而獅子則分頭行動。",
  "Hold or drag inside the archive to preview a dashed route. Release to move Fia to that point. On desktop, WASD and the arrow keys provide shorter bounded steps.": "在存檔內按住或拖曳以預覽虛線路線。放開即可將 Fia 移至該點。在桌面上，WASD 和箭頭鍵提供更短的有界步驟。",
  "Hold or drag to guide the ring · Arrow keys / WASD": "按住或拖曳以引導環·箭頭鍵/WASD",
  "Hold or drag toward a point to move continuously.": "按住或拖曳至某點可連續移動。",
  "Hold or drag toward a point, use the direction keys, or use WASD to steer. Momentum continues after input changes, so wide turns are safer near large hazards.": "按住或向某點拖曳，使用方向鍵或使用 WASD 進行轉向。輸入變化後動力會持續，因此在靠近大危險時大轉彎會更安全。",
  "Hold Shift or choose Pull to spend a magnetic charge.": "按住 Shift 或選擇「拉取」，消耗一次磁力拉取。",
  "Hold the route": "保持路線",
  "Hold the sea or Space to cast. When a fish bites, drag the red knob, slide on the sea, or use Left and Right arrows.": "握住大海或空間施放。當魚咬鉤時，拖曳紅色旋鈕，在海面上滑動，或使用向左和向右箭頭。",
  "Hold the water or Space and release the cast. A strong cast reduces time spent waiting for a bite.": "握住水或空間並釋放石膏。堅固的石膏可以減少等待被咬的時間。",
  "Hold the water or Space, release the cast, and wait for the named fish to bite.": "握住水或空間，釋放演員，等待指定的魚咬鉤。",
  "Hold the water to cast. When a fish bites, use the red knob below.": "持水施放。當魚咬鉤時，使用下面的紅色旋鈕。",
  "Hold to preview a route.": "按住可預覽路線。",
