  "Homecoming Valley": "歸鄉谷",
  "Homecoming Valley once used painted fruit signs to guide animals from the forest, meadow, river, ridge, farms, and festival grounds. Wind and rain scattered the signs, covered shortcuts with mud, washed away stepping stones, and locked garden gates. As junior route keeper, the player rebuilds each safe trip.": "歸鄉谷曾經使用彩繪水果標誌來引導動物從森林、草地、河流、山脊、農場和節慶場地出發。風吹雨打，招牌散落，捷徑被泥土覆蓋，踏腳石被沖走，花園大門被鎖。作為初級路線守護者，玩家重建每趟安全旅程。",
