  "Hunters try to hold distance while Ravens change approach angles. Eclipse Archowl slows its pursuit and fires timed volleys across open space.": "獵人試圖保持距離，而烏鴉則改變接近角度。日蝕弓箭手放慢了追擊速度，並在空地上進行定時齊射。",
