  "Infinite Forest begins with two random low-tier animals, has no move limit, and ends only when no legal slide or merge remains. Values continue beyond 2048, and its best score, highest tile, move count, and run count are saved separately from campaign stars and unlocks.": "無限森林以兩隻隨機的低級動物開始，沒有移動限制，只有在沒有合法的滑動或合併時才結束。數值會持續到 2048 以上，並且其最佳得分、最高分塊、移動計數和運行計數與戰役星星和解鎖項目分開保存。",
