  "Is there a timer?": "有計時器嗎？",
  "It applies a repeating sideways force to moving balls inside the physics box, and its direction changes over time.": "它對物理盒內移動的球施加重複的側向力，並且其方向隨時間而變化。",
  "It applies alternating sideways force to moving balls inside the box.": "它對盒子內移動的球施加交替的側向力。",
  "It becomes available only when no legal matching pair remains.": "僅當不存在合法匹配對時才可用。",
  "It becomes movable after enough upper plates have been released.": "當足夠的上板被釋放後，它就可以移動了。",
  "It can practice animal recognition, focus, hand-eye coordination, and simple care ideas such as food, water, cleaning, and play.": "它可以練習動物識別、注意力、手眼協調以及食物、水、清潔和玩耍等簡單的護理理念。",
  "It cools Emberlight into harmless steam.": "它將餘燼之光冷卻成無害的蒸汽。",
  "It crosses active traffic and will raise congestion while both flights occupy the conflict.": "當兩個航班都佔據衝突時，它會穿越活躍的交通並加劇擁擠。",
  "It did not match your color or your current capacity was full.": "它與您的顏色不匹配或您當前的容量已滿。",
  "It doubles that rune ability after all three reels stop.": "三個捲軸全部停止後，符文能力會加倍。",
  "It ends when none of the remaining pieces can fit.": "當剩餘的碎片都無法容納時，它就結束了。",
  "It has no move limit. The run ends only when the board has no legal move, then saves your best score and highest animal.": "它沒有移動限制。只有當棋盤沒有合法移動時，運行才會結束，然後保存您的最佳成績和最高動物。",
  "It highlights the next cell in one possible complete route.": "它突出顯示一條可能的完整路線中的下一個單元格。",
  "It is a visible animal not printed on the current list. It can be dismissed but does not count as a find.": "它是一種可見的動物，未列在目前清單中。它可以被駁回，但不算作發現。",
  "It is an automatic match created after cleared snacks fall and the board refills. Consecutive cascades increase the score multiplier.": "這是在清理完的零食掉落並且棋盤重新填滿後創建的自動匹配。連續級聯會增加分數乘數。",
  "It is an automatic match made after cleared snacks fall and the board refills.": "這是清理完的零食落下並重新填滿棋盤後自動進行的匹配。",
  "It is full, sealed, or its top color does not match.": "它已滿、密封，或其頂部顏色不匹配。",
  "It is raining.": "正在下雨。",
  "It is stored in this browser. Clearing browser site data or switching devices may remove or separate the save.": "它儲存在該瀏覽器中。清除瀏覽器網站資料或切換裝置可能會刪除或分離儲存。",
  "It is stored in this browser. Clearing site data or switching devices may remove or separate the save.": "它儲存在該瀏覽器中。清除網站資料或切換裝置可能會刪除或分離儲存。",
  "It is too cold.": "天氣太冷了。",
  "It is too dark.": "天太黑了。",
  "It is too hot.": "天氣太熱了。",
  "It occupies the nearest open position around the bubble physically touched; it should not jump to a distant hidden cell.": "它佔據物理接觸的氣泡周圍最近的打開位置；它不應該跳到遠處的隱藏單元格。",
  "It pulls for longer. Stay patient near the middle.": "它拉的時間更長。在中間附近保持耐心。",
  "It raises attack for the current defense, and later formations are balanced around that increase.": "它提高了當前防禦的攻擊力，隨後的陣型圍繞著該增加進行平衡。",
  "It rearranges the remaining values without changing the sum-to-ten rule.": "它會重新排列剩餘的值，而不更改總和為 10 的規則。",
  "It removes 12 unspent sun once, but it never removes an already placed guard.": "它會移除 12 個未消耗的太陽一次，但它永遠不會移除已經放置的守衛。",
  "It removes 12 unspent sun once. Existing guards are not removed, so spending on a needed defense early is a valid response.": "一次可消除 12 個未消耗的陽光。現有的防護措施不會被撤除，因此儘早在所需的防禦上投入資金是一個有效的應對措施。",
  "It requires both a named snack quantity and a score target.": "它需要指定的零食數量和分數目標。",
  "It restores screw positions, fallen plates, and the move count before the last move.": "它可以恢復螺絲位置、掉落的板以及上次移動之前的移動計數。",
  "It restores the board, goals, score, tray, and move state before the last placement.": "它恢復上次放置之前的棋盤、目標、得分、托盤和移動狀態。",
  "It restores the complete state before your last placement.": "它會恢復上次放置之前的完整狀態。",
  "It restores the previous board, score, move count, objective progress, and deterministic spawn state.": "它恢復之前的棋盤、得分、移動計數、目標進度和確定性生成狀態。",
  "It reveals the exact left and right outcomes for the current zone; ordinary cards otherwise show estimates and environmental clues.": "它揭示了當前區域的準確左、右結果；普通卡片也顯示估計和環境線索。",
  "It starts the next word with its first tile.": "它從第一個圖塊開始下一個單字。",
  "It uses the nearest open position around the bubble physically touched.": "它使用物理接觸的氣泡周圍最近的打開位置。",
  "It uses timing pressure, gear choices, collection progress, and optional Diamond spending, so it is deeper than younger-child games.": "它使用計時壓力、裝備選擇、收集進度和可選的鑽石消費，因此它比低齡兒童遊戲更有深度。",
