  "Keep {n} tickets in the box": "將 {n} 門票放在盒子裡",
  "Keep a chain of clean descents to charge Comet Break, then continue to the rescue gate.": "保持一連串乾淨的下降來衝鋒彗星斷裂，然後繼續前往救援門。",
  "Keep a corner stable and protect empty spaces.": "保持角落穩定並保護空閒空間。",
  "Keep a second damage zone near the core.": "在核心附近保留第二個傷害區。",
  "Keep a spare blocker for the lane marked by the rush warning.": "在有緊急警告標記的車道上保留一個備用阻擋器。",
  "Keep an escape cell open while charges divide the squad.": "當衝鋒將小隊分開時，保持逃脫室開放。",
  "Keep at least one buffer hole available for the next layer.": "至少為下一層保留一個可用的緩衝孔。",
  "Keep at least one empty vessel available as working space.": "至少保留一個空容器作為工作空間。",
  "Keep at least one path open, or blocked enemies will attack the nearest defender until the route reopens.": "至少保持一條路徑暢通，否則被阻擋的敵人將攻擊最近的防御者，直到路線重新打開。",
  "Keep baking": "繼續烘烤",
  "Keep bonus treasure after one capture in the next mission. Tap again to confirm: {before} → {after} Diamonds.": "在下一個任務中捕獲一次後保留獎勵寶藏。再次點選確認：{before}→{after}鑽石。",
  "Keep both edges active instead of emptying only one side.": "保持兩側邊緣處於活動狀態，而不是僅清空一側。",
  "Keep both sides of the board moving. Emptying one side too early can leave the opposite edge with fewer useful matches.": "保持板的兩側移動。過早清空一側可能會導致相對邊緣的有用匹配減少。",
  "Keep Cloudline Skyport moving.": "讓 Cloudline Skyport 繼續前進。",
  "Keep coloring": "繼續著色",
  "Keep core HP above zero through Wave 3. Victory saves the next route and Star Stones; failure still saves the earned Star Stones and leaves the best unlocked route intact.": "透過第 3 波將核心生命值保持在零以上。勝利可節省下一條路線和星石；失敗仍可保存獲得的星石，並完好無損地保留最佳的解鎖路線。",
  "Keep current gear": "保持目前檔位",
  "Keep Current Gear": "保持當前裝備",
  "Keep diving": "繼續潛水",
  "Keep dragging or using ← → under the fruit and bounce it toward the glowing basket.": "繼續在水果下方拖曳或使用 ← → 並將其彈向發光的籃子。",
  "Keep empty spaces available so the board can continue moving.": "保留可用的空白空間，以便板子可以繼續移動。",
  "Keep evolving · Best {best}": "不斷進化·最好{best}",
  "Keep Exploring": "不斷探索",
  "Keep exploring! Focus on picking up keys and keeping your health up.": "繼續探索！專注於拿起鑰匙並保持健康。",
  "Keep Fishing": "繼續釣魚",
  "Keep going—each cell may be used only once.": "繼續－每個單元只能使用一次。",
  "Keep going—fill every garden tile.": "繼續前進——填滿每一塊花園瓷磚。",
  "Keep growing your park": "繼續發展你的公園",
  "Keep helping": "繼續提供協助",
  "Keep helping!": "繼續幫忙！",
  "Keep holding while tracing inside the turquoise corridor.": "在綠松石色走廊內追蹤時繼續按住。",
  "Keep large animals low and near the center while preserving an open lane for unmatched small balls.": "將大型動物保持在較低位置並靠近中心，同時為無與倫比的小球保留開放的通道。",
  "Keep matching small animals on the same side, but preserve one open lane for pieces that do not fit the current chain.": "繼續在同一側匹配小動物，但為不適合當前鏈條的棋子保留一條開放通道。",
  "Keep moving the leaf while the fruit falls and bounce it toward the basket.": "當水果掉落時繼續移動葉子並將其彈向籃子。",
  "Keep one continuous hold.": "保持一次連續保持。",
  "Keep one dock and one approach lane available for urgent arrivals.": "保留 1 個碼頭和 1 條引道以供緊急抵達。",
  "Keep one flexible empty vessel until the middle of the solution.": "保留一個靈活的空容器直到溶液的中間。",
  "Keep Orla behind the last bend.": "讓 Orla 留在最後一個彎道後面。",
  "Keep playing": "繼續玩",
  "Keep Playing": "繼續玩",
  "Keep ranged coverage near the crystal during Bat Crossing and later flying stages because bats bypass ground blockers. Slow boars before their armor breaks on storm stages so their wounded speed surge is less dangerous.": "在蝙蝠穿越和後來的飛行階段，在水晶附近保持遠程覆蓋，因為蝙蝠會繞過地面阻擋物。在風暴階段，在野豬的盔甲破裂之前減緩它們的速度，這樣它們受傷的速度激增就不那麼危險了。",
  "Keep ranged damage near the core.": "將遠程傷害保持在核心附近。",
  "Keep reading": "繼續閱讀",
  "Keep running": "繼續奔跑",
  "Keep serving as the queue grows and use earned coins for cafe upgrades.": "隨著隊列的增長繼續服務，並使用賺取的硬幣來升級咖啡館。",
  "Keep several differently shaped open areas instead of one narrow gap.": "保留幾個不同形狀的開放區域，而不是狹窄的間隙。",
  "Keep sorting": "繼續排序",
  "Keep steering while the fruit falls and use the leaf contact point to change its direction.": "當水果掉落時保持轉向，並使用葉子接觸點來改變其方向。",
  "Keep steering while the fruit moves. Use the center of the leaf for height or an edge to add sideways distance.": "當水果移動時保持轉向。使用葉子的中心作為高度，或使用邊緣來增加側向距離。",
  "Keep the animal tower under the red warning line.": "將動物塔保持在紅色警戒線以下。",
  "Keep the clue meaning in mind instead of testing every visible sequence.": "記住線索的意義，而不是測試每個可見的序列。",
  "Keep the largest animal near a corner, but avoid filling both neighboring edges with unmatched low tiers.": "將最大的動物放在角落附近，但避免用無與倫比的低層填充兩個相鄰邊緣。",
  "Keep the pile below the red line and complete the current goal before the drop budget ends.": "將堆放在紅線以下並在下降預算結束之前完成當前目標。",
  "Keep the pile below the red line while working toward the current tier, merge-count, combo, score, or dual checkpoint goal.": "保持堆在紅線以下，同時努力實現目前層、合併計數、組合、得分或雙檢查點目標。",
  "Keep the second jump until a moving ledge, spread shot, or hazard cycle confirms the safe landing.": "保持第二次跳躍，直到移動壁架、分散射擊或危險循環確認安全著陸。",
  "Keep the top row open to vent its furnace pulse.": "保持頂排打開以釋放爐脈衝。",
  "Keep the wall above zero HP until every normal beast and Boss is defeated.": "保持牆的生命值高於零，直到擊敗所有普通野獸和 Boss。",
  "Keep the weakest hero outside the Raven's range.": "將最弱的英雄置於烏鴉的射程之外。",
