  "Light and Dark": "光明與黑暗",
  "Light every trail to finish the constellation and unlock the next stage.": "照亮每條痕跡以完成星座並解鎖下一階段。",
  "Light every trail to restore the constellation and unlock the next stage.": "照亮每條痕跡以恢復星座並解鎖下一階段。",
  "Light Everything": "照亮一切",
  "Lightning Dash": "閃電衝刺",
  "Lightning Dash shortens a committed move, making it useful for crossing a patrol line. Star Decoy pauses patrol movement for a level-based duration and is strongest where several routes overlap. Smoke Leaf resets Alert and adds a brief cover window, so it can rescue a run that has already become dangerous. A confirmed three-Diamond reroll changes the three offered gadget strengths. A confirmed five-Diamond insurance policy preserves optional treasure after one capture. These are optional platform choices: neither Diamonds nor insurance unlock missions, guardian encounters, medals, or free retries.": "閃電衝刺縮短了承諾的移動時間，使其在穿越巡邏線時非常有用。星誘餌會暫停巡邏運動一段時間，並且在多條路線重疊的情況下最強。菸葉重置警報並添加一個短暫的掩護窗口，因此它可以挽救已經變得危險的逃脫。已確認的三鑽重擲改變了所提供的三種裝備的優勢。一份已確認的五鑽保險單可在一次捕獲後保留可選的寶藏。這些是可選的平台選擇：鑽石和保險都不能解鎖任務、守護者遭遇、獎章或免費重試。",
  "Lightning Hollow": "閃電空洞",
  "Lightning Signs": "閃電標誌",
  "Lightning strikes the player mark, then two mirrored marks.": "閃電擊中玩家標記，然後是兩個鏡像標記。",
  "Lince de bobina": "林斯·德·博比納",
  "LINE ×{value}": "線×{value}",
  "Line broke. The tension marker left the safe band too long.": "線斷了。張力標記離開安全帶太長。",
  "Line Clear removes the entire row it hits": "行清除會刪除它所命中的整行",
  "Line control: after a bite, drag the red knob, slide on the sea, or use Left and Right. SAFE control removes fish power. Remaining outside the band too long breaks the line, returns to casting, and leaves the mission clock running.": "線路控制：咬一口後，拖曳紅色旋鈕，在海上滑動，或使用左、右。安全控制消除了魚的力量。在樂隊之外停留太久就會打破路線，返回選角，並讓任務時鐘繼續運行。",
