  "Mist Crown": "霧冠",
  "Mist Crown Monarch": "霧之冠君",
  "Mist Crown rules: temporary curses cost one Energy to remove; holding one at turn end deals damage before it cycles through discard. The triad ward blocks direct damage until Attack, Defense and Utility cards have all been used. Progress crosses turns, but the final Boss can rebuild the ward.": "迷霧王冠規則：暫時詛咒需要消耗 1 點能量才能消除；在回合結束時持有一個會在其循環丟棄之前造成傷害。三合一守衛會阻擋直接傷害，直到攻擊、防禦和實用卡都被使用為止。進度會跨越多個回合，但最終的 Boss 可以重建守衛。",
