  "Moon Bow": "月弓",
  "Moon Cap Orla": "奧拉月帽",
  "Moon Cap Orla and Rainbow Hop Mimi have found thirty forest fountains whose colors were mixed by a storm. Every solved vessel restores one fountain. Seals, vessels of different sizes, and tighter routes represent damaged parts of the spring network that must be repaired in the correct order.": "Moon Cap Orla 和 Rainbow Hop Mimi 發現了 30 個森林噴泉，它們的顏色因暴風雨而混合。每解決一個容器就會恢復一個噴泉。密封件、不同尺寸的容器和較緊的路線代表彈簧網路的損壞部分，必須以正確的順序進行修復。",
  "Moon Cap Orla guiding a lunar recovery ring": "奧拉月帽引導月球回收環",
  "Moon Cap Orla guiding an animal evolution puzzle": "奧拉月帽引導動物進化之謎",
  "Moon Cap Orla guiding animal carts through a forest plaza": "Moon Cap Orla 引導動物車穿越森林廣場",
  "Moon Cap Orla maintains a moonlit sanctuary where matching animal spirits combine into stronger forms. The thirty campaign missions are her field lessons: the player restores each sanctuary board by reaching a named animal tier, completing a required number of merges, or earning a target score before the move supply runs out.": "奧拉月帽維護著一個月光庇護所，在那裡，相配的動物靈魂結合成更強大的形式。三十個戰役任務是她的實地課程：玩家透過達到指定的動物等級、完成所需數量的合併或在移動供應耗盡之前獲得目標分數來恢復每個庇護所圖板。",
  "Moon Cap Orla plans each entry from the safehouse while Spark Paw Fia enters the archive. Fia is not there to attack the guards. The task is to recover misplaced moon seals, courier tokens, star maps, clockwork lenses, and district relics without escalating the lockdown. Clearing a mission restores one route on Orla&#39;s archive map. Passing the Lantern Auditor, Bell Warden, Mirror Keeper, Clockwork Marshal, Vault Sealkeeper, and Eclipse Curator proves that an entire five-mission wing is safe again. Completing Mission 30 resolves the Curator&#39;s eclipse route and ends the current campaign; the result does not pretend that a nonexistent Mission 31 is available.": "Moon Cap Orla 計劃著安全屋的每次進入，而 Spark Paw Fia 則進入檔案室。菲亞並不是來攻擊守衛的。任務是在不升級封鎖的情況下找回遺失的月球封印、信使代幣、星圖、發條鏡頭和地區文物。完成一項任務會恢復奧拉檔案地圖上的一條路線。透過提燈審計員、貝爾看守者、鏡子守護者、發條元帥、秘庫封印者和日食館長的考驗，證明整個五任務翼再次安全。完成任務 30 可以解決館長的日食路線並結束當前的戰役；結果並不假裝不存在的 Mission 31 可用。",
  "Moon Cap Orla plans each entry while Spark Paw Fia enters the archive. Fia is not fighting the guards: the job is to recover the misplaced seals, courier tokens, star maps, clockwork lenses, and district relics without escalating the lockdown. Clearing a mission restores one route to the archive map. Passing the Lantern Auditor, Bell Warden, Mirror Keeper, Clockwork Marshal, Vault Sealkeeper, and Eclipse Curator proves that an entire five-mission wing is safe. Mission 30 ends the lockdown by completing the Curator's full eclipse route; it does not invent a false Mission 31.": "Moon Cap Orla 計劃每個條目，而 Spark Paw Fia 則進入檔案。國際汽聯並不是在與警衛作戰：他們的工作是在不升級封鎖的情況下找回丟失的印章、信使代幣、星圖、發條鏡頭和地區文物。清除任務會恢復通往存檔地圖的一條路線。透過提燈審計員、貝爾看守者、鏡子守護者、發條元帥、秘庫封印者和日食館長的通過證明整個五任務翼是安全的。任務 30 以完成館長號的全食路線來結束封鎖；它並沒有發明虛假的Mission 31。",
  "Moon Cap Orla runs the dispatch tower while Gear Horn Rux maintains cargo, passenger, and repair docks. Bubble Fin Nori handles urgent courier and rescue flights. Together they keep the Cloudline district moving through ordinary arrivals, cargo crossings, storms, repair windows, and a final festival rush.": "Moon Cap Orla 負責營運調度塔，而 Gear Horn Rux 負責維護貨運、客運和維修碼頭。 Bubble Fin Nori 負責處理緊急快遞和救援航班。他們一起讓 Cloudline 區在普通到達、貨物過境、暴風雨、維修窗口和最後的節日高峰期間保持正常運作。",
  "Moon Cap Orla studies the crossing from above. Every wooden animal cart can leave only in the direction it faces, so the safest route depends on which paths are already clear.": "奧拉月帽從上方觀察這次穿越。每輛木製動物車只能沿著它所面向的方向離開，所以最安全的路線取決於哪些路徑已經暢通。",
  "Moon Cap Orla uses a controlled recovery ring to remove corrupted nonliving debris and uncover stranded rescue cores.": "Moon Cap Orla 使用受控回收環清除損壞的非生命碎片並發現擱淺的救援核心。",
