  "Moon Veil Moths suppress Moon links and Prism Rams hide behind larger barriers. Mixed materials become safer than relying on one repeated charm. The Crystal Warden adds an eighteen-point prism shield and reflects shards after its core is exposed.": "月幕蛾壓制月球鏈接，棱鏡公羊躲在更大的障礙後面。混合材料比依賴一種重複的魅力更安全。水晶守望者增加了一個十八點棱鏡護盾，並在其核心暴露後反射碎片。",
  "Moon Veil Moths, Coil Lynxes, Tag Sealers, and the final Guardian can suppress or rotate a material tag. The active seal appears above the battle.": "月幕飛蛾、盤卷山貓、標籤封印者和最終守護者可以抑製或旋轉材料標籤。主動封印出現在戰鬥上方。",
