  "Moonwater channels beneath Taro's fortress shell have tangled with Emberlight, shadows, and ancient rune locks.": "太郎堡壘外殼下的月水通道與灰燼之光、陰影和古老的符文鎖糾纏在一起。",
  "Moonwater channels beneath Taro's living fortress shell have tangled with Emberlight, Shadow Wisps, wards, and ancient rune locks. Restoring all six chapters reopens the Rootvault.": "塔羅的活體堡壘外殼下的月水通道與灰燼之光、暗影小精靈、守衛和古老的符文鎖糾纏在一起。恢復所有六個章節會重新開啟根庫。",
