  "Number {value}, row {row}, column {col}": "數字{value}，行{row}，列{col}",
  "Number badges make sequence part of the answer. Two-step recipes lead to three-step practice and the Recipe Review.": "數位徽章使序列成為答案的一部分。兩步食譜導致三步練習和食譜回顧。",
  "NUMBER MATCH": "號碼匹配",
  "Number Match board": "數字匹配板",
  "Number Match Puzzle": "數字匹配謎題",
  "Numbered recipes:": "編號食譜：",
  "Numbered recipes: Days 6-10 require the exact visible 1-2-3 order. The right ingredients in a different order are rejected, so recipe numbers are a real rule rather than decoration.": "編號食譜：第 6-10 天需要精確可見的 1-2-3 順序。不同順序的正確成分會被拒絕，因此配方編號是真正的規則而不是裝飾。",
  "Numbered star {order}": "編號星星{order}",
  "Numbered Stars": "編號星星",
  "Numbers remain visible as text and the selection state uses more than color, supporting keyboard, touch, and mouse play.": "數字仍然以文字形式可見，選擇狀態不僅使用顏色，還支援鍵盤、觸控和滑鼠操作。",
  "Nummerierte Sterne": "數位斯特恩",
  "Nummerierter Stern {order}": "數位斯特恩 {order}",
  "Nur noch ein Platz frei.": "Nur noch ein Platz frei。",
  "Nurse Aya": "綾護士",
  "Nutria Aleta de Burbujas": "海狸鼠",
  "Nutze den ersten Wandabpraller, um die blockierte Mitte zu umgehen.": "Nutze den ersten Wandabpraller，um die blockierte Mitte zu umgehen。",
  "Nv.": "NV。",
