  "Open leafy paths and learn the free-tile rule.": "打開綠樹成蔭的路徑並學習免費瓷磚規則。",
  "Open Path: use the standard free-tile rule.": "開放路徑：使用標準的自由圖塊規則。",
  "Open relic chests to collect permanent gear.": "打開遺物箱收集永久裝備。",
  "Open safe ground before roots spread": "在根部蔓延之前打開安全的地面",
  "Open Search": "開啟搜尋",
  "Open Search accepts the six pictures in any order. Ranger Order highlights one required animal at a time. Choosing another pictured target gives a friendly correction and leaves it available for later.": "Open Search 接受任何順序的六張圖片。護林員命令一次要突出顯示一種所需的動物。選擇另一個圖中的目標可以進行友善的修正，並供以後使用。",
  "Open Search and Ranger Order:": "開啟搜尋和遊俠命令：",
  "Open Search lets the player find the six pictures in any order. Ranger Order highlights one requested animal at a time; choosing another pictured target gives a friendly correction and does not remove it.": "開啟搜尋可以讓玩家以任意順序找到六張圖片。護林員命令一次突出顯示一隻請求的動物；選擇另一個圖中的目標可以進行友好的修正，但不會將其刪除。",
  "Open shape": "開放式形狀",
  "Open Shelves": "開放式貨架",
  "Open shielded wreckage with prism shards.": "用棱鏡碎片打開屏蔽殘骸。",
  "Open Space": "開放空間",
  "Open Stage, choose Main, Daily, or Event, and select an available mission.": "開啟階段，選擇主要、每日或活動，然後選擇可用的任務。",
  "Open Star Paths": "開放星軌",
  "Open stop": "開停",
  "Open the 30-card Moon Archive rail and select any unlocked mission. Guardian checkpoints appear at Missions 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, and 30.": "打開 30 張月球檔案欄並選擇任何未鎖定的任務。守護者檢查站出現在任務 5、10、15、20、25 和 30 處。",
  "Open the horizontal Moon Archive rail and select any unlocked mission. Missions 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, and 30 are visibly marked guardian checkpoints.": "開啟水平月球檔案導軌並選擇任何未鎖定的任務。任務 5、10、15、20、25 和 30 是明顯標示的監護人檢查站。",
  "Open the seal and rescue {rescued}/{total} families": "打開封印，拯救{rescued}/{total}家庭",
  "Open the two seals across three crossing routes.": "打開三條交叉路線上的兩個封印。",
  "Open trail": "開放步道",
  "Open Trail": "開放路線",
  "Open Trail spaces ordinary hazards so players can learn lane timing. Star Trail increases collectible lines. Two-Lane Gates leave one readable escape lane. Sticky Mud briefly slows lane transitions after a puddle collision. Guardian Pattern uses a deliberate safe-lane sequence.": "開放小徑設置了普通障礙物，以便玩家可以學習車道計時。星跡增加了收藏品線。兩車道大門留有一條可讀的逃生通道。水坑碰撞後，黏泥會短暫減慢車道轉換速度。守護者模式使用經過深思熟慮的安全通道序列。",
  "Open Trail uses individually spaced hazards and is the clearest place to learn lane timing. Star Trail creates more frequent star lines and sometimes places a star in the safe opening of a gate. Two-Lane Gates send two hazards together, leaving one readable escape lane. Sticky Mud favors puddles; touching one still costs points and also slows the fox's lane transition briefly, so a late swipe can affect the next decision. Guardian Pattern uses a fixed safe-lane sequence rather than ordinary random drops, making observation and anticipation important.": "Open Trail 使用單獨間隔的障礙物，是學習車道計時的最清晰的地方。星跡會創造更頻繁的星線，有時會在大門的安全開口處放置一顆星。雙車道閘門將兩種危險集中在一起，留下一條可讀的逃生通道。黏稠的泥漿有利於水坑；觸摸一個仍然會花費分數，並且還會短暫地減慢狐狸的車道轉換速度，因此遲到的滑動可能會影響下一個決定。守護者模式使用固定的安全車道序列而不是普通的隨機掉落，這使得觀察和預測變得非常重要。",
  "Open Training when you want to spend saved Training Gold, unlock another normal hero, or inspect the permanent Team Level bonus.": "當您想要花費保存的訓練金幣、解鎖另一個普通英雄或檢查永久團隊等級獎勵時，請打開訓練。",
