  "Ordered pairs:": "訂購對：",
  "Ordered stages name the animal pair that must be cleared next. A correct pair found out of order is shown, then hidden without advancing.": "有序的階段命名了接下來必須清除的動物對。顯示順序不正確的正確對，然後隱藏而不前進。",
