  "Orders and patience: Three guests begin each day and more may join. Order bubbles show required food; cards show patience. A guest who waits too long leaves and reduces business rating. The day pauses only when rating reaches zero.": "訂單與耐心：每天開始三位客人，可能會有更多客人加入。訂單氣泡顯示所需的食物；卡片顯示耐心。等待時間過長的客人會離開並降低商務評級。只有當評級達到零時，這一天才會暫停。",
