  "Panel": "控制板",
  "Panko Barriga Tambor": "潘科·巴里加·坦博爾",
  "Panko beside a glowing bamboo waterway": "Panko 位於發光的竹水道旁",
  "Panko Check": "麵包屑檢查",
  "Panko checkpoints create memorable difficulty landmarks without introducing combat into a bakery puzzle. Keyboard and screen-reader players use the same native bubble buttons as touch players; accessible names include the animal, row, column, connected-group size, active-order state, and current minimum. Unlike a direct sorting game, Animal Bubble Bakery keeps one persistent board whose shape must be planned several moves ahead.": "Panko 檢查站創造了令人難忘的難度地標，而無需將戰鬥引入麵包店謎題。鍵盤和螢幕閱讀器播放器使用與觸控播放器相同的原生氣泡按鈕；可存取的名稱包括動物、行、列、連接群組大小、活動訂單狀態和當前最小值。與直接分類遊戲不同，《動物泡泡麵包店》保留了一塊永久性的棋盤，其形狀必須提前幾步進行規劃。",
  "Panko Checks": "麵包屑檢查",
  "Panko connecting a glowing bamboo waterway to a flowering grove": "Panko 连接发光的竹水道和开花的树林",
  "Panko coordinating colorful animal buses and passenger queues": "Panko 協調色彩繽紛的動物巴士和乘客隊列",
  "Panko escaped!": "潘科逃脫了！",
  "Panko finding connected number pairs on a bamboo puzzle board": "Panko 在竹拼圖板上找到相連的數字對",
  "Panko guiding a spectrum spirit through aurora gates": "Panko 引導光譜精神穿越極光之門",
  "Panko is reopening thirty shaded gardens. The opening gardens teach distinct route shapes, Garden 6 introduces two simultaneous suns, and the final chapter combines dense dual-source networks.": "Panko 正在重新開放三十個遮蔭花園。開放的花園教導不同的路線形狀，花園 6 引入了兩個同時出現的太陽，最後一章結合了密集的雙源網絡。",
  "Panko is restoring thirty garden waterways whose bamboo joints were twisted by a storm. Every board is a closed engineering problem: the spring, basin, pipe shapes, and correct route are authored before play begins.": "Panko 正在修復 30 條花園水道，其竹節因暴風雨而扭曲。每塊板都是一個封閉的工程問題：彈簧、盆子、管道形狀和正確的路線是在遊戲開始之前編寫的。",
  "Panko maps thirty crowded forest gates. Every block begins on a fixed grid and every puzzle has a verified sequence that releases the marked explorer.": "Panko 繪製了三十個擁擠的森林大門。每個區塊都從一個固定的網格開始，每個謎題都有一個經過驗證的序列，可以釋放標記的探索者。",
  "Panko moving trail blocks through a bamboo grove": "Panko 移動小道塊穿過竹林",
  "Panko quiere un Puesto de aperitivos, enriquecimiento y una caja de entradas animada.": "Panko quiere un Puesto de aperitivos，enriquecimiento y una caja de entradas animada。",
  "Panko routing a golden sunbeam through mirrors in a bamboo garden": "Panko 在竹園裡透過鏡子投射金色的陽光",
  "Panko runs a bakery where animal customers order with picture stamps instead of long written lists. Bunny stamps mark berry treats, whales mark ocean cupcakes, chicks mark sunny pastries, frogs mark garden rolls, and foxes mark bright fruit cakes. A delivery cart reaches the shop after a limited number of moves. The player's job is to help Panko combine matching stamps, finish every visible tray, and send each order out before the cart leaves.": "Panko 經營麵包店，動物顧客點餐時會用圖章取代長長的書面清單。兔子郵票標記漿果美食，鯨魚標記海洋紙杯蛋糕，小雞標記陽光糕點，青蛙標記花園卷，狐狸標記明亮的水果蛋糕。送貨車經過有限次數的移動後到達商店。玩家的任務是幫助 Panko 組合匹配的郵票，完成每個可見的托盤，並在購物車離開之前發送每個訂單。",
  "Panko runs a small bakery where each animal customer uses a picture stamp instead of a written ingredient list. Bunny bubbles mark berry treats, whales mark ocean cupcakes, chicks mark sunny pastries, frogs mark garden rolls, and foxes mark berry cakes. A delivery cart arrives after a limited number of moves, so the player helps Panko combine connected stamps and finish each visible tray before the cart leaves.": "Panko 經營一家小麵包店，每位動物顧客都使用圖章而不是書面成分清單。兔子泡泡標記漿果款待，鯨魚標記海洋紙杯蛋糕，小雞標記陽光糕點，青蛙標記花園卷，狐狸標記漿果蛋糕。送貨車在有限的移動次數後到達，因此玩家需要幫助 Panko 組合相連的郵票，並在購物車離開之前完成每個可見的托盤。",
  "Panko the Bakery Coach": "麵包店教練 Panko",
  "Panko wants a Snack Stand, enrichment, and a lively ticket box.": "Panko 想要一個小吃攤、豐富的食物和一個熱鬧的售票箱。",
