  "Patrols alternate between a blue slow phase and an amber surge. Clockwork Marshal glows before full-speed pursuit, encouraging players to cross during the readable slow window instead of trying to outrun every guard.": "巡邏在藍色慢速階段和琥珀色激增階段之間交替。發條元帥在全速追擊之前會發光，鼓勵玩家在可讀的慢速窗口內穿過，而不是試圖超越每個守衛。",
  "Patrols alternate between a blue slow phase and an amber surge. The field border and guardian glow provide the warning.": "巡邏在藍色慢速階段和琥珀色激增階段之間交替。田野邊界和守護者光芒提供了警告。",
