  "Phone picks": "手機精選",
  "Phone, desktop, tablet, and short landscape use the same logical Battle composition. Pointer and keyboard share one state, hidden-page time is suspended, and Result remains inside Battle above the physical reserve. Album progress requires repeated tension decisions, while saved gear and mission selection give return visits a concrete planning choice.": "手機、桌上型電腦、平板電腦和短風景都使用相同的邏輯戰鬥構圖。指針和鍵盤共享一種狀態，隱藏頁面時間暫停，結果保留在實體儲備之上的戰鬥中。專輯進度需要反覆做出緊張的決定，而保存的裝備和任務選擇則為回訪提供了具體的計劃選擇。",
  "Physics": "物理學",
  "Physics loading failed": "實體加載失敗",
  "Physics Merge": "物理合併",
  "Physics Puzzle": "物理謎題",
  "Physics remains active after every drop. Balls can roll, push neighboring stacks, or trigger delayed merges. A fresh falling ball does not immediately count as danger; game over requires a settled or slow-moving ball to remain above the red line. Challenge mode also has a declared drop budget. After the final ball settles, the goal is checked. Free Play has no drop limit and ends only when the tower stays too high.": "每滴後物理都會保持活躍狀態。球可以滾動、推動相鄰的堆疊或觸發延遲合併。新落下的球不會立即被視為危險；遊戲結束需要一個穩定的或緩慢移動的球保持在紅線上方。挑戰模式也有明確的掉落預算。最終球落定後，檢查球門。免費遊戲沒有掉落限制，只有當塔保持得太高時才會結束。",
  "Physics Routes": "物理路線",
  "Pianifica prima di toccare": "託卡雷初級鋼琴",
  "Pianifica rimbalzi su pareti e piloni in 30 percorsi, contrasta armature, fasi, divisori e assalitori, poi sconfiggi sei boss.": "Pianifica rimbalzi su pareti 和 piloni 在 30 個 percorsi、對比電樞、fasi、divisori 和 assalitori、poi sconfiggi sei boss 中。",
  "Picado de Fragmentos": "殘片斷崖",
  "Pick a bank lane between two armored columns.": "在兩個裝甲縱隊之間選擇一條銀行車道。",
  "Pick a color and select Fill or Brush.": "選擇一種顏色並選擇“填充”或“畫筆”。",
  "Pick a color first.": "先選一個顏色。",
  "Pick a color, then tap the animal.": "選擇一種顏色，然後點選動物。",
  "Pick a game and play!": "選擇一個遊戲並開始玩吧！",
  "Pick a lane. Dash fast.": "選擇一條車道。快速衝刺。",
  "Pick a playable game from the current filters": "從目前濾鏡中選擇可玩的遊戲",
  "Pick a tile, then find its matching pair.": "選擇一個圖塊，然後找到它的匹配對。",
