  "Pick color": "選擇顏色",
  "Pick for me": "為我挑選",
  "Pick the food shown in a customer's bubble, then tap that customer to serve.": "選擇顧客氣泡中顯示的食物，然後點擊該顧客即可上菜。",
  "Pick the food tiles for an order.": "挑選訂單中的食品磁磚。",
  "Pick up {item}.": "拿起{item}。",
  "Pick up fruit on the way for more stars.": "途中拾取水果以獲得更多星星。",
  "Pickup radius": "拾取半徑",
  "Picnic Bell": "野餐鈴",
  "Picnic Bell, Bakery Gate, Garden Drum, Workshop Clock, Bridge Banquet, and Crown Table are checkpoint orders. Clearing Stage 30 means the complete feast has reached the crown table.": "野餐鐘、麵包店門、花園鼓、工作坊鐘、橋宴和皇冠桌是檢查點訂單。通過第30關意味著完整的盛宴已經到達了皇冠桌。",
  "Picnic Crowd": "野餐人群",
  "Picnic Path": "野餐步道",
  "Pico de Brasas": "布拉薩斯峰",
  "Picture + Feature": "圖片+特色",
  "Picture Care": "圖片護理",
  "Picture Introductions": "圖片介紹",
  "Picture Match": "圖片匹配",
  "Picture Tool and mixed missions intentionally rely on artwork; accessible names remain available.": "圖片工具和混合任務有意依賴藝術作品；可訪問的名稱仍然可用。",
  "Picture Tool and mixed missions rely on artwork while accessible names remain.": "圖片工具和混合任務依賴藝術作品，同時保留了可訪問的名稱。",
  "Picture Tool missions still keep accessible tool names, but the visible artwork is the main clue.": "圖片工具任務仍然保留可訪問的工具名稱，但可見的藝術品是主要線索。",
  "Picture tools": "圖片工具",
  "Picture Tools": "圖片工具",
  "Picture Tools and some Keeper Mix shifts intentionally use the eight tool images. Accessible names remain available.": "圖片工具和一些 Keeper Mix 班次有意使用八個工具圖像。可訪問的名稱仍然可用。",
  "Picture Tools hide visible words but retain accessible names. Paired Clues show two icons and one priority answer. Remember the Need allows a no-penalty reveal. Changing Tray reorders tools after an error.": "圖片工具隱藏可見的單字，但保留可存取的名稱。配對線索顯示兩個圖示和一個優先答案。請記住，需要允許無懲罰地透露。發生錯誤後更改托盤會重新排序工具。",
  "Picture Tools shifts intentionally use the eight tool images; accessible names remain.": "圖片工具有意使用八個工具圖像；保留可存取的名稱。",
  "Picture Tools visually remove item words but retain large art and accessible names.": "圖片工具在視覺上刪除了項目文字，但保留了大型藝術作品和易於理解的名稱。",
  "Picture Tools:": "圖片工具：",
  "Picture-only levels visually remove printed food and color names while keeping accessible labels for screen readers. Decoy levels add one or two unused boxes, but the correct color is always present.": "僅圖片等級在視覺上消除了印刷的食物和顏色名稱，同時保留了螢幕閱讀器可存取的標籤。誘餌關卡會添加一兩個未使用的框，但始終存在正確的顏色。",
  "Picture-only levels visually remove printed food and color names while keeping accessible labels for screen readers. Decoy levels add one or two unused boxes, but the correct color is always present. Moving-box levels rearrange choices only after a correct answer and never while a drag is active.": "僅圖片等級在視覺上消除了印刷的食物和顏色名稱，同時保留了螢幕閱讀器可存取的標籤。誘餌關卡會添加一兩個未使用的框，但始終存在正確的顏色。移動框層級僅在正確答案後重新排列選項，而不會在拖曳處於活動狀態時重新排列選項。",
  "Picture-Only Picnic": "僅圖野餐",
  "Picture-only tools, paired clues, memory, and changing positions combine. Mission 30 has six situations and is the final Helper Check.": "僅圖片工具、配對線索、記憶和改變位置結合在一起。任務 30 有六種情況，是最後的助手檢查。",
