  "Place all three block groups on the forest board. Complete a row or column to restore habitat and open new space.": "將所有三個塊組放在森林板上。完成一行或一列以恢復棲息地並開闢新空間。",
  "Place an opening beneath Fia before her next landing.": "在菲亞下次著陸之前在她下方放置一個開口。",
  "Place animal guards and stop the wild beasts.": "設置動物守衛並阻止野獸。",
  "Place at least one item before fighting.": "戰鬥前至少放置一件物品。",
  "Place blocks and complete a line.": "放置塊並完成一條線。",
  "Place blocks directly over the waiting acorns.": "將方塊直接放在等待的橡實上方。",
  "Place burst damage before the final bend.": "在最終彎曲之前放置爆發傷害。",
  "Place cells from matching Forge, Nature, Crystal, or Moon items beside one another. Every active same-tag link adds Attack and Defense.": "將匹配的鍛造、自然、水晶或月球物品中的單元格放置在彼此旁邊。每個活動的相同標籤連結都會增加攻擊和防禦。",
  "Place each piece in its outline.": "將每個部分放在其輪廓中。",
  "Place Guards": "地方守衛",
  "Place identical animal balls together. They merge into the next tier and award points.": "將相同的動物球放在一起。他們合併到下一層並獎勵積分。",
  "Place large balls low and toward the center. A large ball near a wall can trap several small balls above it.": "將大球放低並靠近中心。靠近牆壁的大球可以捕獲其上方的幾個小球。",
  "Place matching material tags next to each other for bonuses.": "將匹配的材料標籤並排放置以獲得獎勵。",
  "Place the leaf under the first falling path before pressing Cut, then make smaller corrections while the fruit is moving.": "在按下「剪切」之前，將葉子放在第一個下落路徑下方，然後在水果移動時進行較小的修正。",
  "Place three animal block groups, clear complete rows and columns, and restore 30 forest habitats or continue in Infinite Grove.": "放置三個動物方塊組，清除完整的行和列，並恢復 30 個森林棲息地或繼續前往無限叢林。",
  "Placed": "已放置",
  "Placement Strategies": "安置策略",
  "Plan": "計劃",
  "Plan 30 saved stages with score, collection, pair, cascade, big-match, and dual checkpoint goals.": "計劃 30 個已保存的階段，包括得分、收集、配對、級聯、大型比賽和雙檢查點目標。",
  "Plan a loop through several small pieces instead of accelerating toward one distant target.": "規劃一個通過幾個小塊的循環，而不是加速向一個遙遠的目標。",
  "Plan a Route": "規劃路線",
  "Plan around a raised center and wide open sides.": "圍繞凸起的中心和寬闊的側面進行規劃。",
  "Plan around corners before committing your route.": "在確定路線之前先規劃好轉角處。",
  "Plan before tapping": "攻牙前做好計劃",
  "Plan chains and objectives": "計劃鍊和目標",
  "Plan connected animal-bubble clears across 30 recipe puzzles, multi-tray orders, and friendly Panko checkpoints.": "計劃連接的動物泡泡清除 30 個食譜謎題、多托盤訂單和友好的 Panko 檢查站。",
  "Plan de crecimiento": "漸進計畫",
  "Plan del parque completo": "完整公園計劃",
  "Plan del puesto de aperitivos": "開胃酒計劃",
  "Plan each pull, resolve material reactions, and guide Taro and the Star Core through 30 handcrafted Rootvault chambers.": "规划每次拉动，解决材料反应，并引导太郎和星核穿过 30 个手工制作的根穹室。",
  "Plan every swap across 30 saved stages and six distinct puzzle chapters in WeightPlay's animal snack match game.": "在 WeightPlay 的動物零食配對遊戲中，規劃 30 個已保存階段和 6 個不同謎題章節中的每次交換。",
  "Plan every swap across 30 saved stages. Rotating snack pools and six goal families turn the 7-by-10 board into a different puzzle in each chapter.": "規劃 30 個已保存階段的每次交換。旋轉的零食池和六個目標系列將 7 x 10 的棋盤變成每個章節中的不同謎題。",
  "Plan farther ahead as new colors join the spring.": "隨著春季新顏色的加入，請提前規劃。",
  "Plan for all five waves before pressing Start Battle: victories continue directly into the next enemy formation, so a balanced opening lineup is safer than a one-wave counter.": "在按「開始戰鬥」之前計劃好所有五波：勝利會直接延續到下一個敵方陣型，因此平衡的開局陣容比一波反擊更安全。",
  "Plan for Tide tiles to shift occupied cells after the enemy turn.": "規劃潮汐瓷磚在敵人回合後移動佔領的單元格。",
  "Plan one board across two different recipes.": "計劃一塊板涵蓋兩種不同的食譜。",
  "Plan one continuous route and fill every open cell without visiting any cell twice.": "規劃一條連續路線並填充每個開放的單元格，而無需訪問任何單元格兩次。",
  "Plan routes across 30 Moon Archive missions, master shadow, mirror, clockwork, bell, seal, and spotlight rules, then outwit six guardians.": "規劃 30 個月球檔案館任務的路線，掌握影子、鏡子、發條、鐘聲、海豹和聚光燈規則，然後智取六名守護者。",
  "Plan safe moves before a sealed vessel opens.": "在密封容器打開之前計劃安全行動。",
  "Plan the biggest matching group first, then save moves for the glowing order bubbles.": "首先規劃最大的配對組，然後為發光的訂單氣泡保存動作。",
  "Plan the profile": "規劃個人資料",
  "Plan the shot order and complete two matches": "規劃打擊順序並完成兩場比賽",
  "Plan the warehouse before the first push.": "第一次推箱前，先規劃整座倉庫。",
  "Plan wall and mirror-pylon bank shots through 30 routes, counter five special enemy rules, and defeat six unique fortress Bosses.": "規劃 30 條路線的牆壁和鏡塔銀行射擊，對抗 5 種特殊的敵人規則，並擊敗 6 個獨特的堡壘 Boss。",
  "Plan wall and pylon bank shots across 30 routes, counter armor, phase, splitters and chargers, then defeat six rule-changing Bosses.": "計劃跨越 30 條路線、反裝甲、相位、分離器和充電器進行牆壁和塔架射擊，然後擊敗六個改變規則的 Boss。",
