  "Press J to slash. Press K or Shift to dash. On touch screens, use the two direction buttons plus the visible Jump, Attack, and Dash buttons.": "按 J 進行斜線。按 K 或 Shift 進行衝刺。在觸控​​螢幕上，使用兩個方向按鈕以及可見的跳躍、攻擊和衝刺按鈕。",
  "Press Spin to stop three downward reels one by one. Every visible rune contributes its effect, and a completed line of matching runes doubles that ability.": "按旋轉可一一停止三個向下的捲軸。每個可見的符文都會貢獻其效果，而完整的匹配符文線會使該能力加倍。",
  "Press Start Battle to watch your squad fight automated shadow beast rounds.": "按下「開始戰鬥」即可觀看您的小隊與自動暗影獸回合的戰鬥。",
  "Press Start Battle. Attacks, healing, shields, row targeting, and faint abilities resolve automatically according to the chosen formation.": "按開始戰鬥。攻擊、治療、護盾、行瞄準和微弱技能會根據所選陣型自動結算。",
  "Press Start Game and swipe the horizontal mission rail to an unlocked card.": "按下「開始遊戲」並將水平任務欄滑動到解鎖的卡片上。",
  "Press Start Game and swipe the horizontal rail to an unlocked habitat card.": "按下「開始遊戲」並將水平導軌滑動到解鎖的棲息地卡上。",
  "Press Start Game and swipe the horizontal rail to an unlocked zoo shift.": "按下「開始遊戲」並滑動水平導軌以解鎖動物園班次。",
  "Press Start Game and swipe the horizontal route rail to an unlocked card.": "按下「開始遊戲」並將水平路線滑到解鎖的卡片上。",
  "Press Start Game and swipe the horizontal Stage rail to an unlocked investigation.": "按下「開始遊戲」並滑動水平舞台導軌即可解鎖調查。",
  "Press Start Game and swipe the horizontal Stage rail to an unlocked level.": "按下「開始遊戲」並將水平舞台導軌滑動至解鎖關卡。",
  "Press Start Game, swipe the 30-card mission rail, and choose an unlocked card after reading its sea condition and catch goal.": "按下“開始遊戲”，滑動 30 張卡片的任務欄，在讀取海況並捕捉目標後選擇一張解鎖的卡片。",
  "Press Start Game, swipe the mission rail, and select an unlocked card after reading its sea-condition line.": "按下“開始遊戲”，滑動任務欄，讀取海況線後選擇解鎖卡。",
  "Press Start Game, then swipe the horizontal route rail to an unlocked card.": "按下“開始遊戲”，然後將水平路線滑到解鎖的卡片上。",
  "Press the glowing paw cell and begin dragging.": "按下發光的爪子細胞並開始拖曳。",
  "Press the start seal and keep holding.": "按下啟動密封並保持按住。",
  "Press, tap, or use Space for one pulse, then release fully before the next input.": "按、點擊或使用空白鍵產生一個脈衝，然後在下一個輸入之前完全釋放。",
  "Pressione novamente para confirmar +1 de Energia inicial permanente. Diamantes: {before} → {after}.": "Pressione novamente paraconfirmar +1 de Energia inicial permanente。鑽石：{before} → {after}。",
