  "Remember & Help shows the request first, then offers a recall prompt. Tapping the animal restores the same request without penalty.": "記住和幫助首先顯示請求，然後提供召回提示。輕拍動物會恢復相同的請求，而不會受到懲罰。",
  "Remember and Help:": "記住並幫助：",
  "Remember eight pairs, then the moon shuffles them once.": "記住八對，然後月亮將它們洗牌一次。",
  "Remember Passenger": "記住乘客",
  "Remember Passenger routes briefly hide it. Tap the passenger card to reveal the same shape again without a penalty.": "記住客運路線短暫隱藏它。點擊乘客卡即可再次顯示相同的形狀，而不會受到懲罰。",
  "Remember Passenger routes briefly hide it. Tap the passenger to reveal the same shape again without a penalty.": "記住客運路線短暫隱藏它。點擊乘客即可再次顯示相同的形狀，而不會受到懲罰。",
  "Remember the garden pictures and clear 30 calm challenges across six garden chapters.": "記住花園圖片並清除六個花園章節中的 30 個平靜挑戰。",
