  "Remove {title} from favorites": "從收藏夾中刪除 {title}",
  "Remove a Fox flank before committing Lion beside the Boar.": "在將獅子放在野豬旁邊之前，先移除狐狸的側翼。",
  "Remove a one-HP Mirror clone before it blocks a needed lane.": "在一 HP 鏡像克隆阻塞所需通道之前將其移除。",
  "Remove a one-HP Mirror clone before it blocks the movement lane you need.": "在一個只有一生命值的鏡像克隆擋住你需要的移動路線之前將其移除。",
  "Remove every support screw to drop all plates.": "拆下每個支撐螺絲以掉落所有板。",
  "Remove from favorites": "從收藏夾中刪除",
  "Remove from team": "從團隊中刪除",
  "Remove one-hit armor before the backline wisp escapes.": "在後線小精靈逃跑之前移除一擊護甲。",
  "Remove pairs that total ten when they touch or can see each other through cleared spaces, opening new sight lines across the board.": "當總共十對接觸或可以透過清理的空間看到對方時，將其移除，從而在整個棋盤上打開新的視線。",
  "Remove ranged enemies before committing to a slow ground duel. A Crystal or Rift Bat can make an otherwise safe boar punish window dangerous.": "在進行緩慢的地面決鬥之前先消滅遠程敵人。水晶或裂縫蝙蝠可以使原本安全的野豬懲罰窗口變得危險。",
