  "Run Ended": "運行結束",
  "Run growth: defeated enemies drop green Relic Orbs. Filling the EXP bar pauses the room and offers three relic upgrades, such as damage, attack rate, Max HP, movement or pickup range. One optional three-Diamond reroll is available per draft. Run relic counts reset when a new expedition starts, so the next build may solve the same threat mix differently.": "奔跑成長：被擊敗的敵人會掉落綠色的聖物球。填充 EXP 欄會暫停房間並提供三種遺物升級，例如傷害、攻擊率、最大生命值、移動或拾取範圍。每個草稿可提供一個可選的三鑽重滾。當新的探險開始時，運行遺物計數會重置，因此下一個版本可能會以不同的方式解決相同的威脅組合。",
  "Run HP carries into the next room, with only a small heal at the portal. A defensive relic before Room 3 can be more valuable than another damage choice.": "運行 HP 進入下一個房間，在傳送門處只有一個小治療。 3號房間之前的防禦遺物可能比其他傷害選擇更有價值。",
