  "Rux is restoring a cargo ark one warehouse at a time. Every rune crate must reach a glowing dock before the route can reopen.": "Rux 正在一次修復一個倉庫的貨櫃。每個符文箱都必須到達發光的碼頭，然後路線才能重新開放。",
