  "SAFARI": "薩法裡",
  "Safari Dash": "狩獵衝刺",
  "Safari Dash - How to Play": "Safari Dash - 玩法",
  "Safari Dash - WeightPlay": "Safari Dash - WeightPlay",
  "Safari Dash game": "野生動物園衝刺遊戲",
  "Safari Dash game guide": "Safari Dash 遊戲指南",
  "Safari Dash is a three-lane animal runner with 30 saved routes across six regions. Spark Paw Fox restores guide stars while route cards announce five objective types and the active rules. Star trails, two-lane gates, sticky mud, and authored Guardian patterns make later routes require different reading and recovery decisions instead of only increasing speed.": "Safari Dash 是一款三車道動物跑步遊戲，已保存 30 條路線，橫跨六個地區。 Spark Paw Fox 恢復了指南星，同時路線卡宣布了五種目標類型和有效規則。星跡、雙車道門、黏稠的泥漿和編寫的守護者模式使得後面的路線需要不同的讀取和恢復決策，而不僅僅是提高速度。",
  "Safari Dash is a three-lane animal runner with 30 saved routes, six regions, five kinds of route objectives, and six Guardian Checks. Spark Paw Fox carries guide stars between protected trails while players read safe lanes, collect star tokens, and decide when a tempting star line is worth crossing into danger. The campaign begins with open paths, then adds two-lane gates, sticky mud, guided star trails, and authored Guardian patterns that change the route rather than merely increasing speed.": "Safari Dash 是一款三車道動物奔跑遊戲，擁有 30 條已保存路線、六個區域、五種路線目標和六項監護人檢查。 Spark Paw Fox 在受保護的小徑之間攜帶引導星星，而玩家則讀取安全路線，收集星星標記，並決定何時值得穿越誘人的星星線進入危險。戰役從開放的道路開始，然後添加了兩車道的大門、黏稠的泥土、引導星跡，並編寫了改變路線而不僅僅是提高速度的守護者模式。",
  "Safari Dash is intended for ages 9+ because later routes combine faster visual decisions, route objectives, and score pressure. The Result reports real evidence from the run: lane changes, stars collected, obstacle bumps, and best uninterrupted combo. These values describe one play session only. They are not a developmental assessment, diagnosis, or comparison with other children. Progress and the local Top 5 remain in this browser's local storage.": "Safari Dash 適合 9 歲以上的兒童，因為後面的路線結合了更快的視覺決策、路線目標和得分壓力。結果報告了跑步中的真實證據：變換車道、收集的星星、障礙物顛簸以及最佳不間斷組合。這些值僅描述一次遊戲會話。它們不是發育評估、診斷或與其他兒童的比較。進度和本地前 5 名仍保留在此瀏覽器的本機儲存中。",
  "Safari Dash is intended for ages 9+ because later routes combine quick lane reading, objectives, and score pressure. The Skill Report uses only current-run evidence: lane changes, stars, bumps, and best combo. It is not a diagnosis, developmental assessment, or comparison with other children.": "Safari Dash 適合 9 歲以上的兒童，因為後面的路線結合了快速車道閱讀、目標和得分壓力。技能報告僅使用目前運行的證據：變換車道、星星、顛簸和最佳組合。它不是診斷、發展評估或與其他兒童的比較。",
  "Safari Dash uses three lanes so a choice remains readable on a phone without shrinking the fox or hazards into tiny targets. Each input moves exactly one lane; a held keyboard key cannot skip across two lanes, and a captured touch swipe can finish even if the finger crosses the Canvas edge. Route timers range from 28 to 45 seconds so a retry is short, while the 30-route campaign supplies longer-term structure.": "Safari Dash 使用三個車道，因此選擇在手機上仍然可讀，而不會將狐狸或危險縮小為微小目標。每個輸入只移動一條車道；按住的鍵盤鍵不能跳過兩個通道，即使手指越過畫布邊緣，捕獲的觸摸滑動也可以完成。路由計時器的範圍為 28 到 45 秒，因此重試時間很短，而 30 條路由的活動提供了長期結構。",
