  "Shield beast:": "盾獸：",
  "Shield beasts": "盾獸",
  "Shield beasts are tough. Focus Cats and add Owl slows.": "盾獸很堅韌。集中貓並添加貓頭鷹減速。",
  "Shield beasts have high HP. Use stronger trained guards.": "盾獸的生命值很高。使用訓練有素的更強的警衛。",
