  "Shield Wall": "盾牆",
  "Shield-heavy stage. Use Owl slows and Fox burst if unlocked.": "重盾階段。如果解鎖，請使用貓頭鷹減速和狐狸爆發。",
  "Shielded": "屏蔽",
  "Shielded enemies and charge waves demand target priority.": "受到屏蔽的敵人和衝鋒波需要目標優先。",
  "Shielded formations must lose their shield before taking normal damage. Bombs must be defused before their countdown finishes, champions require sustained focus, and any surviving monster that crosses the bottom line damages the crystal core.": "護盾編隊必須在受到正常傷害之前失去護盾。炸彈必須在倒數結束前拆除，冠軍需要持續集中註意力，任何跨越底線的倖存怪物都會損壞水晶核心。",
  "Shielded packs protect fast followers.": "屏蔽包可以保護快速追隨者。",
  "SHIELDED: stay SAFE until it opens.": "屏蔽：在打開之前保持安全。",
  "Shields and denser cursed sectors demand a plan.": "護盾和更密集的詛咒區域需要製定計劃。",
  "Shift": "轉變",
  "Shift {n} unlocked": "Shift {n} 解鎖",
  "Shift {n}/30": "平移{n}/30",
  "Shift {shift}: {done}/{goal} flights completed and {errors}/3 errors. This shift progress will be lost; saved medals and rewards stay safe.": "班次 {shift}：{done}/{goal} 航班已完成，{errors}/3 個錯誤。此轉變進度將會失去；保存的獎牌和獎勵保持安全。",
  "Shift 1 teaches two docks, route drawing, and four forgiving arrivals. Shift 2 opens the third dock and cargo-passenger priorities. Shift 3 adds a moving storm and weather beacon. Shift 4 adds damaged flights, repair parts, and a maintenance closure. Shift 5 combines ten arrivals, overlapping windows, and optional festival contracts.": "第一班教授兩個碼頭、繪製路線和四個寬容的到達。 Shift 2 打開第三個碼頭和貨客優先。 Shift 3 新增了移動風暴和天氣信標。 Shift 4 增加了損壞的航班、維修零件和維修關閉。 Shift 5 結合了 10 名抵達者、重疊的窗口和可選的節日合約。",
  "Shift complete: {station} earned {tickets} tickets and kept visitor happiness at {mood}%.": "班次完成：{station} 贏得了 {tickets} 門票，並將遊客滿意度保持在 {mood}%。",
  "Shift complete!": "換檔完成！",
  "Shift progress, medals, reputation, upgrades, discoveries, tutorial state, and settings stay in this browser.": "轉變進度、獎牌、聲譽、升級、發現、教學狀態和設定都保留在此瀏覽器中。",
  "Shift selection": "班次選擇",
  "Shifting Hall": "變速大廳",
  "Shifting Orrery": "移動太陽系儀",
  "Shifts": "輪班",
  "Shifts 1-5 teach exact Care Match requests and end with the first Keeper Check.": "1-5 輪班教導準確的護理比賽請求，並以第一次守門員檢查結束。",
  "Shifts 1–5, Care Match:": "1-5 班次，護理配對：",
  "Shifts 11-15 introduce Care Categories with one or more valid tools.": "第 11 至 15 班使用一種或多種有效工具介紹護理類別。",
  "Shifts 11–15, Care Categories:": "11-15 班次，護理類別：",
  "Shifts 16-20 briefly hide requests, which can always be restored by tapping the animal.": "Shifts 16-20 會短暫隱藏請求，這些請求始終可以透過點擊動物來恢復。",
  "Shifts 16–20, Remember and Help:": "16-20 班，記住並幫助：",
  "Shifts 21-25 require ordered two-step routines; Shift 25 contains three complete pairs.": "21-25 班需要有序的兩步驟例程； Shift 25 包含三個完整的對。",
  "Shifts 21–25, Two-Step Routine:": "21-25 班次，兩步驟程序：",
  "Shifts 26-30 recombine earlier rules. Shift 30 uses picture-only category choices, memory recall and six decisions. Checkpoints are exactly 5/10/15/20/25/30.": "26-30 班次重新組合了先前的規則。 Shift 30 使用僅圖片類別選擇、記憶回憶和六個決策。檢查點剛好是 5/10/15/20/25/30。",
  "Shifts 26–30, Keeper Mix:": "26-30 輪班，Keeper Mix：",
  "Shifts 6-10 remove visible item labels in Picture Tools play.": "Shifts 6-10 刪除圖片工具播放中可見的項目標籤。",
  "Shifts 6–10, Picture Tools:": "班次 6-10，圖片工具：",
  "SHOCKWAVE": "衝擊波",
  "Shop": "商店",
  "Shop shelf items": "商店貨架上的物品",
  "Short deterministic routes turn mistakes into useful information instead of random punishment. Large carts, visible arrows, and the same tap rule work across phone and desktop. Pause, Help, Undo, Restart, and Result actions preserve a clear flow. Progress stays only in this browser.": "短的確定性路線將錯誤轉化為有用的信息，而不是隨機懲罰。大型購物車、可見的箭頭和相同的點擊規則適用於手機和桌面裝置。暫停、幫助、撤銷、重新啟動和結果操作保持清晰的流程。進度僅保留在此瀏覽器中。",
  "Short shifts and large care pictures give preschool players a clear ending without a timer. Difficulty changes the kind of observation—recognition, classification, memory or order—instead of shrinking hit areas. Touch, drag, mouse and keyboard share one transaction, and the logical layout scales uniformly across phone, tablet, desktop and short landscape. Unlike Animal Quiz, this game asks which care tool fits the moment rather than which animal matches a fact. Kids play has no advertising, account, purchase, ranking or failure screen.": "短暫的輪班和大型護理圖片為學齡前玩家提供了一個無需計時器的清晰結局。困難改變了觀察的類型——識別、分類、記憶或順序——而不是縮小命中區域。觸控、拖曳、滑鼠和鍵盤共享一項事務，邏輯佈局在手機、平板電腦、桌上型電腦和短橫向上統一縮放。與動物測驗不同，遊戲詢問哪種護理工具適合當前情況，而不是哪種動物符合事實。兒童遊戲沒有廣告、帳戶、購買、排名或失敗畫面。",
  "Short Starlight": "短星光",
  "Shots": "鏡頭",
  "Shots Left": "左鏡頭",
  "Should every wheel be a circle?": "每個輪子都應該是圓的嗎？",
