  "Show Hint": "顯示提示",
  "Show Hint highlights the next cell in one possible solution, while Restart clears the current route. Using a hint reduces the best star result for that attempt.": "顯示提示突出顯示一個可能的解決方案中的下一個單元格，而重新啟動則清除當前路線。使用提示會降低該嘗試的最佳星級結果。",
