  "Shows the exact recommended profile before every obstacle.": "在每個障礙物之前顯示準確的建議輪廓。",
  "Shuffle": "隨機播放",
  "Shuffle is a recovery tool and becomes available only when no legal matching pair remains.": "Shuffle 是一種復原工具，只有在沒有合法配對時才可用。",
  "Shuffle is disabled while a legal pair exists. If the board has no free match, Shuffle rearranges remaining picture tokens, preserves key and rescue markings, and guarantees a playable pair.": "當存在合法對時，隨機播放被停用。如果棋盤上沒有自由匹配，隨機播放會重新排列剩餘的圖片標記，保留關鍵和救援標記，並保證可玩的對。",
