  "Slide a 4×4 forest grid, merge matching animals, and clear 30 saved evolution missions with stones, score goals, and move limits.": "滑動 4×4 森林網格，合併配對的動物，並使用石頭清除 30 個已儲存的進化任務、得分目標和移動限制。",
