  "Solve 30 animal investigations with picture, habitat, feature, behavior, food, mystery-image, and silhouette clues.": "透過圖片、棲息地、特徵、行為、食物、神秘圖像和輪廓線索解決 30 項動物調查。",
  "Solve 30 animal-help missions with picture tools, paired clues, memory needs, and changing trays.": "使用圖片工具、配對線索、記憶需求和更換托盤完成 30 個動物幫助任務。",
  "Solve 30 picture, habitat, feature, action, and food investigations.": "解決 30 項圖片、棲息地、特徵、動作和食物調查。",
