  "Spend coins for a card or equipment for future runs.": "花費硬幣購買卡片或設備以供將來運行。",
  "Spend coins on one of three permanent upgrades, replay an unlocked day, or continue to the next day.": "花費硬幣進行三個永久升級之一，重玩解鎖的一天，或繼續到第二天。",
  "Spend earned shards on permanent launcher upgrades.": "將贏得的碎片用於永久啟動器升級。",
