  "Start the encounter when the pack is ready. Rux and the enemy exchange attacks automatically, while healing and armor from the current layout affect each round.": "包包準備好後開始遭遇。 Rux和敵人會自動交換攻擊，而目前佈局的治療和護甲會影響每輪。",
  "Start the game and drag the horizontal route rail until the mission you want is centered and glowing.": "開始遊戲並拖曳水平路線軌道，直到您想要的任務居中並發光。",
