  "Stay inside the slowly moving light ring when darkness pulses.": "當黑暗襲來時，留在緩慢移動的光環內。",
  "Stay on the route until its timer reaches zero, then satisfy the card's finish, star, combo, clean-run, or score objective.": "留在路線上，直到計時器歸零，然後滿足卡片的終點、星星、連擊、乾淨運行或得分目標。",
  "Steady Chalk": "穩定粉筆",
  "Steady echo": "穩定的迴聲",
  "Steady Hand": "穩定的手",
  "Steady swimmer": "穩定的游泳者",
  "Stealth": "隱身",
  "Stealth Extraction Adventure": "秘密撤離冒險",
  "Stealth Gadgets": "隱形小工具",
  "Stealth Route Adventure": "秘密路線冒險",
  "Stealth route field. Use WASD or arrow keys to move and Space to use {name}: {effect}.": "隱密路線場。使用WASD或方向鍵移動，空白鍵使用{name}：{effect}。",
  "Stealth route field. Use WASD or arrow keys to move and Space to use the gadget.": "隱密路線場。使用 WASD 或箭頭鍵移動，使用空白鍵使用該小工具。",
  "Stealth route field. Use WASD or arrow keys to move. {name} is passive: {effect}.": "隱密路線場。使用 WASD 或箭頭鍵移動。 {name} 是被動的：{effect}。",
  "Steam Gardens": "蒸氣花園",
  "Steam Toad": "蒸氣蟾蜍",
  "Steam Toad corrosion makes long battles dangerous.": "蒸氣蟾蜍的腐蝕使長時間的戰鬥變得危險。",
  "Steam Toads increase corrosion, while Furnace Boars turn occupied cells in the top row into incoming heat damage. Leaving ventilation space can be more valuable than filling every cell. The Furnace Leviathan combines heat and corrosion, so its stage rewards healing, burst damage, and a deliberately open top row.": "蒸氣蟾蜍會增加腐蝕，而熔爐野豬會將頂排中被佔用的細胞轉化為傳入的熱損傷。留下通風空間比填滿每個細胞更有價值。熔爐利維坦結合了熱和腐蝕，因此它的階段獎勵治療、爆發傷害和故意開放的頂排。",
  "Steamlock Vault": "蒸汽鎖庫",
  "Steer a small lunar collector through a circular rift, absorb salvage below its current size, build a scoring chain, and complete both the recovery quota and any rescue objective before time expires.": "駕駛小型月球收集器穿過圓形裂縫，吸收低於當前大小的殘骸，建立得分鏈，並在時間到期之前完成回收配額和任何救援目標。",
  "Steer from restored land into corruption.": "避免恢復土地陷入腐敗。",
