  "Strength": "實力",
  "Strength shortens encounters, Constitution forgives hazard mistakes, Agility improves positioning, and Luck creates less predictable burst. The best choice depends on the stage rule, not a universal upgrade order.": "力量可以縮短遭遇時間，體質可以避免危險錯誤，敏捷可以改善定位，而運氣可以產生更難以預測的爆發。最佳選擇取決於階段規則，而不是通用的升級順序。",
  "Strength shortens fights, Constitution forgives mistakes, Agility improves positioning, and Luck creates variable burst; choose for the current stage rule.": "力量縮短戰鬥時間，體質原諒錯誤，敏捷提高定位，運氣創造可變爆發；選擇當前階段的規則。",
