  "Strong run: you kept moving, reached level {level}, and finished with a golden-key score of {keys} while watching the shadows.": "強力奔跑：您不斷前進，達到了 {level} 等級，並在觀察陰影的同時獲得了 {keys} 的金鑰匙分數。",
