  "Submit the completed word path and continue.": "提交完整的單字路徑並繼續。",
  "Success is not measured only by survival. Stage cards retain the best score and show cleared and Perfect states. Five, fifteen, and thirty Garden Medals grant one-time coin rewards, so replaying an early stage with a cleaner layout still advances training. Coins improve guard health, damage, and attack timing locally in this browser. Diamonds are only used for the optional Fox unlock; every stage can be completed with the three starting guards.": "成功不僅僅以生存來衡量。舞台卡保留最佳分數並顯示已清除和完美狀態。五枚、十五枚和三十枚花園獎章會授予一次性硬幣獎勵，因此以更清晰的佈局重玩早期階段仍然可以促進訓練。硬幣可以改善此瀏覽器中的本地守衛健康狀況、損害和攻擊時機。鑽石僅用於可選的福克斯解鎖；每個階段都可以由三名首發後衛完成。",
