  "Sunrise Savanna, Acacia Crossing, Marshlight Bend, Red Canyon Run, Moonwater Reserve, and Crown Safari share a marked trail network. Scattered trail gear and flooded markers have broken its guide-star chain.": "日出稀樹草原、Acacia Crossing、Marshlight Bend、Red Canyon Run、Moonwater Reserve 和 Crown Safari 共享一個標記的步道網絡。散落的追蹤裝備和被淹沒的標記已經破壞了它的導航星鏈。",
