  "Survival": "生存",
  "Survive an aerial fan, then punish landing": "在風扇中倖存，然後懲罰著陸",
  "Survive longer to beat your best score.": "生存更長時間以打破你的最佳成績。",
  "Survive the Crystal Grove.": "在水晶叢林中生存。",
  "Survive the strongest assault and final golem.": "在最強大的攻擊和最後的魔像中生存下來。",
  "Survive three formations using the full enemy vocabulary.": "使用完整的敵人詞彙在三個編隊中生存。",
  "Survive three minutes and meet the printed key target; a checkpoint also requires its Boss to be defeated.": "生存三分鐘並達到列印的關鍵目標；檢查站還需要擊敗其 Boss。",
  "Survive until the three-minute timer ends and collect the key target printed on the stage card. A checkpoint also requires its Boss to be defeated.": "生存到三分鐘計時器結束並收集舞台卡上列印的關鍵目標。檢查站還需要擊敗其 Boss。",
  "Sustituye a {gear}: {effect}": "替換{gear}：{effect}",
  "Sustituye los tres objetos. Cuesta 3 diamantes. Saldo actual: {balance}.": "Sustituye los tres objetos。 Cuesta 3 鑽石。薩爾多實際：{balance}。",
  "Svuota la pila prima di occupare sette spazi.": "Svuota la pila prima di 職業sette spazi。",
