  "Swap Detour": "交換繞行",
  "Swap exchanges colors with the bubble it hits": "交換與它擊中的氣泡交換顏色",
  "Swarm": "蜂群",
  "Swarm night": "蜂群之夜",
  "Sweeps every enemy in the front row for 70% ATK, falling back to the back row. When it faints, remaining allies gain Lv ATK and HP.": "橫掃前排所有敵人70%攻擊力，後退至後排。當它昏倒時，剩餘的友軍攻擊力和生命值都會增加Lv。",
  "Sweet Snack": "甜食",
  "Swift Boots": "迅捷靴子",
  "Swift Tiger": "迅猛虎",
  "Swim left": "向左遊",
  "Swim right": "向右遊",
  "Swimming toward {lane}...": "游向{lane}...",
  "Swipe lanes": "刷卡車道",
  "Swipe or drag missions, then tap any unlocked mission card to begin.": "滑動或拖曳任務，然後點擊任何解鎖的任務卡即可開始。",
  "Swipe or tap left and right lanes to move.": "滑動或點擊左右車道即可移動。",
  "Swipe the 30-card rail and choose an unlocked mission; every fifth card is a Boss checkpoint.": "滑動 30 張卡片列並選擇解鎖任務；每五張卡片就是 Boss 檢查點。",
  "Swipe the board or use the direction controls.": "滑動板或使用方向控制。",
  "Swipe the board, use the four direction buttons, or press an arrow key or WASD.": "滑動控制板、使用四個方向按鈕或按箭頭鍵或 WASD。",
  "Swipe the complete 30-card mission rail and select an unlocked mission. Every fifth card is a named Boss checkpoint.": "滑動完整的 30 張卡片工作列並選擇解鎖任務。每五張卡片就是一個指定的 Boss 檢查點。",
  "Swipe the horizontal Stage rail to an unlocked shift.": "滑動水平舞台導軌以解鎖檔位。",
  "Swipe the Mission Preparation rail and choose any unlocked mission; all 30 route cards remain visible.": "滑動任務準備欄並選擇任何解鎖的任務；所有 30 個路線卡均保持可見。",
  "Swipe the route cards. Every fifth route is a Guardian Check.": "刷一下路線卡。每五條路線就有一次監護人檢查。",
  "Swipe the Stage rail and choose an unlocked expedition; Guardian cards appear at missions 5, 10, 15, 20, 25 and 30.": "滑動舞台導軌並選擇解鎖的探險；守護者卡出現在任務 5、10、15、20、25 和 30 中。",
  "Swipe the Stage rail to an unlocked level and read its goal and rule hint.": "將舞台導軌滑動到解鎖關卡並閱讀其目標和規則提示。",
  "Swipe the whole grid, merge matching animals, and protect enough open space to complete each mission.": "滑動整個網格，合併匹配的動物，並保護足夠的開放空間來完成每個任務。",
  "Swipe through six regions, choose an unlocked stage, then prepare your formation.": "滑動穿過六個區域，選擇一個解鎖的階段，然後準備你的陣型。",
  "Swipe through six regions. Every fifth stage is a Boss checkpoint with a different survival rule.": "滑動瀏覽六個區域。每第五個階段就是一個 Boss 檢查點，有不同的生存規則。",
  "Swipe up, down, left, or right.": "向上、向下、向左或向右滑動。",
  "Swipe, drag, or use arrows to steer Fia.": "滑動、拖曳或使用箭頭來操縱 Fia。",
  "Swipe, then tap any page to color it.": "滑動，然後點擊任何頁面即可為其著色。",
  "Swipe. Dodge. Score.": "滑動。閃避。分數。",
  "Switch between tall and low": "高低切換",
  "Switch briefly to a power core or bomb when its timing is more urgent than ordinary damage.": "當時機比普通傷害更緊急時，短暫切換到動力核心或炸彈。",
  "Switch Captain Fia between three lanes while the battalion fires automatically. Break threats, collect power cores, and protect the crystal.": "當營隊自動開火時，菲亞隊長在三個車道之間切換。打破威脅，收集能量核心，保護水晶。",
  "Switch lanes, destroy every wave, protect the core.": "切換車道，摧毀每一波，保護核心。",
  "Switch one automatic prism battery between three lanes, destroy each incoming formation, collect rare attack cores, and keep every surviving monster away from the crystal core.": "在三個車道之間切換一個自動棱鏡電池，摧毀每個來襲的編隊，收集稀有的攻擊核心，並將每個倖存的怪物遠離水晶核心。",
  "Switches between flying ranged immunity and grounded sweeps.": "在飛行遠程免疫和地面掃描之間切換。",
  "Switching Cars": "換車",
  "Switching Cars routes reorder them after a correct match so the player scans again.": "正確配對後，切換汽車路線重新排序，以便玩家再次掃描。",
