  "Touch and mouse players may tap or drag through the same care transaction; keyboard players use the same native buttons and focus sequence. Stage, Battle, and Result keep one logical composition that scales uniformly on phones, tablets, desktop, and short landscape screens. Unlike Animal Quiz, this game asks what kind of care tool fits the moment rather than which animal matches a fact. The Kids route has no account, purchase, leaderboard, advertising request, or ad reserve.": "觸控和滑鼠玩家可以透過點擊或拖曳來完成相同的護理交易；鍵盤演奏者使用相同的本機按鈕和焦點順序。舞台、戰鬥和結果保持一種邏輯組合，在手機、平板電腦、桌上型電腦和短橫向螢幕上統一縮放。與動物測驗不同，遊戲詢問哪種護理工具適合當前情況，而不是哪種動物符合事實。兒童路線沒有帳戶、購買、排行榜、廣告請求或廣告儲備。",
  "Touch controls": "觸控控制",
  "Touch friendly": "觸摸友好",
  "Touch or click the arena, press the Pulse button, Space, Enter, or Arrow Up once for one identical vertical impulse. Holding never repeats the action; release before the next pulse.": "觸碰或按一下區域，按脈衝按鈕、空白鍵、Enter 鍵或向上箭頭一次可獲得相同的垂直脈衝。保持從不重複該動作；在下一個脈衝之前釋放。",
  "Touch the golden key star before crossing the rose gate.": "在穿過玫瑰門之前觸摸金鑰匙星。",
  "Touch-first games for quick sessions.": "觸摸優先遊戲可實現快速會話。",
  "Touch, mouse, and keyboard use one simulation. Movement, collision, score, timer, rivals, and rewards never change with screen size.": "觸控、滑鼠和鍵盤使用一種模擬。移動、碰撞、得分、計時器、對手和獎勵永遠不會隨著螢幕尺寸的變化而改變。",
  "Touching a matching Aurora tile adds it to the carried stack up to the current capacity. Entering the marked area around any bridge dock automatically submits one or more carried tiles; no exact pixel alignment or extra strength condition is required.": "觸摸匹配的極光圖塊會將其添加到攜帶的堆疊中，直到達到當前容量。進入任何橋碼頭周圍的標記區域會自動提交一張或多張攜帶的圖塊；不需要精確的像素對齊或額外的強度條件。",
