  "Trace every constellation trail exactly once across 30 original puzzles with start seals, comet arrows, numbered stars, keys, and gates.": "在 30 個帶有起始印章、彗星箭頭、編號星星、鑰匙和門的原創謎題中準確追蹤每個星座軌跡一次。",
  "Trace every trail exactly once and relight the Animal Star Map.": "準確地追蹤每條踪跡一次並重新點亮動物星圖。",
