  "Trace rotas seguras": "追蹤路線",
  "Trace the covering stack above each starred rescue family.": "追蹤每個帶星號的救援家庭上方的覆蓋物。",
  "Track blinking bats between marked perches": "追蹤標記棲息地之間眨眼的蝙蝠",
  "Track every active orb after a split and clear all breakable crystals before the final orb falls.": "跟踪分裂后的每个活动球体，并在最后一个球体掉落之前清除所有易碎晶体。",
