  "Track the returning light, move early, and strike with the paddle edge to reach protected lanes. Catch prism powers without abandoning the next return.": "追蹤返回的光線，儘早移動，並用槳邊緣撞擊以到達受保護的車道。抓住棱鏡的力量而不放棄下一次的回報。",
