  "Tray {current}/{total} is ready!": "托盤 {current}/{total} 已準備就緒！",
  "Tray full": "托盤已滿",
  "Traza 30 misiones y captura seis peces Guardianes.": "Traza 30 任務和捕獲守護者。",
  "Tre oggetti uguali scompaiono.": "Tre oggetti uguali scompaiono。",
  "Tre uguali scompaiono dal vassoio.": "Tre uguali scompaiono dal vassoio。",
  "Treasure +2 / O2 -16": "寶 +2 / O2 -16",
  "Treasure becomes the first of two seals, changing collection order. Crossed paths, shadow shelters, and changing patrol speed are combined before Vault Sealkeeper guards the central route at the checkpoint.": "寶藏成為兩個封印中的第一個，改變了收集順序。在避難所封印守衛在檢查站守衛中央路線之前，交叉路徑、陰影庇護所和不斷變化的巡邏速度結合在一起。",
  "Treasure cache: +2 salvage, -16 oxygen.": "寶物：+2 打撈，-16 氧氣。",
  "Treasure first, then the relic; extraction relocates after pickup.": "先有寶藏，後有遺物；提取後拾取後重新定位。",
  "Treasure insurance is active for the next mission.": "寶藏保險正在為下一個任務而活躍。",
  "Treasure is the first seal; the relic unlocks second.": "寶物是第一印；遺物第二次解鎖。",
  "Treasure pile": "寶藏堆",
  "Treasure secured": "寶藏安全",
  "Treasure sorting puzzle": "寶藏分類謎題",
  "Treat a mismatch as useful location information on classic boards.": "將不匹配視為經典棋盤上的有用位置資訊。",
  "Treat a retry as a calm chance to compare the four pictures again.": "將重試視為再次比較四張圖片的冷靜機會。",
  "Treat arrows, numbers, keys, and gates as route constraints rather than decoration.": "將箭頭、數字、鑰匙和門視為路線約束而不是裝飾。",
  "Treat bell and guardian glow warnings as decisions. Enter shadow before the pulse or pursuit begins, then plan the next route from cover.": "將鈴聲和守護者發光警告視為決定。在脈衝或追擊開始之前進入陰影，然後從掩體中規劃下一條路線。",
  "Treat Cooling, Seal and Orbit cells as resources; permanent stats do not replace positioning.": "將冷卻、密封和軌道細胞視為資源；永久統計數據不會取代定位。",
  "Treat each holding space as a scarce resource, not free storage.": "將每個儲存空間視為稀缺資源，而不是免費儲存。",
  "Treat moss stones as temporary obstacles that can leave with a completed line.": "將苔蘚石頭視為臨時障礙物，可以在完成路線後離開。",
  "Treat oxygen as a route budget. A high-loot cache is useful only if the remaining zones and possible escape still fit that budget.": "將氧氣視為路線預算。只有當剩餘區域和可能的逃生仍然符合預算時，高戰利品快取才有用。",
  "Treat the pale attack ring as a spacing guide and stay near its outer edge.": "將蒼白的攻擊環作為間距引導並保持在其外緣附近。",
  "Treats mix light, dark, and warm colors.": "混合淺色、深色和暖色。",
