  "Trial Marks, unlocked trials, selected hero, and permanent mastery are saved locally.": "試煉標記、解鎖的試煉、選定的英雄和永久掌握都保存在本地。",
  "Trial unlocks, Marks, Heart Mastery, and selected hero are saved locally; temporary blessings reset.": "試煉解鎖、印記、心術、所選英雄均保存在本地；暫時的祝福重置。",
  "Trial unlocks, Marks, Heart Mastery, and selected hero are saved locally. Temporary blessings reset each run.": "試煉解鎖、標記、心術掌握和所選英雄均保存在本地。每次運行都會重置臨時祝福。",
  "Trials 1-5 teach direct Scout pursuit and end with Shadow Prowler's warned shockwave.": "試煉 1-5 教導偵察兵直接追擊，並以暗影徘徊者的警告衝擊波結束。",
  "Trials 1-5, Rootwood:": "試驗 1-5，根伍德：",
  "Trials 11-15 add warned Boar charges. Magma Tusk Colossus resists damage until a charge creates an opening.": "試驗 11-15 增加警告野豬指控。岩漿獠牙巨像可以抵抗傷害，直到衝鋒造成開口。",
  "Trials 11-15, Ember Forge:": "試煉 11-15，灰燼熔爐：",
  "Trials 16-20 add distance-keeping Hunters and mixed approach angles. Eclipse Archowl fires timed volleys.": "試驗 16-20 增加了保持距離的獵人和混合接近角度。日蝕弓箭手發射定時齊射。",
  "Trials 16-20, Moon Range:": "試煉 16-20，月球範圍：",
  "Trials 21-25 overlap armor, charges, and range. Abyss Shell Leviathan summons two reinforcements below roughly half health.": "試驗 21-25 重疊裝甲、裝藥和射程。深淵貝殼利維坦召喚兩名生命值低於一半的援軍。",
  "Trials 21-25, Abyss Shell:": "試煉 21-25，深淵貝殼：",
  "Trials 26-30 combine all five families. Void Crown Emperor gains a guarded middle phase and calls Raven plus armored support in its final phase.": "試驗 26-30 結合了所有五個家庭。虛空王冠獲得了中間階段的防守，並在最後階段召喚烏鴉和裝甲支援。",
  "Trials 26-30, Void Crown:": "試煉 26-30，虛空冠：",
  "Trials 6-10 add curved Ravens and armor. Prism Basilisk alternates protected and open windows.": "試驗 6-10 添加了彎曲的烏鴉和盔甲。棱鏡蛇怪交替受保護和打開的窗口。",
