  "Turn": "轉",
  "Turn flow: select a living hero, then choose one action. Move to an adjacent legal cell, attack within range, Guard to reduce the next hit, or spend one Energy on a Skill. Lion strikes harder, Owl reaches two cells, and Turtle guards the group while healing one HP. After all living heroes act, or End Turn is pressed, enemies resolve and Energy returns by one up to three.": "回合流程：選擇一個活著的英雄，然後選擇一個動作。移動到相鄰的合法單元格，在範圍內攻擊，防禦以減少下一次攻擊，或在技能上花費一個能量。獅子攻擊更加猛烈，貓頭鷹到達兩個格子，烏龜守護隊伍，同時恢復一生命值。在所有活著的英雄行動後，或按下結束回合後，敵人會結算，能量會恢復一到三。",
  "Turn flow: select a living hero, then choose one action. Moving uses an adjacent legal cell. Attack requires the hero's range. Guard reduces the next enemy hit by one. A Skill spends one Energy: Lion strikes harder, Owl reaches a distant target, and Turtle guards every living hero while healing one HP. A hero is marked Done after acting. When every living hero has acted, or End Turn is pressed, all living enemies resolve their behavior and Energy returns by one up to three.": "回合流程：選擇一個活著的英雄，然後選擇一個動作。移動使用相鄰的合法單元格。攻擊需要英雄的射程。守衛使下一個被擊中的敵人減一。技能消耗 1 點能量：獅子攻擊更猛烈，貓頭鷹到達遠處目標，海龜守護每個活著的英雄，同時恢復 1 點生命值。英雄在表演後被標記為“完成”。當每個活著的英雄都行動起來，或按下結束回合時，所有活著的敵人都會解決他們的行為，並且能量會恢復一到三。",
  "Turn mirrors so warm sunlight reaches every sleeping plant.": "轉動鏡子，讓溫暖的陽光照射到每一棵沉睡的植物上。",
  "Turn over a second tile. Identical pictures become a completed pair; different pictures close after a short visible pause.": "翻轉第二塊磁磚。相同的圖片成為完整的一對；不同的圖片在短暫可見的停頓後關閉。",
  "Turn over one tile and remember its picture and position.": "翻轉一塊瓷磚並記住它的圖片和位置。",
  "Turn over two cards and match identical garden pictures.": "翻開兩張卡片並搭配相同的花園圖片。",
  "Turn Panko's bamboo pipes, carry water through every segment, and bring the flowering grove back to life.": "轉動 Panko 的竹管，將水輸送到各個部分，讓花林恢復生機。",
  "Turn sound on": "打開聲音",
  "Turn structure: a player turn restores Energy, clears temporary Block and draws three cards. Played or leftover cards enter the discard pile; when the draw pile empties, the discard pile is shuffled back. Visible intent identifies the enemy's next action unless fog is active.": "回合結構：玩家回合恢復能量，清除臨時障礙並抓三張牌。已打出的牌或剩餘的牌進入棄牌堆；當抽牌堆空時，棄牌堆被洗回。除非有霧，否則可見的意圖可以辨識敵人的下一步。",
  "Turn structure: a player turn restores Energy, clears temporary Block and draws three cards. Played or leftover cards enter the discard pile; when the draw pile empties, the discard pile is shuffled back. Visible intent identifies the enemy&#39;s next action unless fog is active.": "回合結構：玩家回合恢復能量，清除臨時障礙並抓三張牌。已打出的牌或剩餘的牌進入棄牌堆；當抽牌堆空時，棄牌堆被洗回。除非有霧，否則可見的意圖可以辨識敵人的下一步。",
  "Turn the bamboo. Let every drop reach the flowering grove.": "轉動竹子。讓每一滴水都到達花叢。",
  "Turn the tower. Read the landing. Keep the fall alive.": "轉塔。閱讀著陸。讓秋天保持活力。",
