  "Two bat bursts cross the center.": "兩支蝙蝠爆發穿過中心。",
  "Two bounces into a moving basket": "兩次彈入移動中的籃子",
  "Two bounces into a quick basket": "兩次彈入快速籃筐",
  "Two bounces, moving basket": "兩次彈跳，移動籃子",
  "Two bounces, reverse wind, moving basket": "兩次彈跳、逆風、移動籃子",
  "Two Care Choices": "兩種護理選擇",
  "Two clues, one priority": "兩條線索，一個優先事項",
  "Two deliveries with layered wind": "分層風的兩輪交貨",
  "Two deliveries, two wind plans": "兩次交付，兩個風電計劃",
  "Two different equipment pieces create a link when occupied cells with the same material tag touch horizontally or vertically. Active links add Attack and Defense.": "當具有相同材質標籤的佔用單元水平或垂直接觸時，兩個不同的設備部件會建立連結。活動連結添加攻擊和防禦。",
  "Two fruit share one moving basket": "兩種水果共用一個移動籃",
  "Two fruit with opposite winds": "兩種果子風向相反",
  "Two guardian sharks carry bonus relics.": "兩隻守護鯊魚帶著額外的聖物。",
  "Two hazards arrive together and leave one escape lane. Some later routes mark the safe opening with a star.": "兩種危險同時到來並留下一條逃生通道。後來的一些路線用星星標記了安全入口。",
  "Two hazards arrive together and leave one lane open. Move toward the empty lane; a star may mark that opening on some later routes.": "兩個危險同時到來，導致一條車道空出。向空車道行駛；稍後的一些路線上可能會用星星標記該開口。",
  "Two matching animals merge into the next one. Do not pass the line.": "兩隻配對的動物合併成下一隻。不要越線。",
  "Two or three fruit routes continue inside one Battle. Result waits until every delivery is complete.": "一場戰鬥中會延續兩到三條水果路線。結果等待，直到每次交付完成。",
  "Two or three fruit routes continue inside the same Battle. Result waits until every delivery is complete.": "同一場戰鬥中會延續兩到三條水果路線。結果等待，直到每次交付完成。",
  "Two queued recipes combine minimum groups and bonuses.": "兩個排隊的食譜結合了最低組數和獎金。",
  "Two queued trays use three-bubble groups and bonuses.": "兩個排隊的托盤使用三泡組和獎金。",
  "Two recipes also require a group of four.": "兩個食譜也需要四人一組。",
  "Two root lanes split the pack.": "兩個根車道分開了隊伍。",
  "Two safe lanes in a row grant bonus salvage.": "連續兩條安全車道可提供額外的救援獎勵。",
  "Two separate members of several species appear in one scene. Finding one fox, owl, lion, panda, penguin, or koala does not complete its partner at another location.": "多個物種的兩個不同成員出現在一個場景中。找到一隻狐狸、貓頭鷹、獅子、熊貓、企鵝或無尾熊並不能在另一個地方完成它的伴侶。",
  "Two situation icons appear together and one priority answer resolves the immediate problem. Mission 15 checks all paired patterns.": "兩個情況圖示同時出現，一個優先答案解決了當前的問題。任務 15 檢查所有配對模式。",
  "Two starred matching families are distributed through ocean boards. Board 15 deliberately begins with no matching free pair, teaching the truthful Shuffle recovery before its finale can be cleared.": "兩個帶有星標的匹配家庭透過海洋委員會進行分配。第 15 局故意以沒有匹配的自由對開始，在其結局被清除之前教導真實的洗牌恢復。",
  "Two to four bright cars introduce circles, squares, triangles, stars, diamonds, and hearts. Route 5 is the first Conductor Check.": "兩到四輛明亮的汽車引入了圓形、正方形、三角形、星形、菱形和心形。 5 號路線是第一個指揮檢查。",
  "Two unused boxes stay available for careful looking.": "留下兩個未使用的盒子可供仔細檢查。",
  "Two warning circles appear at mirrored positions.": "兩個警告圓圈出現在鏡像位置。",
  "Two-Bounce Crosswind": "兩次彈跳側風",
  "Two-bounce stages keep the basket inactive until the second leaf contact. Soft-leaf stages reduce the rebound height, which shortens the time available to move underneath the next fall. Multi-delivery picnic stages keep the same Battle open while a second or third fruit, animal, and rule appear. The Delivery counter advances, and Result waits until every listed route is complete.": "兩次彈跳階段使籃子保持靜止狀態，直到第二片葉子接觸為止。軟葉平台降低了反彈高度，從而縮短了下一次跌落時可在下方移動的時間。多次交付野餐階段使同一場戰鬥保持開放，同時出現第二或第三個水果、動物和規則。交付計數器前進，結果等待，直到每個列出的路線完成。",
  "Two-Clue Mix": "兩條線索混合",
  "Two-Fruit Picnic": "兩種水果野餐",
  "Two-Lane Footprints": "兩車道足跡",
  "Two-lane gates": "兩車道閘門",
  "Two-Layer Orchard": "兩層果園",
  "Two-map investigation": "兩張地圖調查",
  "Two-Step Routine": "兩步驟程序",
  "Two-Step Routine labels steps 1/2 and 2/2; a later tool chosen early counts as a retry.": "兩步驟例程標記步驟 1/2 和 2/2；早期選擇的較晚的工具算重試。",
  "Two-Step Routine:": "兩步驟程序：",
  "Two-Step Tray": "兩步驟托盤",
  "Two-Tray Brunch": "兩盤早午餐",
