  "Uguali o somma 10": "烏瓜利·索馬 10",
  "Ultimate": "終極版",
  "Ultimate rune": "終極符文",
  "Ultimo Bastione": "烏爾蒂莫·巴斯蒂奧內",
  "Um orbe de luz atingiu uma mina do vazio.": "um orbe de luz atingiu uma mina do vazio。",
  "Uma marmita vazia a mais": "烏瑪·瑪米塔·瓦齊亞·阿邁斯",
  "Umbral de Brasas": "烏布拉爾·德·布拉薩斯",
  "Umbral silencioso": "暗影沉默",
  "Umbrella": "雨傘",
  "Un bisogno chiaro": "一個比索諾基亞羅",
  "Un cliente se fue descontento.": "Un cliente se fue descontento。",
  "Un estrecho corredor de sombra separa las patrullas que se cruzan.": "Un estrecho corredor de sombra separa las patrullas que se cruzan。",
  "Un excavador avisa antes de subir o bajar un carril.": "Un excavador avisa antes de subir o bajar un carril。",
  "Un rebote tranquilo": "恢復平靜",
  "Una caja visible no tiene comida correspondiente.": "Una caja 可見，沒有任何通訊錄。",
  "Una necesidad clara": "克拉拉必需品",
  "Una sfera di luce ha colpito una mina del vuoto.": "Una sfera di Luce ha colpito una mina del vuoto。",
  "Unable to build level {value}": "無法建立關卡{value}",
  "Unavailable while silenced.": "靜音時不可用。",
  "UNBLOCK": "解鎖",
  "Unblock Trail": "暢通小徑",
  "Unblock Trail | WeightPlay": "暢通步道 | WeightPlay",
  "Unblock Trail game board": "解鎖小道遊戲板",
  "Unblock-Pfad": "解鎖-Pfad",
  "Under heavy gravity, aim earlier and avoid relying on a slow roll across the top of the pile.": "在重重力作用下，應儘早瞄準並避免依靠在堆頂上緩慢滾動。",
  "Under wind, watch the current direction before dropping onto a narrow target; the force affects moving balls, not just the preview.": "在有風的情況下，在落向狹窄的目標之前先觀察當前的方向；力影響移動的球，而不僅僅是預覽。",
  "Underleaf Ambush": "葉下伏擊",
  "Undo": "復原",
  "Undo a mistake instead of clearing the whole page.": "撤銷錯誤而不是清除整個頁面。",
  "Undo and Reset: Undo recomputes fruit, keys, gates, fragile visits, and weighted moves from the retained path; Reset rebuilds the whole trail.": "撤銷和重置：撤銷重新計算保留路徑中的水果、鑰匙、門、脆弱存取和加權移動；重置會重建整個路徑。",
  "Undo immediately when a match closes several useful paths; route state is restored too.": "當一場比賽關閉了幾條有用的路徑時立即撤消；路由狀態也恢復了。",
  "Undo is most useful immediately after a match closes several options. It restores the exact key, rescue, and patrol state, so progress remains consistent.": "在比賽關閉多個選項後立即撤消是最有用的。它恢復準確的按鍵、救援和巡邏狀態，因此進度保持一致。",
  "Undo is most useful immediately after a move closes an important lane; it restores the exact spawn as well as the board.": "在移動關閉重要通道後立即撤消是最有用的；它可以恢復精確的生成以及棋盤。",
  "Undo one exact move or ask Moon Cap Orla for a useful hint.": "撤銷一個精確的動作或向 Moon Cap Orla 詢問有用的提示。",
  "Undo path": "撤銷路徑",
  "Undo recomputes fruit, keys, opened gates, fragile visits, and weighted move cost from the retained route. It does not merely move the animal image backward. This keeps planning information truthful after a mistake.": "撤銷會重新計算保留路線的水果、鑰匙、打開的大門、脆弱的訪問和加權移動成本。它不僅僅是將動物形象向後移動。這可以在發生錯誤後保持計劃資訊的真實性。",
  "Undo removes the most recent step, Restart clears the current attempt, and Hint highlights one legal next star that still permits a complete solution. None of these actions spends currency. Keyboard, mouse, and touch share the same puzzle state.": "撤銷刪除最近的步驟，重新啟動清除目前嘗試，提示反白顯示仍允許完整解決方案的合法下一顆星。這些行動都不需要花費貨幣。鍵盤、滑鼠和觸控共享相同的拼圖狀態。",
  "Undo restores one exact transfer, Restart restores the authored opening, and Hint identifies a useful legal move. Clears, stars, unlocks, and best move counts are stored locally.": "撤銷可恢復一次精確的轉移，重新啟動可恢復所編寫的開局，提示可識別有用的合法移動。清除、星星、解鎖和最佳移動計數都儲存在本地。",
  "Undo restores one pair. Reorder rearranges only remaining values when available, while Restart restores the authored board.": "撤銷可恢復一對。重新排序僅重新排列可用的剩餘值，而重新啟動則恢復已創作的板。",
  "Undo restores one rotation, Restart restores the authored board, and Hint identifies a useful next correction without silently solving the network.": "撤銷恢復一次旋轉，重新啟動恢復編寫的板，提示識別有用的下一個更正，而無需默默地解決網路問題。",
  "Undo restores one slide, Hint identifies a useful block, and Restart restores the exact opening layout.": "撤銷可恢復一張投影片，提示可識別有用的區塊，而重新啟動可恢復準確的開啟佈局。",
  "Undo restores the previous board and move count. Restart rebuilds the same deterministic puzzle. Hint identifies one useful source and destination without moving the orbs. Stars compare the completed route with the stage target, and progress is stored locally.": "撤銷可恢復之前的棋盤和移動計數。重新啟動會重建相同的確定性難題。提示無需移動球體即可識別一個有用的來源和目的地。星星將完成的路線與階段目標進行比較，並將進度存放在本地。",
  "Undo restores the previous mark, Restart restores the authored puzzle, and Hint explains a forced deduction without changing the board.": "撤銷恢復之前的標記，重新啟動恢復編寫的謎題，提示解釋強制推論而不改變棋盤。",
