  "Unlocked and completed routes, the selected route, and the local Top 5 are stored in this browser.": "已解鎖和已完成的路線、已選擇的路線以及本地前 5 條路線都儲存在該瀏覽器中。",
  "Unlocked and completed stages, Workshop XP, discoveries, and best encounter progress are stored locally in this browser.": "已解鎖和已完成的階段、創意工坊 XP、發現和最佳遭遇進度都儲存在該瀏覽器本地。",
  "Unlocked and completed stages, Workshop XP, discoveries, and best progress are stored locally.": "已解鎖和已完成的階段、創意工坊 XP、發現和最佳進度都儲存在本地。",
  "Unlocked and saved · {balance} diamonds remain.": "解鎖並保存 · 剩餘 {balance} 鑽石。",
  "Unlocked animals appear in your expedition backpack. Permanent levels are saved locally.": "解鎖的動物會出現在您的探險背包中。永久級別保存在本地。",
  "Unlocked challenges and best stars are stored locally in this browser.": "解鎖的挑戰和最佳星星存儲在該瀏覽器本地。",
  "Unlocked missions and best stars stay in this browser. No account or personal information is required.": "解鎖的任務和最佳星星會保留在這個瀏覽器中。不需要帳戶或個人資訊。",
  "Unlocked missions are saved on this device.": "解鎖的任務保存在此裝置上。",
  "Unlocked missions stay available.": "解鎖的任務仍然可用。",
  "Unlocked missions, best medals, Moon Coins, and Safehouse progress are saved locally.": "解鎖的任務、最佳獎牌、月球幣和安全屋進度都保存在本地。",
  "Unlocked stages and personal best records are stored locally in this browser. Clearing site data removes them.": "解鎖的階段和個人最佳記錄儲存在該瀏覽器本地。清除網站資料會將其刪除。",
  "Unlocked stages and personal best records stay in this browser.": "解鎖的階段和個人最佳記錄保留在此瀏覽器中。",
  "Unlocked stages, best stars, stage score evidence, customer stamps, sticker count, play count, and best reached stage are stored locally in this browser. Sign-in is not required; clearing browser site data may remove those records.": "已解鎖的階段、最佳明星、階段得分證據、客戶印章、貼紙計數、播放計數和最佳到達階段都存放在該瀏覽器本地。無需登入；清除瀏覽器網站資料可能會刪除這些記錄。",
  "Unlocked stages, clears, best scores, medals, coins, and guard training are stored locally in this browser.": "解鎖的階段、通關、最佳成績、獎牌、硬幣和警衛訓練都存放在該瀏覽器本地。",
  "Unlocked stages, completed cards and best results are stored only in this browser.": "解鎖的階段、完成的卡片和最佳結果僅儲存在此瀏覽器中。",
  "Unlocked stages, completed cards, and best results are stored only in this browser.": "解鎖的階段、完成的卡片和最佳結果僅儲存在此瀏覽器中。",
  "Unlocked stages, stars, and best scores are stored in this browser without requiring login.": "解鎖的階段、星星和最佳成績都儲存在該瀏覽器中，無需登入。",
  "Unlocked to Stage {count}": "已解鎖至階段 {count}",
  "Unlocked trails and best stars are stored locally in this browser.": "解鎖的路線和最佳星星存放在該瀏覽器本地。",
  "Unlocked, completed, selected, and best-score data stay in this browser. Clearing browser storage removes them.": "已解鎖、已完成、已選擇和最佳得分的資料保留在此瀏覽器中。清除瀏覽器儲存空間會刪除它們。",
  "Unlocked: +1 starting Energy. Diamonds {before} → {after}.": "解鎖：+1 起始能量。鑽石{before}→{after}。",
  "Unlocks after Day {day}": "在 {day} 天後解鎖",
  "Unlocks and board records stay only in this browser; no account is required.": "解鎖和棋盤記錄僅保留在該瀏覽器中；無需帳戶。",
  "Unlocks helper strikes at Lv.2.": "在 Lv.2 解鎖輔助攻擊。",
  "Unlocks, best stars, scores, album rescues, and sound choice stay only in this browser.": "解鎖、最佳明星、樂譜、專輯救援和聲音選擇僅保留在此瀏覽器中。",
  "Unlocks, stars, scores, album rescues and sound choice stay only in this browser.": "解鎖、星星、樂譜、專輯救援和聲音選擇僅保留在此瀏覽器中。",
