  "Upgrade {gear} from Level {beforeLevel} to Level {afterLevel}. Spend {cost} Reef Notes. Balance {before} to {after}.": "將 {gear} 從等級 {beforeLevel} 升級到等級 {afterLevel}。花費 {cost} 礁石筆記。平衡 {before} 到 {after}。",
  "Upgrade {name} from Lv.{current} to Lv.{next}. {effect}. Cost {cost} upgrade point. Balance {balance} to {result}.": "將 {name} 從 Lv.{current} 升級到 Lv.{next}。 {effect}。花費 {cost} 升級點。平衡 {balance} 至 {result}。",
  "Upgrade {name} to Lv.{level}: ATK {nextAtk}, HP {nextHp} for {cost} Gold": "將{name}升級到Lv.{level}：ATK {nextAtk}，HP {nextHp}，獲得{cost}金等級",
  "Upgrade complete": "升級完成",
  "Upgrade Gate": "升級門",
  "Upgrade guards with coins. Unlock rare animals with diamonds.": "用金幣升級守衛。用鑽石解鎖稀有動物。",
  "Upgrade one anchor and add healing.": "升級一個錨並增加治療效果。",
  "Upgrade Points": "升級點數",
  "Upgrade reel control and line durability early if fish keep escaping.": "如果魚不斷逃跑，請儘早升級捲軸控制和線耐用性。",
  "Upgrade roles, not only one carry.": "升級角色，不只是一個Carry。",
