  "Victories award four to nine Trial Marks and unlock exactly the next trial. Heart Mastery costs five Marks for the first level and four more for each later level; every level gives all heroes 12 additional maximum health.": "勝利會獎勵四到九個試煉標記，並解鎖下一次試煉。掌握心靈，第一級需要花費 5 馬克，後面每級需要花費 4 馬克；每個等級都會為所有英雄提供 12 點額外的最大生命值。",
  "Victory": "勝利",
  "Victory grants XP and Runes. XP raises Squad Level; Runes upgrade the three heroes to Level 6. A saved Rune Reward adds attack, health, 35 XP, starting Energy or a future half-health revive. Optional three-Diamond rerolls and the 18-Diamond Training Slot never unlock missions or Bosses.": "勝利可獲得經驗值和符文。 XP 提升小隊等級；符文將三位英雄升級到 6 級。保存的符文獎勵會增加攻擊力、生命值、35 XP、起始能量或未來的半生命值復活。可選的 3 鑽石重新滾動和 18 鑽石訓練槽永遠不會解鎖任務或 Boss。",
