  "Visible search time has no failure limit. It records only time when the habitat is active; switching apps or hiding the page pauses the measurement. A completed result compares the run with the same habitat's local best.": "可見搜尋時間沒有失敗限制。它只記錄棲息地活躍的時間；切換應用程式或隱藏頁面會暫停測量。完整的結果將跑步與相同棲息地的當地最佳成績進行比較。",
