  "Warden Steps": "典獄長台階",
  "Wards cancel a fixed number of projectile hits, slow reduces movement briefly, and silence pauses automatic attacks. None removes steering control.": "守衛會取消固定數量的投射物命中，緩慢地短暫減少移動，沉默會暫停自動攻擊。沒有一個會取消轉向控制。",
  "Warehouse floor: Rux may walk here; rubble walls block both Rux and cargo.": "倉庫層：Rux可以走到這裡；瓦礫牆擋住了魯克斯和貨物。",
