  "WASD / Arrow keys": "WASD / 箭頭鍵",
  "WASD / Flechas": "WASD / 弗萊查斯",
  "Watch cleared snacks disappear together, then use the falling refill to prepare cascades.": "看著清除的零食一起消失，然後使用掉落的補充裝備瀑布。",
  "Watch closely. The cards will hide soon!": "仔細觀察。卡片很快就會隱藏起來！",
  "Watch Done markers and the selected hero panel. End Turn early only when preserving position is safer than using every action.": "觀看“完成”標記和選定的英雄面板。只有在保持位置比使用每個動作更安全時才儘早結束轉彎。",
  "Watch Done markers. End Turn early only when preserving position is safer than another action.": "觀看“完成”標記。僅當保持位置比其他行動更安全時才提前結束轉彎。",
  "Watch for quick direction changes and slide back gently.": "注意方向的快速變化並輕輕向後滑動。",
  "Watch four pairs before every card turns over.": "在每張牌翻開之前觀察四對。",
  "Watch NEXT INTENT. Rabbit heals; claw empowers the enemy.": "觀看下一個意圖。兔子痊癒；利爪賦予敵人力量。",
  "Watch patrol sight circles and the Alert meter. Enter a cyan shadow circle when a bell, spotlight, or crossing patrol makes open movement unsafe.": "觀察巡邏視線和警報計。當鈴聲、聚光燈或路口巡邏使開放移動不安全時，進入青色陰影圈。",
  "Watch rival routes in later chapters because they can remove the easy objects you intended to use.": "在後面的章節中觀察競爭對手的路線，因為它們可以刪除您打算使用的簡單物件。",
  "Watch the downward path rather than chasing the orb after it has already reached the paddle.": "觀察向下的路徑，而不是在球體已經到達槳後追逐球體。",
  "Watch the ground and the enemies together. Dashed hazard outlines are warnings; filled bright lanes are active. A Boss shield ring means ordinary slashes are strongly reduced until its counter window opens.": "一起觀察地面和敵人。虛線危險輪廓是警告；充滿的明亮車道處於活動狀態。 Boss 護盾環意味著普通的斬擊會被強烈減少，直到它的櫃檯窗口打開。",
  "Watch the lane warning and prepare before fast beasts enter.": "留意車道警告並在快速野獸進入之前做好準備。",
  "Watch the moving sight circles and Alert meter. A patrol that remains close to Fia raises Alert; reaching clear space or entering a cyan shadow shelter lets the meter fall.": "觀察移動的瞄準圈和警報計。靠近國際汽聯的巡邏隊發出警報；到達空曠空間或進入青色陰影庇護所會使儀表下降。",
  "Watch the nearest scan marker approach the spirit's action line.": "觀察最近的掃描標記接近靈魂的行動線。",
  "Watch the wheel rotate and compare the vehicle's response with the terrain cue.": "觀察車輪旋轉並將車輛的反應與地形提示進行比較。",
  "Watch the wind; flying bubbles drift sideways": "觀察風向；飛行的氣泡向側面漂移",
  "Watch three reel strips stop in sequence: lions multiply attack, turtles multiply defense, rabbit gems heal, and dormant stones are blank while one to three monsters fight back across 30 battles.": "觀看三個捲軸條按順序停止：獅子增加攻擊力，海龜增加防禦力，兔子寶石治愈，休眠寶石空白，而一到三個怪物在 30 場戰鬥中反擊。",
  "Watch which bubbles will fall into the cleared cells and use non-order groups only when they create a stronger route.": "觀察哪些氣泡會落入已清除的單元格中，並且僅在它們創建更強的路線時才使用無序組。",
  "Watch wind direction before committing to a narrow landing.": "在進行狹窄著陸之前觀察風向。",
  "Watcher Mark": "觀察者馬克",
  "Watcher Mark targeted {hero}.": "觀察者馬克的目標是{hero}。",
  "Watcher Perch": "觀察者鱸魚",
  "Water": "水",
  "WATER": "水",
  "Water cools Emberlight into steam. A Shell Ward protects Taro once. Keys open matching rune pins.": "水將餘燼光冷卻成蒸氣。貝殼守衛曾經保護過太郎。鑰匙可開啟符合的符文別針。",
  "Watermelon": "西瓜",
