  "Zero retries awards three stars, a small number awards two, and additional retries award one. The Result Skill Report uses actual matches, first tries, retries and boarded passengers.": "零重試獎勵三顆星，少量重試獎勵兩顆星，額外重試獎勵一星。結果技能報告使用實際比賽、首次嘗試、重試和登機的乘客。",
  "Zero retries awards three stars, a small number of retries awards two, and additional retries award one. Stars and the highest unlocked route are stored only in this browser.": "零次重試獎勵三顆星，少量重試獎勵兩顆星，額外重試獎勵一星。星星和最高的解鎖路線僅儲存在此瀏覽器中。",
  "Zero retries earns three stars, one or two earns two, and more retries earns one.": "零次重試獲得三顆星，一兩次重試獲得兩顆星，更多重試獲得一顆星。",
  "Zero retries earns three stars, one or two retries earns two, and more retries earns one.": "零次重試將獲得三顆星，一兩次重試將獲得兩顆星，更多次重試將獲得一顆星。",
