  "Zoo Helper Day": "動物園助手日",
  "Zoo Helper Day - How to Play": "動物園助手日 - 如何玩",
  "Zoo Helper Day - WeightPlay": "動物園助手日 - WeightPlay",
  "Zoo Helper Day game guide": "動物園助手日遊戲指南",
  "Zoo Helper Day is a free bilingual Kids care game with 30 saved shifts across six animal zones. Children help a lion, panda, elephant, penguin, giraffe and koala with fruit, leaves, fish, water, brushes, showers, toys and balls. Early shifts name one exact item. Later chapters remove visible labels, accept a matching care category, briefly hide a request that can be shown again, or require two steps in order. Every fifth shift is a Keeper Check. There is no countdown, and a wrong item keeps the request open.": "Zoo Helper Day 是一款免費的雙語兒童護理遊戲，已保存 6 個動物區域的 30 個班次。孩子們用水果、樹葉、魚、水、刷子、淋浴、玩具和球幫助獅子、熊貓、大象、企鵝、長頸鹿和無尾熊。早班會說出一件具體的事情。後面的章節會刪除可見標籤，接受配對的護理類別，短暫隱藏可以再次顯示的請求，或需要依序執行兩個步驟。每第五次輪班進行一次保管員檢查。沒有倒數計時，錯誤的項目會使請求保持開啟。",
  "Zoo Helper Day is a free bilingual Kids care game with 30 saved shifts across six animal zones. Children help a lion, panda, elephant, penguin, giraffe, and koala by choosing or dragging pictures of fruit, leaves, fish, water, brushes, showers, toys, and balls. Early shifts name one exact item. Later chapters remove visible item labels, ask for a care category with more than one valid answer, briefly hide a request that can be shown again, or require two care steps in the correct order. Every fifth shift is a friendly Keeper Check. There is no countdown, and a wrong item keeps the same request open for another try.": "Zoo Helper Day 是一款免費的雙語兒童護理遊戲，已保存 6 個動物區域的 30 個班次。孩子們透過選擇或拖曳水果、樹葉、魚、水、刷子、淋浴、玩具和球的圖片來幫助獅子、熊貓、大象、企鵝、長頸鹿和無尾熊。早班會說出一件具體的事情。後面的章節會刪除可見的項目標籤，詢問具有多個有效答案的護理類別，短暫隱藏可以再次顯示的請求，或要求按正確順序執行兩個護理步驟。每第五次輪班都會有一次友好的守護者檢查。沒有倒數計時，錯誤的項目會保留相同的請求以供再次嘗試。",
  "Zoo Helper Day is a gentle zoo workday game where children help different animal zones earn tickets and keep visitors happy. Each stage is framed like a small zoo shift, with simple picture-based care actions, large touch targets, and friendly feedback so young players can understand the goal without heavy reading. It is designed to feel more like running a tiny zoo than only picking a helper item.": "《動物園助手日》是一款溫和的動物園工作日遊戲，孩子們可以幫助不同的動物區賺取門票，讓遊客開心。每個階段的框架就像一個小型動物園輪班，具有簡單的基於圖片的護理動作、大型觸摸目標和友好的反饋，因此年輕玩家無需大量閱讀即可理解目標。它的設計感覺更像是經營一個小動物園，而不僅僅是挑選一個輔助物品。",
  "Zoo Helper Day may support picture recognition, broad care categories, short working memory, sequencing, focus and hand-eye coordination. Adults can explain that real animals need trained keepers, suitable diets, habitats, enrichment and veterinary support beyond this simplified game. Stars and Skill Report are play feedback, not a grade, diagnosis or child comparison. Progress stays in this browser. No child profile is required, and the Kids route requests no advertising.": "動物園助手日可能支持圖片識別、廣泛的護理類別、短工作記憶、排序、焦點和手眼協調。成年人可以解釋說，除了這個簡化的遊戲之外，真正的動物還需要訓練有素的飼養員、合適的飲食、棲息地、豐富的環境和獸醫支持。星級和技能報告是遊戲回饋，而不是成績、診斷或兒童比較。進度保留在此瀏覽器中。不需要兒童資料，兒童路線不需要廣告。",
  "Zoo Helper Day may support picture recognition, broad care categories, short working memory, simple sequencing, focus, and hand-eye coordination. An adult can name each picture and talk about how real animals need trained keepers, suitable diets, clean habitats, enrichment, and veterinary support beyond this simplified game. Stars and the Skill Report describe only the current play session; they are not a school grade, health claim, developmental diagnosis, or comparison with other children. Progress remains in the current browser and can disappear when local storage is cleared. No child profile is required, and the Kids route requests no advertising.": "動物園助手日可能支持圖片識別、廣泛的護理類別、短工作記憶、簡單的排序、專注和手眼協調。成年人可以為每張圖片命名，並談論除了這個簡化的遊戲之外，真實的動物如何需要訓練有素的飼養員、合適的飲食、清潔的棲息地、豐富的環境和獸醫的支持。星星和技能報告僅描述當前的遊戲會話；它們不是學校成績、健康聲明、發展診斷或與其他兒童的比較。進度保留在目前瀏覽器中，並且在清除本機儲存後可能會消失。不需要兒童資料，兒童路線不需要廣告。",
